ells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools, in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill in these schools.":"提升大地魔法技能会提升大地魔法法术的成功率和法术威力。许多法术属于多个魔法流派， 对于这类法术，法术的成功率和法术威力由这些流派的技能平均值决定。","Earth Magic contains spells able to deal large amounts of direct physical damage, which cannot be resisted like fire, cold and lightning damage can. It is also linked with Alchemy, with spells to liquefy the earth around you, or to turn your enemies to stone. Being skilled in Earth Magic increases the success rate and spell power of spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools, in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill in these schools.":"大地魔法包含能直接造成大量物理伤害的法术； 这种伤害无法像火焰、寒冷和闪电伤害那样被抗性抵挡。 大地魔法也与炼金术相关，其中的法术可以液化身边的土地，或将敌人石化。 提升大地魔法技能会提升大地魔法法术的成功率和法术威力。许多法术属于多个魔法流派， 对于这类法术，法术的成功率和法术威力由这些流派的技能平均值决定。","Your Invocations skill affects the likelihood that an attempt to use divine abilities with certain gods will be successful, and often the power of such abilities.":"祈神技能会影响使用某些神祇赐予的能力时的成功率，通常也会影响其威力。","{{ if you.race() ~= \"Djinni\" then return \"The Invocations skill also affects your magical reserves, \" .. \"but to a lesser degree than the Spellcasting skill. Only the \" .. \"higher contribution is used.\" end }}":"{{ if you.race() ~= \"Djinni\" then return \"祈神技能也会影响你的法力储备，\" .. \"但影响程度不如施法能力。只会采用两者中较高的加成。\" end }}","Your Invocations skill affects the likelihood that an attempt to use divine abilities with certain gods will be successful, and often the power of such abilities. {{ if you.race() ~= \"Djinni\" then return \"The Invocations skill also affects your magical reserves, \" .. \"but to a lesser degree than the Spellcasting skill. Only the \" .. \"higher contribution is used.\" end }}":"祈神技能会影响使用某些神祇赐予的能力时的成功率，通常也会影响其威力。 {{ if you.race() ~= \"Djinni\" then return \"祈神技能也会影响你的法力储备，\" .. \"但影响程度不如施法能力。只会采用两者中较高的加成。\" end }}","Evocations skill affects your ability to use magical items like wands and other uncommon objects, increasing the power or success rate of such items.":"魔力释放技能会影响你使用魔法物品（例如魔杖和其他不常见物品）的能力， 提升这些物品的威力或使用成功率。","Shapeshifting enables the use of magical talismans to change oneself into other forms. Sufficient skill allows one to use more powerful forms without gravely damaging one's health. Being skilled in Shapeshifting also makes most forms somewhat stronger, in ways which vary between forms.":"变形术技能使你能用魔法护符改变自身形态。 技能足够熟练时，可以使用更强大的形态而不会严重损害生命值。 精通变形术也能让大多数形态变得更强，具体效果因形态而异。","Forgecraft is the art of shaping tangible objects out of magic. Forgecraft spells can construct a wide array of mechanical creatures that will fight alongside the caster, as well as create traps and barricades and even turn the physical resilience of one's armour into a weapon.":"锻造术是一种将魔法塑造成实体物品的艺术。锻造术法术可以构建各种机械生物， 与施法者并肩作战，也可以制造陷阱和路障，甚至将护甲的物理韧性转化为武器。","Being skilled in Forgecraft increases the success rate and spell power of spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools, in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill in these schools.":"精通锻造术可以提高该学派法术的成功率和法术威力。许多法术属于多个学派， 在这种情况下，施法成功率和威力将取决于这些学派的平均技能水平。","Forgecraft is the art of shaping tangible objects out of magic. Forgecraft spells can construct a wide array of mechanical creatures that will fight alongside the caster, as well as create traps and barricades and even turn the physical resilience of one's armour into a weapon. Being skilled in Forgecraft increases the success rate and spell power of spells in this school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools, in which case spellcasting success and power will depend on the average skill in these schools.":"锻造术是一种将魔法塑造成实体物品的艺术。锻造术法术可以构建各种机械生物， 与施法者并肩作战，也可以制造陷阱和路障，甚至将护甲的物理韧性转化为武器。 精通锻造术可以提高该学派法术的成功率和法术威力。许多法术属于多个学派， 在这种情况下，施法成功率和威力将取决于这些学派的平均技能水平。","Xom snickers.":"佐姆窃笑着。","\"How about this?\"":"“这个怎么样？”","\"Let's try an experiment, hmmm?\"":"“我们来