he audience for the floor's solo!":"佐姆为这个楼层准备好了独奏的观众！","Xom feels like this meagre party needs more guests.":"佐姆觉得这个寒酸的小聚会需要更多的客人。","Xom sends out highly concerning invitations.":"佐姆发出了极其令人不安的邀请函。","Xom demands a dramatic dialogue!":"佐姆要求一场戏剧性的对话！","Xom grants a terrible voice to the voiceless.":"佐姆赐予了无声者一个可怕的声音。","\"Go forth and destroy!\"":"“去毁灭吧!”","\"Go forth and cause havoc, mortal!\"":"“去制造浩劫吧，凡人！”","@Xom potion effect@":"@Xom potion effect@","\"See what I see, my child!\"":"“见我所能见到的，我的孩子！”","Xom grants you insight.":"佐姆赐予你洞察力。","Xom smirks.":"佐姆得意地笑着。","Xom's power flows through you!":"佐姆的力量在你身上流动！","Xom plays with reality for a moment.":"有那么一会儿，佐姆玩弄了一下现实。","Xom guffaws.":"佐姆狂笑着。","\"Go forth and redecorate, my child!\"":"“去重新装点周围环境吧，我的孩子！”","\"This place needs a little more atmosphere.\"":"“这个地方需要营造一点儿氛围。”","\"Hum-dee-hum-dee-hum...\"":"“哼，该死的……”","Xom's power touches your surroundings.":"佐姆的力量触动了附近的一个怪物。","You hear Xom's avuncular chuckle.":"你听到佐姆慈爱的轻笑声。","@Xom good monster polymorph@":"@Xom good monster polymorph@","Xom recounts a horror story in an instant.":"佐姆在一瞬间复述了一个恐怖故事。","Xom joyfully recalls the collapse of multiple Dungeon civilisations.":"佐姆愉快地回忆起了多个副本文明的崩溃。","\"You need some minor adjustments, mortal!\"":"“你需要稍微调整一下，凡人！”","\"Let me alter your pitiful body.\"":"“让我来改变你那可怜的身体吧。”","You hear Xom's maniacal cackling.":"你听到佐姆疯狂的咯咯笑声。","With a gout of [@rainbow_colour@|@misc_colour@] light, Xom rebuilds you.":"伴随着一阵 [@rainbow_colour@|@misc_colour@] 光芒，佐姆重塑了你的身体。","\"You need some minor improvements, mortal!\"":"“你需要一些小小的提升，凡人！”","\"Let me alter your body.\"":"“让我来改变你的身体吧。”","Xom's power brushes against you for a moment.":"有那么一会儿，佐姆的力量轻拂过你。","With a flash of [@rainbow_colour@|@misc_colour@] light, Xom rebuilds you.":"伴随着一阵 [@rainbow_colour@|@misc_colour@] 光芒，佐姆重塑了你的身体。","The area is suffused with divine lightning!":"这片区域充满了神圣的闪电！","Xom hurls blasts of lightning!":"佐姆投掷出闪电的冲击波！","\"Ready, aim, fire!\"":"\"预备，瞄准，开火！\"","Xom transforms those around you.":"佐姆改变了你周围的怪物。","\"I like them better like this.\"":"“我更喜欢他们这样。”","\"Never liked these squiggly things.\"":"“我从来不喜欢这些扭曲的东西。”","Xom touches your surroundings.":"佐姆接触你周围的环境。","Xom [gleefully|mirthfully] wrecks local arachnid artwork.":"佐姆[欢快地|乐呵呵地]摧毁了当地的蛛形纲艺术品。","The light of Xom [brushes upon|sweeps through] your surroundings.":"佐姆的光芒[轻拂着|扫过]你的周围环境。","@Xom fake destruction@":"@Xom fake destruction@","\"Burn, baby, burn!\"":"“燃烧，宝贝，燃烧！”","\"Ka-boom!\"":"“嘭！”","Xom calls forth mighty explosions.":"佐姆激发了巨大的爆炸。","Xom rains down devastation!":"佐姆将灾难倾泻而下！","Xom sneezes violently.":"佐姆猛地打了个喷嚏。","\"Feel my power!\"":"“感受我的力量！”","Xom gives a demonstration of destructive might.":"佐姆展示了毁灭性的力量。","\"Let it end in hellfire!\"":"“让一切在深渊之火中终结吧！”","Xom drops down a force battalion!":"佐姆投下了一支力量营！","Xom calls in the force cavalry!":"佐姆召唤了一支力量骑兵队！","Xom lights up the force fireworks!":"佐姆点燃了力量烟花！","Xom launches an entire fire-cart's barrage!":"佐姆发射了整整一火车的弹幕！","Xom manifests dramatic pipe organ chords!":"佐姆奏响了气势恢宏的管风琴和弦！","\"Oops, I didn't mean to do that!\"":"“哎呀，我不是故意的！”","\"How'd that happen? Weird.\"":"“那是怎么回事？奇怪。”","\"Let me repair your body.\"":"“让我来修复你的身体。”","Xom tricks Death into leaving you alone.":"佐姆欺骗了死神，把你留了下来。","Xom's maniacal laughter scares Death away.":"佐姆疯狂的笑声把死神吓跑了。","Xom's power revives you.":"佐姆的力量使你恢复生机。","Xom brings you back to life.":"佐姆让你起死回生。","\"Toy, don't you die on me yet!\"":"“玩具，你先别死在我的眼前！”","Xom saves you before everything goes @mono_colour@.":"在一切变成 @mono_colour@ 之前，佐姆救了你。","\"One more [life|try|go].\"":"“再[活|试|出发]一次。”","Xom changes the scenery.":"佐姆改变了场景。","Xom pokes at a nearby @staircase@.":"佐姆戳了戳附近的 @staircase@。","Xom pushes on a nearby @staircase@.":"佐姆推了推附近的 @staircase@。","Xom pulls on a nearby @staircase@.":"佐姆拉了拉附近的 @staircase@。","\"Tag, you're it!\"":"“抓到你了！”","@Xom good enchant monster@":"@Xom good enchant monster@","\"Witness the rise of a true [hero|champion]!\"":"\"见证一位真正的 [英雄|冠军] 崛起！\"","Xom demands grand glory in combat!":"佐姆要求在战斗中获得崇高的荣耀！","