咯笑！","Xom snickers!":"佐姆窃笑着！","Xom laughs nastily!":"佐姆恶意地笑着！","Xom howls with laughter!":"佐姆开怀大笑！","Xom bursts into laughter!":"佐姆发出一阵大笑！","Xom giggles madly!":"佐姆疯狂地咯咯笑！","Xom titters!":"佐姆咯咯地笑着！","Xom chuckles heartily!":"佐姆关切地轻笑着！","Xom chortles!":"佐姆咯咯地欢笑！","{{":"{{","if you.piety_rank() > 4 then":"if you.piety_rank() > 4 then","return \"teddy bear\"":"return \"玩具熊\"","elseif you.piety_rank() > 2 then":"elseif you.piety_rank() > 2 then","return \"toy\"":"return \"玩具\"","else":"else","return \"plaything\"":"return \"玩物\"","end":"end","}}":"}}","\"Amen!\"":"“阿门！”","\"Glory to Zin!\"":"“荣耀归于辛！”","\"And thus was it written.\"":"“经文如此写道。”","\"So sayeth Zin.\"":"“辛言道。”","\"Purity be upon you all.\"":"“愿你纯洁。”","\"Written in blood; sealed by your death.\"":"“以血书写；以你的死为印戳。”","\"From Zin's mouth, by Zin's hand.\"":"“从辛的口，经辛的手。”","\"Thus shall it ever be.\"":"“它将永远如此。”","\"In fire! In pain!\"":"“经受火焰！经受痛楚！”","\"Attack, my last stalwart servants!\"":"“进攻，我最后的坚定仆从！”","Ignis wails with rage, and rains down burning fury!":"伊格尼斯哀号着，狂怒倾泻而出！","Ignis calls forth spirits of fire to unmake you!":"伊格尼斯召唤火之灵来毁灭你！","\"Burn! Burn until nothing is left!\"":"“燃烧吧！烧到什么都不剩！”","\"These will know how to inflict the punishment due to you!\"":"“他们会知道如何惩罚你！”","\"Betrayer! Apostate! Perish!\"":"“叛徒！变节者！毁灭吧！”","\"With a thousand fires I burned cities, but these will suffice for you!\"":"“我曾用一千场火来烧毁城市，但只用这些来对付你也足够了！”","\"My hands, my teeth, my burning tears: these will never betray me!\"":"“我的手，我的牙齿，我灼热的泪水：这些永远不会背叛我！”","w:40":"w:40","\"Kill. Kill. Kill!\"":"\"杀。杀。杀！\"","\"More. More. More!\"":"\"更多。更多。更多！\"","\"Another! And another! And another!\"":"\"再来！再来！再来！\"","\"Slaughter. Them. All!\"":"“屠杀。他们。全部！”","\"Everything deserves to die!\"":"“一切都该死！”","Ashenzari says: Partake of my vision. Partake of my curse.":"艾申扎利说：分享我的视野。分担我的诅咒。","Beogh says: Do not betray your orcish brethren!":"比欧弗说：不要背叛你的兽人兄弟！","Beogh says: Show the world what it means to be an orc!":"比欧弗说：向世界展示做一名兽人意味着什么！","Beware that a challenger has come seeking you in battle. Prove your devotion to me! Unite all my children beneath one banner!":"小心，有一个挑战者前来与你战斗了。证明你对我的虔诚！将我所有的孩子团结在同一面旗帜下！","The time has come, seeker, to test your mettle in combat. Prove yourself an orc! Join your true people!":"是时候了，探索者，在战斗中考验你的勇气。证明你是个真正的兽人！加入你真正的同胞！","Screw your courage to the sticking place, and face a challenge. Fight to survive! In the great war, all will be orcs!":"把你的勇气拧到最紧，迎接挑战。为生存而战！在那场伟大的战争中，所有人都将是兽人！","Cheibriados says: Don't be so hasty!":"切布理亚多说：不要那么仓促！","Cheibriados says: Take it easy.":"切布理亚多说：慢慢来。","Cheibriados appreciates the motionlessness of death.":"切布理亚多欣赏死亡的静止。","Dithmenos says: Walk in the dark places.":"迪斯姆诺说：行于黑暗之处。","Elyvilon says: Be more diligent in your ministrations.":"艾利维隆说：你在照料的时候要更勤奋。","Elyvilon says: Go forth and aid the weak!":"艾利维隆说：去救助弱者吧！","Fedhas protests your encroaching upon nature.":"费德哈抗议你侵犯自然。","Fedhas says: Spread life and death.":"费德哈说：散播生命和死亡。","Fedhas appreciates your contribution to the ecosystem.":"费德哈感谢你对生态系统做出的贡献。","Gozag says: Greed is good.":"哥萨戈说：贪婪是好的。","Hepliaklqana says: Your past becomes your present!":"惠普利亚卡纳：你的过去变成了你的现在！","Hepliaklqana delivers you to your ancestors.":"惠普利亚卡纳把你带到你的先祖那里。","The flames of Ignis gently warm you.":"伊格尼斯的火焰柔和地温暖着你。","Ignis goes out, and joins you in death.":"伊格尼斯寂灭了，和你一起走向死亡。","Slime for the Slime God!":"黏液效忠黏液神！","Long live the new flesh!":"新肉体万岁！","Jiyva sends a jelly to digest your remains.":"吉瓦派来一个胶冻来消化你的尸体。","@Jiyva death corpse@":"@Jiyva death corpse@","Jiyva sends a jelly to digest your equipment.":"吉瓦派来一个胶冻来消化你的装备。","Kikubaaqudgha says: Spread unending ruin and despair!":"奇库巴库哈说：散播无尽的毁灭与绝望！","Kikubaaqudgha rasps: You have failed me! Welcome... death!":"奇库巴库哈厉声说：你让我失望了！欢迎……死亡！","Kikubaaqudgha rasps: You have failed me! Welcome... oblivion!":"奇库巴库哈厉声说：你让我失望了！欢迎……湮灭！","@Kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead@":"@Kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead@","Lugonu says: Spread carnage and corruption!":"卢格努说：散布屠杀和腐化！","Lugonu says: Depar