ays, \"Missed me!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"没打中！\"","@The_monster@ ducks and says, \"Too high!\"":"@The_monster@ 俯身躲过，说：\"太高了！\"","@The_monster@ dodges and says, \"Too slow!\"":"@The_monster@ 闪身避开，说：\"太慢了！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to sneak away.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 试图悄悄溜走。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to blend into @possessive@ surroundings.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 试图融入 @possessive@ 所处的环境。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ whispers something so quietly that you cannot hear @objective@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 轻声说了些什么，轻得你听不到 @objective@。","VISUAL:For a moment, you lose track of @the_monster@.":"VISUAL:你一时失去了 @the_monster@ 的踪影。","@The_monster@ whispers, \"Be very very quiet, I'm hunting @player_genus_plural@.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 低语道：\"悄悄地，悄悄地，我在猎杀 @player_genus_plural@。\" @player_only@","VISUAL:For a moment, @the_monster@ blends into the shadows.":"VISUAL:@the_monster@ 一时融入黑暗之中。","@The_monster@ says, \"You can hit me, but you can't hurt me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你能打中我，但伤不了我。\"","@The_monster@ sneers, \"Only the weak need weapons.\"":"@The_monster@ 嘲讽道：\"只有弱者才需要武器。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ feints to the [left|right].":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 向[左|右]虚晃了一招。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ assumes a wrestling stance.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 摆出摔跤架势。","@The_monster@ says, \"I break bones and crack skulls... with my bare hands.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我以赤手空拳……断骨碎颅。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ swings @possessive@ fists at you. @player_only@":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 向你挥动@possessive@拳头。 @player_only@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ flexes @possessive@ fingers.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 活动着 @possessive@手指。","@The_monster@ says, \"I have spells for any situation.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我有什么情况都能应付的法术。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I am proof that knowledge is power.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我就是知识即力量的证明。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Watch and be amazed!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"瞪大眼睛看好了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I practised a lot since I died.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我死后练习了很多。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ fingertips begin to glow.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@指尖开始发光。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ frowns in concentration.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 皱着眉头，全神贯注。","@The_monster@ says, \"I am smarter than you!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我比你聪明！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ takes aim.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 瞄准了你。","@The_monster@ says, \"I will blast you to bits.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我要把你炸成碎片。\"","@The_monster@ [adeptly chants|mispronounces] a nearly unspeakable incantation.":"@The_monster@ [熟练地吟诵|念错]了一段几乎无法言说的咒语。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ is bathed in the radiant lights of Iskenderun.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 沐浴在伊斯肯德伦的璀璨光辉中。","VISUAL:Energy condenses in front of @the_monster@, but quickly dissipates.":"VISUAL:能量在 @the_monster@ 面前凝聚，但随即消散。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will soon be helpless to avoid my power.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"很快你就会无力抵抗我的力量。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"When I snap my fingers, you will think you are a chicken.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"等我打个响指，你就会以为自己是一只鸡。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"It's dangerous to adventure alone.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"独自冒险可是很危险的。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ pulls a quokka out of @possessive@ cap.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 从 @possessive@帽子里拽出了一只短尾矮袋鼠。","@The_monster@ points @at_foe@ and yells, \"Attack!\"":"@The_monster@ 指着 @foe@ 大喊道：\"攻击！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Death will end your pain.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"死亡会终结你的痛苦。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Don't worry, I won't let your corpse go to waste.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"别担心，我不会浪费你的尸体。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"After I kill you, I will kill you again.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"杀了你之后，我会再杀你一次。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I need your bones for a spell of mine.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我需要你的骨头来施展一道法术。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ flickers in and out of reality.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 在现实中忽隐忽现。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ is wreathed in a cloud of translocational energy.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 被一团传送能量所环绕。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ blinks @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 朝 @foe@ 眨了眨眼。","@The_monster@ says, \"I love the smell of burning flesh.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我喜欢烧焦皮肉的味道。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Would you like to be cremated?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"想要火葬吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't worry, you'll be warm in a moment.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"别担心，马上你就暖和了。\"","VISUAL:A chill runs down your spine. @player_only@":"VISUAL:一股寒意沿着你的脊背蔓延。 @player_only@","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I hope the next monster to meet you likes frozen food!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"希望下一个遇到你的怪物喜欢冷冻食品！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"An ice sculpture of you would look very nice here.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"把你做成冰雕放在这儿应该挺好看。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ is surrounded by a shower of sparks.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 被一阵火花所包围。","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm really charged up about this fight.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我对这场战斗充满了激情。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Resistance is futile!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"抵抗是徒劳的！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A rolling stone gathers plenty of @foe_name@.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"滚石总能滚到一大票 @foe_name@。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"All of the earth is under my command.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"大地万物皆听我号令。\"","VISUAL:The earth trembles for a moment.":"VISUAL:大地震颤了一瞬。","@The_monster@ says, \"A minor scratch like that one is certainly harmless.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这种小擦伤当然无伤大雅。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Go ahead. Run away.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"跑吧，尽管跑。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It doesn't matter if you kill me. You'll still die.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"杀了我又如何。你还是会死。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Don't move, or the poison will kill you faster.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"别动，不然毒会蔓延得更快。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I don't need to breathe anymore, but you do!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我已经不需要呼吸了，但你还得喘气！\"","@The_monster@ curses the gods.":"@The_monster@ 诅咒诸神。","@The_monster@ says, \"This is what relying on the gods got me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这就是依靠神祇的下场。\"","@The_monster@ sneers @at_foe@, \"Where's your god now?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 嘲讽道：\"你的神现在在哪？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Bah, the gods are useless!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"呸，诸神皆是废物！\"","@The_monster@ mutters, \"So much for the promised afterlife.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕哝道：\"许诺的死后生活也不过如此。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ prays.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 在祈祷。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Are you sure you're pointing that wand in the right direction?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你确定你那根魔杖指的是对的方向？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Form is emptiness; emptiness is form.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"色即是空，空即是色。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ briefly looks inexplicably like a @_form_@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 短暂地变得莫名地像一只 @_form_@。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ briefly turns into a @_form_@ and back.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 短暂地变成了一只 @_form_@，然后变了回来。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Look on my works and despair!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"看我的伟业，绝望吧！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My constructs will outlast you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我的造物会活得比你久。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Life is a curse, you will soon understand.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"生命即是诅咒，你很快便会明白。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your future is not even bleak.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你的未来连黯淡都谈不上。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will be nailed to the ground forevermore.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你将永远被钉在大地上。\"","@The_monster@ whispers: \"Through my death, I saw my mistakes, and the mistakes of many more...\"":"@The_monster@ 低语道：\"通过死亡，我看到了自己的错误，还有更多人的错误……\"","@The_monster@ says with laughter: \"And yet I knew I would end up like that...\"":"@The_monster@ 笑着说：\"而我早就知道自己会落得如此下场……\"","@The_monster@ promises, \"I will read your future in your entrails.\"":"@The_monster@ 许诺道：\"我会从你的内脏中读出你的未来。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Nobody wants to follow a dead messiah!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"没人愿意追随一个死去的弥赛亚！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I used to walk on water. Now I just fly over it.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我从前能踏水而行。如今只能飞过去了。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I don't need an army to kill you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"杀你用不着千军万马！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"What's the hurry? You'll die anyway.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"急什么？反正你总会死的。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You can run, but you can't hide!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"跑得掉，躲不了！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I shall send you to the shadows!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我将送你堕入暗影！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Just let the darkness consume you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"乖乖让黑暗吞噬你吧。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I walk in shadow, and soon so shall you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我行走于暗影之中，很快你也会如此。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"In life, I might have healed you instead.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"若是在生前，也许我会治愈你。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I thought violence couldn't solve anything, but it solved me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我曾以为暴力解决不了任何事，但它解决了我。\"","@The_monster@ muses, \"Killing is much more fun than I thought it would be.\"":"@The_monster@ 若有所思地说：\"杀戮比我想象中有趣多了。\"","@The_monster@ moans, \"Why did I trust plants to save my life?\"":"@The_monster@ 呻吟道：\"我为什么要信靠植物来保命？\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I can no longer spread life, but I can still bring your death!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我不能再播撒生命，但仍能带给你死亡！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You will make such fine fertiliser.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你会变成上好的肥料。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Life goes in cycles. In a little while, you'll be reborn as a tapeworm.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"生命周而复始。再过不久，你就会转生为一条绦虫。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ waves a bulging coin purse at you.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 向你晃了晃一个鼓鼓的钱袋。","@The_monster@ says, \"You're as good as gold.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你真是金玉其表。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I guess you can't buy your way into a good afterlife.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"看来好死后生活是买不来的。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"If I can't kill you now, I'll help my descendant do it later.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"现在杀不了你，以后我也会帮我的后代杀了你。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll give you a battle you'll never forget!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我会给你一场永生难忘的战斗！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm committing your attacks to memory.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我正在把你的招式铭记于心。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I burned twice as bright, and look where it got me...\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我燃烧得加倍明亮，看看我落得了什么下场……\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ droops like a melted candle.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 像一根融化的蜡烛一样耷拉了下去。","@The_monster@ says, \"Ashes to ashes... so for me, and next for you!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"尘归尘……我也是，下一个便轮到你！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Still so attached to shiny items?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"还那么执着于那些亮闪闪的东西？\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Foolish people, craving for loot.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"愚蠢的凡人，贪婪地渴求着战利品。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I didn't need trinkets in life, I don't need them now.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"生前不需要小玩意儿，死后也不需要。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I was going to become a lich, but this is almost as good.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我本来打算变成巫妖的，不过这样也差不多。\"","@The_monster@ screams at @foe@, \"You cannot imagine the pain and torment in store for you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"你无法想象等待你的痛苦和折磨！\"","@The_monster@ screams at @foe@, \"You haven't seen true ruin and despair yet!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"你还没见过真正的毁灭和绝望！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Death will always conquer life.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"死亡终将战胜生命。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You would make a fine zombie.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你会成为一具不错的丧尸。\"","@The_monster@ says regretfully, \"I wish I had corrupted all of this!\"":"@The_monster@ 遗憾地说：\"真希望我把这里的一切都腐化了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What a barren place. A pity you won't get a chance to visit the Abyss!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"多荒凉的地方。可惜你再也没机会参观深渊了！\"","@The_monster@ proudly claims, \"A renegade god deserves renegade ghosts.\"":"@The_monster@ 骄傲地宣称：\"叛离的神祇配得上叛离的鬼魂。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I won't need demonic support against you.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"对付你不需要恶魔支援。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I died to destroy people like you for fun.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我生前就是为了杀你这种人而乐此不疲地赴死。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Destruction is an occupation beyond life.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"毁灭是一门超越生死的职业。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"First you will suffer, then you will die.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"先让你受苦，再让你死。\"","@The_monster@ boasts, \"I survived the Crucible of Flesh! I fear nothing now!\"":"@The_monster@ 夸口道：\"我熬过了血肉之锅！如今已无所畏惧！\"","@The_monster@ tells you, \"The cards don't hold a good future for you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对你说：\"牌面上你的未来可不好。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I will deal out your death!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我来为你发出死亡的牌局！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I was once a great warrior, and I still am!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我从前是一位伟大的战士，如今仍然是！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Ah, a second chance to prove myself in battle!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"啊，又一次在战斗中证明自己的机会！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You're just another problem to be solved.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你不过是又一个待解决的难题。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You're really going to get a charge out of this one.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这次你肯定会大吃一惊。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Spells? Hah! My gadgets will show what real magic is!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"法术？哈！我的装置会展示什么才是真正的魔法！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A storm is coming...\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"暴风雨即将来临……\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Let nature run its course against you!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"让大自然来收拾你！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The earth shall destroy you!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"大地将毁灭你！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I sacrificed my body for ultimate power!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我献祭了自己的身体以换取终极力量！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'll show you the great annihilating truth!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我会向你展示伟大的湮灭真理！\"","@The_monster@ tells you, \"None of this matters. None of this is real!\"":"@The_monster@ 对你说：\"这一切都不重要。这一切都不是真的！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Death is but another step down the path of knowledge.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"死亡不过是求知路上的又一步阶梯。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I have plenty of time to study, now.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"现在我有大把时间好好研究了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I was promised divine protection. So much for that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"他们许诺给我神圣庇护。也就这么回事。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"In life I battled great evil. Now I just battle.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"生前我大战邪恶。现在我只是在战斗。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"They say chivalry is dead. Well, so am I.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"人说骑士精神已死。嗯，我也死了。\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"I have become one of them.\"":"@The_monster@ 低语道：\"我也成了它们中的一员。\"","@The_monster@ mumbles, \"We raided the strongholds of evil. Now I walk alone.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕哝道：\"我们曾经征伐过邪恶的堡垒。如今我独自徘徊。\"","@The_monster@ utters, \"No lamp to guide me anymore...\"":"@The_monster@ 念叨着：\"再也没灯指引我了……\"","@The_monster@ yells, \"Who would have thought, even in death it is a pleasure to sever!\"":"@The_monster@ 吼道：\"谁能想到，即使死后砍杀也如此愉快！\"","@The_monster@ screams in joy, \"As in life, so in death: Kill! Kill!! Kill!!!\"":"@The_monster@ 狂喜地尖叫道：\"一如生前，亦如死后：杀！杀！！杀！！！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It's your last dance!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"这是你的最后一支舞！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Let me show you true rhythm.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"让你见识一下真正的节奏。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You either stomp with the beat or get stomped.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"要么跟着节拍踩，要么被踩。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I used to wander and follow the dancing life. Look where it got me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我从前四处漂泊，追逐着跳舞的人生。看看我落得什么下场。\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"Finally, a proper audience!\"":"@The_monster@ 喊道：\"终于，一个像样的观众来了！\"","@The_monster@ threatens, \"I'm fresh out of hellfire, but you will end anyway.\"":"@The_monster@ 威胁道：\"地狱火是用完了，但你还是得完蛋。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The agents of utter destruction are not stopped by death.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"彻底毁灭的执行者不会被死亡所阻挡。\"","@The_monster@ boasts, \"After taking care of you, I will research a spell that consumes the world.\"":"@The_monster@ 夸口道：\"解决了你之后，我会研究出一个吞噬世界的法术。\"","@The_monster@ threatens, \"Do not fail me, O fires of Iskenderun!\"":"@The_monster@ 威胁道：\"不要辜负我，伊斯肯德伦的火焰啊！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You lack the discipline to defeat me.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你缺乏打败我的纪律。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Let's see how well you move.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"让我看看你的身手如何。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm much more flexible now that I'm not limited by flesh.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"现在肉体不再束缚我，我灵活多了。\"","@The_monster@ @_laughs_@, \"I laugh when killing. So smile when dying. SMILE!\"":"@The_monster@ @_laughs_@：\"我杀人的时候笑。所以死的时候也要笑。笑！\"","@The_monster@ complains, \"You're an easy kill, but not a fun one.\"":"@The_monster@ 抱怨道：\"你是个容易杀的猎物，但不好玩。\"","@The_monster@ reminisces, \"I miss the gifts and the pranks.\"":"@The_monster@ 回忆道：\"我想念那些礼物和恶作剧。\"","@The_monster@ twaddles, \"I had a jolly good time in life, and I have a jolly good time now!\"":"@The_monster@ 絮絮叨叨地说：\"我生前快快乐乐，死后也快快乐乐！\"","@The_monster@ giggles, \"Hey deadhead, what fun to see your head drop dead!\"":"@The_monster@ 咯咯笑道：\"嘿，死脑袋，看到你脑袋掉地真有趣！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I need scissors! I think I chipped a nail somewhere...\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我需要剪刀！我好像把指甲弄崩了……\"","@The_monster@ tries to make a funny facial expression.":"@The_monster@ 试图做出一个搞笑的表情。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your soul may be of use to me.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你的灵魂或许对我有用。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"First you will die, then you will suffer.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"先让你死，再让你受苦。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I died poor and in vain, but not as a freak.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我死得一贫如洗、徒劳无功，但至少不是个怪物。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"For all the tithing, I expected a more glorious afterlife than this.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"缴了那么多什一税，我本以为死后生活会比这更荣耀些。\"","@The_monster@ takes aim @at_foe@.":"@The_monster@ 举起武器朝 @foe@ 瞄准。","You feel something passing dangerously close to your head. @player_only@":"你感到什么东西危险地从你头顶掠过。 @player_only@","spider":"蜘蛛","stone statue":"石像","dragon":"龙","cackles madly":"疯狂地咯咯笑","chuckles harshly":"刺耳地干笑","gibbers darkly":"阴沉地胡言乱语","@_player_ghost_common_@":"@_player_ghost_common_@","@_player_ghost_medium_@":"@_player_ghost_medium_@","@_player_ghost_rare_@":"@_player_ghost_rare_@","@The_monster@ lets out a mournful wail.":"@The_monster@ 发出一声悲恸的哀号。","@The_monster@ keens inconsolably.":"@The_monster@ 悲痛欲绝地恸哭。","@The_monster@ wails.":"@The_monster@ 哀号着。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ ripples.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 的身影泛起涟漪。","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"What do you have that I didn't have?\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"你有什么是我没有的？\"","@The_monster@ says very slowly, \"There's no hope.\"":"@The_monster@ 极缓慢地说：\"没有希望了。\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"You will never get the ORB!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"你永远也得不到宝珠！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ whispers, \"The ORB doesn't exist.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 低语道：\"宝珠根本不存在。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"They lied to you. The Dungeon just goes down and down forever.\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"他们骗了你。这个地牢只会一直向下、向下，永无尽头。\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"You will join me soon!\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"你很快就会来陪我了！\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"You must not succeed where I failed!\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"我失败的地方，你绝不能成功！\"","@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"There is no future for you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 低语道：\"你没有未来。\"","@The_monster@ makes a sound of rattling chains.":"@The_monster@ 发出锁链咔嗒作响的声音。","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"I was like you once.\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"我曾经也和你一样。\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"Very impressive. But it won't help. Nothing will.\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"非常了不起。但没用的。什么都救不了你。\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"I have seen your future, and it is all used up.\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"我见过你的未来，已经耗尽了。\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"Do you think the gods will protect you?\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"你以为诸神会保护你吗？\"","@The_monster@ screams, \"I'll kill anyone who wants the ORB!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 尖叫道：\"谁想要宝珠，我就杀谁！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Don't try to defend! You have no chance!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"别想抵抗！你没有机会！\"","@The_monster@ screams, \"Zot is a myth, the ORB is a fable, you'll soon be a tale!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 尖叫道：\"佐特是神话，宝珠是传说，你很快就会成为故事！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ whispers, \"Death is liberation.\"":"@The_monster@ 低语道：\"死亡即是解脱。\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"Death is your only future!\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"死亡是你唯一的未来！\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"Meet the emptiness of death!\"":"@The_monster@ 低语道：\"迎接死亡的虚空吧！\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"There is no future for me!\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"我已经没有未来了！\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"They're coming for you...\"":"@The_monster@ 低语道：\"他们来找你了……\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"Trust me. Just give in.\"":"@The_monster@ 低语道：\"相信我。放弃吧。\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"To die, to sleep, no more.\"":"@The_monster@@_wails_@道：\"死去，睡去，仅此而已。\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"Everlasting silence awaits you...\"":"@The_monster@低语道：\"永恒的沉默在等待着你……\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"Death doesn't hurt. What you feel is life.\"":"@The_monster@低语道：\"死亡不疼。你感受到的是生命。\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"You will understand me better in a moment.\"":"@The_monster@低语道：\"片刻之后，你会更理解我。\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"It is all a dream - a grotesque and foolish dream.\"":"@The_monster@低语道：\"一切都是一场梦——一场荒诞而愚蠢的梦。\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"Soon you will have time, lots of time...\"":"@The_monster@低语道：\"很快你就有时间了，很多很多的时间……\"","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"You must not fail where I succeeded!\"":"@The_monster@@_wails_@道：\"你绝不能在我成功之处失败！\"","@_Aizul_common_@":"@_Aizul_common_@","@_Aizul_rare_@":"@_Aizul_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ yawns, and then pretends @subjective@ didn't.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 打了个哈欠，然后假装@subjective@没打过。","@The_monster@ says, \"Feeling sleepy?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"困了吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I wasn't actually sleeping!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我其实没在睡觉！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ hisses menacingly.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 凶狠地嘶嘶作响。","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'll haunt your nightmares!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"我会在你的噩梦里缠着你！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Sweet dreams!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"好梦！\"","@The_monster@ hums a lullaby.":"@The_monster@ 哼着摇篮曲。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ coils and then uncoils.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 盘起来，然后又展开了。","@The_monster@ says, \"Everybody has to sleep sometimes.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"每个人总得睡觉的。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Fancy a snooze?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"想来个午觉吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"They said they'd gotten someone better!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"他们说找了更好的人来！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Replaced! How does it feel to be replaced?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"被取代了！被取代的滋味怎么样？\"","@The_monster@ moans, \"No job prospects! Who wants sleepy Aizul to guard their treasure?\"":"@The_monster@ 哀叹道：\"没有工作机会了！谁会雇嗜睡的艾祖尔看守他们的宝藏？\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ winks several times @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 朝 @foe@ 眨了好几次眼。","@_Agnes_common_@":"@_Agnes_common_@","@_Agnes_rare_@":"@_Agnes_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ bows.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 鞠了一躬。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You dishonour your ancestors.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你辱没了你的祖先。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I despise a dishonourable opponent.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我鄙视不光彩的对手。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It is my duty to kill you, but also my pleasure.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"杀死你是我的职责，但也是我的荣幸。\"","@The_monster@ mutters, \"I never trained for this.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕哝道：\"我从来没训练过应对这种情况。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will find the Path of Peace easy to follow, in death.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你会发现，在死亡中，平和之道很容易遵循。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The ORB is mine by right.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"宝珠理当属于我。\"","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"I will kick you around like a rattan ball!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 喊道：\"我会像踢藤球一样踢你！\"","@The_monster@ asks, \"Have you seen my kris anywhere?\"":"@The_monster@ 问：\"你看见我的短剑了吗？\"","@The_monster@ mutters, \"I could really go for a good breadfruit right now.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕哝道：\"我现在真想来个好吃的面包果。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"May you follow the Path of Peace in your next life.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"愿你下一世走上平和之道。\"","@_hell_lord_taunt_@":"@_hell_lord_taunt_@","@The_monster@ says, \"Your soul will be trapped in ice for ten thousand years.\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"你的灵魂将被囚禁在寒冰中一万年。\"","@_Amaemon_common_@":"@_Amaemon_common_@","@_Amaemon_rare_@":"@_Amaemon_rare_@","@The_monster@ hisses.":"@The_monster@发出嘶嘶声。","VISUAL:Something foul drips from @the_monster_possessive@ claws.":"VISUAL:@the_monster_possessive@爪子上滴下污秽的液体。","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes glow red.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双眼发出红光。","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ tail lashes.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@尾巴抽动着。","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You think you're better than me?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 喝道：\"你以为你比本座更高贵？\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Afraid of a little sting?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"怕被蛰一下吗？\"","@The_monster@ whines, \"They said I was special. Look at me now!\"":"@The_monster@哀号道：\"他们说过我很特别。看看我现在！\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Demons are the only companions you can really rely on.\"":"@The_monster@叹息道：\"恶魔才是你唯一能真正依靠的伙伴。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Need some antivenom? Don't worry, you can trust me.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"需要解药吗？别担心，你可以信任我。\"","@The_monster@ whispers, \"Once I find the ORB, I'll be cured. I'll be normal again!\"":"@The_monster@低语道：\"等我找到宝珠，我就能被治愈。我就能恢复正常了！\"","@The_monster@ sings, \"Eyes close, heart stop, nighty-night for you...\"":"@The_monster@哼唱道：\"闭上眼，心跳停，晚安好梦送你行……\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Follow my lead, little ones.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"小家伙们，跟着我走。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I resented this body once, but could any human make what I've made?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"我曾憎恨这副躯体，可有哪个人类能造出我所造之物？\"","@The_monster@ snarls, \"I will not be driven out again.\"":"@The_monster@怒喝道：\"我不会再被赶出去了。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Come closer, little fly.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"靠近些，小飞虫。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm done suffering for art; you can suffer instead.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我为艺术受苦已经够了；该换成你来受苦了。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My silk is a match for both steel and spell.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我的蛛丝足以对抗钢铁与法术。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I will spin a new home for us all.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我会为我们大家织一个新家。\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"This is my domain now; anyone trespasses at their own peril!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"这里现在是我的领地了；擅入者后果自负！\"","@_Asterion_common_@":"@_Asterion_common_@","@_Asterion_rare_@":"@_Asterion_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ snorts and paws the ground.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 喷着鼻息，用蹄子刨着地面。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ slowly taps @possessive@ weapon in @possessive@ hand.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 缓缓地用@possessive@武器敲击着@possessive@手掌。","@The_monster@ says, \"Soon your soul will belong to Makhleb.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"很快你的灵魂就将属于马科列布。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"Makhleb has given me powers of destruction.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"马科列布赐予了我毁灭之力。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Your corpse will decorate my castle walls.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你的尸体会装点我的城堡墙壁。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"In my kingdom, weaklings like you are put to the sword.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"在我的王国里，像你这样的弱者会被斩于剑下。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"No maze can contain me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"没有迷宫能困住我。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Enter my house and I will deliver you from evil.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"进了我的屋子，我就帮你脱离邪恶。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"My mother, she was a queen.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我的母亲，她是一位女王。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ screams, \"Stop staring at me!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 尖叫道：\"别盯着我看！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ bellows, \"My home has fourteen doors!\"":"@The_monster@ 吼道：\"我的家有十四扇门！\"","@The_monster@ chants a prayer to Makhleb.":"@The_monster@ 向马科列布吟诵祷文。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your valuables will do nicely in my coffers.\" @player_o