|feeling hot]?\"":"@The_monster@ 咧嘴笑着问 @foe,@「你[易燃吗|不易燃吗|感到热吗]？」","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"We're having tasty @foe_genus@ kabobs tonight!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"今晚我们有美味的 @foe_genus@ 烤肉串吃了！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"No! No! YES! No!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"不！不！对！不！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ whirls about in circles.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 在原地转着圈。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"May the fleas of a thousand camels infest your armpits.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"愿一千头骆驼的跳蚤在你的腋下安家。\"","@The_monster@ wonders @at_foe@, \"Do you still suffer from delusions of adequacy?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 纳闷道：\"你还在受够格妄想的困扰吗？\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"May your bottom itch incessantly and may your @_player_arms_@ be too short to scratch it.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"愿你的屁股痒个不停，而你的 @_player_arms_@ 短得挠不到。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You child of a motherless goat.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你这没娘的山羊崽子。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You child of a rabid dog! Grandchild of a stinking jackal! Great-grandchild of a plucked vulture!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你这疯狗崽子！臭豺狼孙子！秃鹫曾孙子！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"May a porcupine live in your trousers for a thousand days and die there for a thousand and one.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"愿一只豪猪在你的裤裆里住上一千天，又在里面死上一千零一天。\"","return \"paws\"":"return \"爪子\"","return \"tentacles\"":"return \"触手\"","return \"limbs\"":"return \"四肢\"","return \"arms\"":"return \"手臂\"","@_Bai_Suzhen_common_@":"@_Bai_Suzhen_common_@","@_Bai_Suzhen_rare_@":"@_Bai_Suzhen_rare_@","@The_monster@ grumbles, \"Damn that jealous turtle monk.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕哝道：\"那个嫉妒的龟和尚，该死。\"","@The_monster@ pines for @possessive@ lost husband.":"@The_monster@ 思念着 @possessive@ 失散的丈夫。","@The_monster@ roars, \"Even the heavens can't separate us forever!\"":"@The_monster@ 咆哮道：\"就算是天条也不能永远分开我们！\"","@The_monster@ inspects @possessive@ gathered herbal reagents.":"@The_monster@ 查看着 @possessive@ 采集的草药。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ twists and twirls @possessive@ body through the storm.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 在暴风雨中扭动着 @possessive@身躯。","@The_monster@ grouses about [the pranks of immortal alchemists|immature sisters].":"@The_monster@ 抱怨着[不朽炼金术士的恶作剧|不懂事的妹妹们]。","@The_monster@ hisses, \"Days like this make me miss drinking.\"":"@The_monster@ 嘶嘶地说：\"这样的日子让我想念饮酒的时光。\"","@The_monster@ affirms to @reflexive@, \"Our love will make it through this.\"":"@The_monster@ 对@reflexive@坚定地说：\"我们的爱会挺过这一切。\"","@The_monster@ wonders wistfully, \"Should I have meditated another thousand years?\"":"@The_monster@ 惆怅地遐想道：\"我是不是该再冥想一千年？\"","@The_monster@ whispers to @reflexive@, \"Everyone I saved... Everyone I doomed...\"":"@The_monster@ 对@reflexive@低语道：\"我救过的每一个人……我害过的每一个人……\"","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ form shimmers in the rain.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@身影在雨中闪烁。","@_Blorkula_common_@":"@_Blorkula_common_@","@_Blorkula_rare_@":"@_Blorkula_rare_@","@The_monster@ shouts, \"I believe in me!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"我相信我自己！\"","@rainbow_colour@":"@rainbow_colour@","w:10":"@_deck_of_punishment_line_@","@misc_colour@":"@misc_colour@","@_generic_orc_speech_@":"@_generic_orc_speech_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ grins serenely.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 安详地咧嘴一笑。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ is briefly surrounded by a halo of @_blorkula_colour_@ light.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 短暂地被一圈@_blorkula_colour_@光环环绕。","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes glow @_blorkula_colour_@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@眼睛泛着 @_blorkula_colour_@ 光芒。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You need a new perspective.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你需要换个视角。\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Let me show you how many colours things can be!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"让我给你看看世界能有多少种颜色！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Beogh has given me so many different colours to drink.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"比欧弗赐予了我如此之多可以饮用的颜色。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I was weak before I became an orc, but now I'm strong. And I'll get stronger.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"成为兽人之前我很弱小，但现在我很强壮。而且我会变得更强。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Everything's been so different since that missionary gave me these suspenders.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"自从那位传教士给了我这副吊裤带，一切都变得不一样了。\"","@The_monster@ mutters, \"Such pretty colours everywhere...\"":"@The_monster@ 咕哝道：\"到处都是这么漂亮的颜色……\"","@The_monster@ says, \"My favourite colour of blood is @_blorkula_colour_@. Wait, no, @_blorkula_colour_@.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我最喜欢的血的颜色是@_blorkula_colour_@。等等，不对，是@_blorkula_colour_@。\"","@The_monster@ screams, \"What are you staring at, @player_name@? I'm stylish!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 尖叫道：\"你在看什么，@player_name@？我很有型！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"What are you like inside? I'll break you open and find out!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"你内里是什么样的？我要把你撬开看看！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"It's all true! You just have to believe!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"这一切都是真的！你只需要相信！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Look beyond the surface! Nothing is what it seems!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"看穿表象！一切都不是看上去的样子！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'll make you see things how they really are!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"我会让你看清事物的真实面目！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"There's so much colour in the world. Let me show it to you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"这世上有那么多颜色。让我展示给你看。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ contemplates whether Beogh's temples would look better painted @_blorkula_colour_@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 琢磨着比欧弗的神庙刷成@_blorkula_colour_@会不会更好看。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The problem is, you see everything in terms of black and white.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"问题在于，你看一切都非黑即白。\"","@The_monster@ mutters, \"Why is everything @_blorkula_colour_@ all of a sudden?\"":"@The_monster@ 咕哝道：\"怎么突然间一切都变成@_blorkula_colour_@了？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Things are no longer grey! Not since my great insight!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"事物不再灰暗了！自从我有了伟大的洞见！\"","A faint prismatic mist rises from Blorkula's broken form and then dissipates.":"一道微弱的棱彩薄雾从布洛库拉的破碎身躯中升起，随后消散。","@_Boris_common_@":"@_Boris_common_@","@_Boris_medium_@":"@_Boris_medium_@","@_Boris_rare_@":"@_Boris_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ stares @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 凝视着@foe@。","@The_monster@ laughs.":"@The_monster@ 笑着。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You can't imagine my power.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你无法想象我的力量。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You want the ORB? You'll never get it.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@说：\"你想得到宝珠？你永远得不到。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ boasts with wailing echoes, \"My power is unlimited.\"":"@The_monster@以哀号般的回声夸耀道：\"我的力量无边无际。\"","@The_monster@ claims, \"You mortals are all unique only in the ways you'll break.\"":"@The_monster@宣称：\"你们凡人，唯一的独特之处在于你们崩溃的方式。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You can't kill me in a way that matters.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你无法以一种有意义的方式杀死我。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I know the secret of eternal life. Do you?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我知道永生的秘密。你呢？\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I know your future. Your future is death.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我知道你的未来。你的未来就是死亡。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Who wants to live forever? Me.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"谁想长生不死？我。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"There's only one solution for all of you. To die.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"对你们所有人，只有一个解决方案。去死。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You can never win.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你永远赢不了。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I didn't invite you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我可没邀请你。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The world, the flesh, and the devil.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"世俗、肉体与魔鬼。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"There's no good or evil. Just power and will.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"没有善与恶。只有力量与意志。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You have all forgotten the taste of death.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你们全都忘记了死亡的滋味。\"","@The_monster@ claims, \"I care not for such insignificant forces as time or death.\"":"@The_monster@ 宣称：\"我才不在乎时间或死亡这等微不足道的力量。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Magic. You know nothing about it.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"魔法。你一无所知。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Join my legions of the broken and the beaten.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"加入我由破碎者和失败者组成的军团。\"","@_Boris_return_common_@":"@_Boris_return_common_@","@_Boris_return_rare_@":"@_Boris_return_rare_@","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You haven't seen the last of me!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你还没看到我的最后一面！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll get you next time!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"下次我不会放过你！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"This isn't over yet!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"这事还没完！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'll be back!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"我会回来的！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This isn't the end, it's only just beginning!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"这不是结束，这才刚刚开始！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Kill me? I think not!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"杀死我？我不这么认为！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You cannot defeat me so easily!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你不可能这么轻易击败我！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"We will meet again!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我们还会再见面的！\"","@The_monster@ asks, \"Do I look like the kind of man who dies?\"":"@The_monster@ 问：\"我看起来像是会死的那种人吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You can't fire me, I quit!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你不能解雇我，我自己辞职！\"","@Boris timeout@":"@Boris timeout@","@The_monster@ says, \"And that's the last I'll see of you.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这是我最后一次见到你了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'd like to see you come back from this one.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我倒想看看你这次怎么活过来。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'll treasure this one.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我会好好珍藏这一次。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You would ask such trivialities of one who has solved death itself?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你竟敢拿这种琐碎问题来问一个已经破解了死亡本身的人？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A terrible fate awaits all who seek the ORB - and yours worst of all.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@说：\"所有追寻宝珠之人，都将迎来可怕的命运——而你的下场最为凄惨。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ beseeches you, \"Abandon your quest, lest a terrible end find us all.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@向你恳求道：\"放弃你的任务吧，否则一个可怕的结局将降临我们所有人。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ shouts, \"Turn back while you still can!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"趁还能回头，赶紧折返！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The road you walk has only one end and you would not wish it even upon your enemies.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"你所走的路只有一个终点，你甚至不愿将它加诸于你的敌人。\"","@The_monster@ cries, \"You know not what is at stake here!\"":"@The_monster@哭喊道：\"你根本不知道这里攸关着什么！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You never know good fortune from ill. It is because you cannot see into the future.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"你永远无法分辨好运与厄运。这是因为你看不穿未来。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Heed my words or we all shall suffer their consequence.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"听从我的话语，否则我们都将承受其后果。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I have seen things no one ever should.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"我见过无人应见之事。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Knowledge is its own curse.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"知识本身就是诅咒。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Should we be naught but slaves of fate, I will still speak truth to my dying breath.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"纵使我们不过是命运的奴隶，我仍将讲出真相，直至最后一息。\"","@The_monster@ gasps, \"Did I... did I finally change the future?\"":"@The_monster@喘息着说：\"我……我终于改变了未来吗？\"","@The_monster@ gasps with @possessive@ dying breath, \"I... tried to warn you...\"":"@The_monster@用@possessive@最后的气息喘息道：\"我……试图警告过你……\"","@The_monster@ gasps with @possessive@ dying breath, \"No one... ever listens...\"":"@The_monster@用@possessive@最后的气息喘息道：\"从来没有人……肯听我的……\"","@The_monster@ gasps with @possessive@ dying breath, \"Your fate... be upon your own head...\"":"@The_monster@用@possessive@最后的气息喘息道：\"你的命运……咎由自取……\"","@The_monster@ begs you to reconsider your quest.":"@The_monster@ 恳求你重新考虑你的任务。","@The_monster@ pleads, \"Will you not heed even the word of a friend and end this?\"":"@The_monster@ 哀求道：\"难道你连朋友的劝诫都不听，非要继续下去吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Even I cannot save you if you persist in this.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"若你一意孤行，就连我也救不了你了。\"","%%%%%":"%%%%%","Chuck":"Chuck","@_chuck_generic_@":"@_chuck_generic_@","@_chuck_rare_@":"@_chuck_rare_@","@The_monster@ grunts.":"@The_monster@发出咕哝声。","@The_monster@ says, \"Me like rocks.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"俺喜欢石头。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Me has lots rocks.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"俺有好多石头。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Want to see my rocks?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"想看俺的石头吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You look bit like rock.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"你看起来有点像石头。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Big rocks, small rocks, huge rocks! Magic rocks!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"大石头，小石头，大块头！魔法石头！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ drools a little bit.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@流了一点口水。","@The_monster@ says, \"Me has best rocks.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"俺有最好的石头。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ inspects you suspiciously.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@怀疑地审视着你。","@The_monster@ says, \"No steal rocks!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"不准偷石头！\"","@The_monster@ screams, \"THIEF!\"":"@The_monster@尖叫道：\"小偷！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You took it. Me saw.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"你拿走了。俺看见了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Best rocks! Rocks!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"最好的石头！石头！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"ROCKS!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"石头！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"ME ROCKS!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"俺的石头！\"","@_crazy_yiuf_speech_@":"@_crazy_yiuf_speech_@","@The_monster@ says, \"The life which is unexamined is not worth living.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"未经审视的人生不值得过。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"My goal is simple. It is a complete understanding of the universe, why it is as it is and why it exists at all.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我的目标很简单。那就是完全理解宇宙——它为何如此，以及它为何存在。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"One may say the eternal mystery of the world is its comprehensibility.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"可以说，世界永恒的神秘在于它的可理解性。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Which is more difficult, to awaken one who sleeps or to awaken one who, awake, dreams that he is awake?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"什么更难？是唤醒一个睡着的人，还是唤醒一个醒着却梦见自己醒着的人？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Everyone has the same god; only people differ.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"每个人都有同样的神；只是人不同而已。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Against boredom even gods struggle in vain.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"面对无聊，即使是众神也徒劳挣扎。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"No facts are to me sacred; none are profane; I simply experiment, an endless seeker, with no past at my back.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"对我来说，没有什么是神圣的；也没有什么是亵渎的；我只是一个实验者，一个无休止的探索者，身后没有过去。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The present is the child, and the necessary child, of all the past, and the mother of all the future.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"现在是所有过去的孩子——必然的孩子——也是所有未来的母亲。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Reason is nothing but a wonderful and unintelligible instinct in our souls.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"理性不过是我们灵魂中一种奇妙而不可理解的本能。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"It is extremely absurd to expect to be enlightened by reason, and yet to prescribe to it beforehand on which side it must incline.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"期望从理性中获得启迪，却又事先规定理性必须倾向哪一边——这极其荒谬。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The real reality is there, but everything you KNOW about 'it' is in your mind and yours to do with as you like.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"真正的现实就在那里，但你所'知道'关于它的一切都在你的头脑里，随你怎么处置。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ considers dialectic materialism.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 思考着辩证唯物主义。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ ponders an existential dilemma.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 思考着一个存在主义困境。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ shuffles @possessive@ notes under @possessive@ cloak.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 把 @possessive@笔记塞到了 @possessive@斗篷下。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ heaves a sigh in contemplation.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 在沉思中长叹一声。","@The_monster@ says, \"Wait for me!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"等等我！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You found it!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你找到了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Get me out of this place.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"把我弄出这个地方。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You came back for me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你回来找我了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This beard itches something crazy!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这胡子痒得厉害！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I wonder if I left the window open.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我是不是忘了关窗。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ scratches @possessive@ head thoughtfully.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 若有所思地挠了挠 @possessive@头。","@The_monster@ says, \"Have you seen my glasses?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你看见我的眼镜了吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Perhaps I shall have lamb for dinner.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"也许晚餐吃羊肉吧。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, this is rather nice.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哦，这还挺不错的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Have you seen my cloak?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你看见我的斗篷了吗？\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ counts something out on @possessive@ fingers.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 用 @possessive@手指算着什么东西。","@The_monster@ says, \"My, my head's in a spin!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哎呀，我的头都转晕了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I feel rather peculiar.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我感觉相当奇怪。\"","@The_monster@ @_crazy_yiuf_speech_verbs_@, \"@_crazy_yiuf_sentence_@\"":"@The_monster@ @_crazy_yiuf_speech_verbs_@：\"@_crazy_yiuf_sentence_@\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ waves @possessive@ quarterstaff at you. @player_only@":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 朝你挥舞着 @possessive@长棍。 @player_only@","@The_monster@ cries, \"You leg down broken song, no?\"":"@The_monster@ 喊道：\"你腿断了歌，不是吗？\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ glowers.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 怒目而视。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ twirls on the spot.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 在原地转着圈。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ flaps @possessive@ cloak.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 拍打着 @possessive@斗篷。","@The_monster@ says, \"Crazy? Crazy!? PORCUPINE!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"疯了？疯了！？豪猪！\"","@The_monster@ sings, \"Trees, trees, trees, circus!\"":"@The_monster@ 唱道：\"树，树，树，马戏团！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm not crazy!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我没疯！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What sane person could live in this world and not be crazy?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"什么样的正常人能活在这世界上而不疯掉？\"","whimpers":"呜咽着","laughs":"大笑着","grits":"咬着牙说","@_crazy_yiuf_wordlist1_@! @_crazy_yiuf_wordlist1_@ @_crazy_yiuf_wordlist2_@ @_crazy_yiuf_wordlist2_@.":"@_crazy_yiuf_wordlist1_@！@_crazy_yiuf_wordlist1_@ @_crazy_yiuf_wordlist2_@@_crazy_yiuf_wordlist2_@。","@_crazy_yiuf_wordlist1_@ @_crazy_yiuf_wordlist2_@ @_crazy_yiuf_wordlist2_@!":"@_crazy_yiuf_wordlist1_@ @_crazy_yiuf_wordlist2_@ @_crazy_yiuf_wordlist2_@！","@_crazy_yiuf_wordlist1_@!":"@_crazy_yiuf_wordlist1_@！","Yo