enty-seven":"二十七","forty-two":"四十二","unthinkable":"不可想象","high":"高","action":"行动","pizzabubble":"披萨泡","noodlescoop":"面条舀","mumblescurry":"咕哝咖喱","alas":"唉","rumpyflump":"软塌塌","sizzlefizz":"嘶嘶泡","@_dissolution_common_@":"@_dissolution_common_@","@_dissolution_speech_@":"@_dissolution_speech_@","@The_monster@ gurgles.":"@The_monster@ 发出咕噜声。","@The_monster@ gurgles loudly.":"@The_monster@ 大声咕噜作响。","@The_monster@ emits a sizzling noise.":"@The_monster@ 发出嘶嘶声。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ wobbles.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 摇晃着。","@The_monster@ says, \"Join with me for eternity!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"与吾融为一体，直至永恒！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Become one with my sorrow!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"化入吾的悲伤之中！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Slime for the Slime God!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"黏泥归于黏泥之神！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Acid is thicker than water.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"酸比水浓。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Acid to acid, slime to slime.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"酸归酸，泥归泥。\"","@_dissolution_rare_@":"@_dissolution_rare_@","@The_monster@ says, \"We come from slime, we turn to slime.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"吾等由黏液而来，亦终归黏液。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"From Slime we come, to Slime we go.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"自黏液而生，归黏液而去。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Resolve to dissolve!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"下定决液，化散一切！\"","@The_monster@ presages, \"An acid flood will etch off all the scum!\"":"@The_monster@预言道：\"一场酸洪将蚀尽世间渣滓！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"There is a problem solver and @possessive@ name is Dissolver!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"世上有一位解题大师，@possessive@名字叫溶解君！\"","@_generic_Donald_@":"@_generic_Donald_@","@The_monster@ says, \"I can never find the altar I want in here.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我从来找不到我想要的那个祭坛。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"There are too many gods demanding my worship. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"太多神祇在争夺我的信仰。我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why did you bring me all the way here just to see the Temple?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你带我来这儿就是为了看看神庙？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"There's not enough treasure in here.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这里的财宝不够多。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You've already taken the rune from here, haven't you?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你已经把这里的符文拿走了，是吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The so-called 'good' gods are just as evil as the rest. I hate hypocrisy.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"所谓的'善'神跟其他神一样邪恶。我讨厌伪善。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate temples.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌神庙。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What about an ecumenical tavern?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"普世客栈怎么样？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Orcs complain a lot, don't they? I hate it.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"兽人很爱抱怨，对吧？我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Orcs smell really bad. Yuck.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"兽人身上真臭。呕。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"At least there's gold. That doesn't make up for it.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"至少有金子。但也弥补不了这个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'll never be able to carry all this gold! I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这么多金子我永远搬不完！我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What do they mine anyway? I've never seen them mine anything.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"他们到底在挖什么？我从没见过他们挖出过东西。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Have you ever seen an orcish miner? Me neither.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你见过兽人矿工吗？我也没见过。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ kicks a rock and scowls.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 踢开一块石头，阴沉着脸。","@The_monster@ says, \"Why is it so dark? Have they never heard of torches?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"为什么这么黑？他们没听说过火把吗？\"","@The_monster@ ponders, \"They're ugly as hell, too!\"":"@The_monster@ 沉吟道：\"他们丑得要命！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I ran into an orc. He called himself a warlord, and I asked what war?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我遇到一个兽人。他自称军阀，我问他打的是什么仗。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"These orcs are so stupid, they must've eaten the rune.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这些兽人蠢到可能把符文吃了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I asked for directions to the rune, but they belched at me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我向他们打听符文的路，他们却朝我打嗝。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I prefer the Lair of the Beasts, to be honest. At least animals don't complain.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"说实话，我更喜欢野兽巢穴。至少动物不抱怨。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate complainers so much.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我实在太讨厌爱抱怨的人了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why would you have your front door in a mine? Stupid.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"前门开到矿洞里是图什么？愚蠢。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hope this rune is worth it!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"真希望这符文值得跑一趟！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I thought elves might be good for a party. Nope.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我还以为能跟精灵好好聚一聚。不了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Really pretty, but really, really boring. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"看着是漂亮，但也实在太无聊了。我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's with all the gesturing? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"怎么老是比比划划的？我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"None of these elves know how to fight. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这些精灵没一个会打架的。我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's the point of a Hall of Blades anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说回来，建个刀锋大厅又有什么意义？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's that horrible smell? It's like... yuck.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这什么臭味道？简直像……呕。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If there's anything I hate more than water, it's brackish swamp water.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"如果说有什么事比水更让我讨厌，那就是又咸又苦的沼泽水。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate trees. I hate swamp water. I hate this place.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌树。我讨厌沼泽水。我讨厌这地方。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"That buzzing noise? I hate that the most.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那嗡嗡声？我最讨厌那个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What could mosquitoes possibly want with my blood?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"蚊子要我的血干嘛？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hope these swamp worms drown.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"希望这些沼泽蠕虫都淹死。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Damn it, I left my flaming sword at home.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"该死，我把火焰剑忘在家里了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you hate leeches? I know I do.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你不讨厌水蛭吗？反正我讨厌。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate mosquitoes. Almost as much as I hate swamp water.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌蚊子。差不多跟讨厌沼泽水一样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"At least there's some dry land. I hate getting wet.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"好歹有块干燥的陆地。我讨厌被弄湿。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Is there a plague of frogs happening, or something? At least it's not locusts.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"是不是爆发什么青蛙瘟疫了？还好不是蝗虫。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The more heads they grow, the more I hate hydras.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"多头蛇的头越多，我就越讨厌它们。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Tides? I despise tides. No, wait, I hate tides!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"潮汐？我鄙视潮汐。不，等等，我恨潮汐！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I like turtle soup. I hate turtles.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我喜欢乌龟汤。我恨乌龟。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I haven't seen any pirates yet. I hate pirates.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我还没看见海盗。我恨海盗。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"At least this place doesn't smell as bad as the Swamp.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"至少这地方没有沼泽那么臭。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The sirens are starting to hurt my ears.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那些海妖的声音开始震得我耳朵疼了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are sirens supposed to sound like that? I can sing better than that!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"海妖就那声音？我唱得都比那好！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Where'd the sea come from? I thought this place was underground.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这海从哪来的？我还以为这地方是地下。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I like the beach, but I hate the sea.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我喜欢海滩，但我恨大海。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"These tides are fast. That can't be natural!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这潮汐也太快了。这不自然！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"At least there aren't any ducks around. I hate ducks.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"至少这里没有鸭子。我恨鸭子。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm soaked through. I hate being wet!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我全身湿透了。我讨厌被弄湿！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Those krakens don't even look real.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那些克拉肯看起来根本不像真的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm looking for Ms. Medusa. Have you seen her?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我在找美杜莎女士。你见过她吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I don't understand half of what these people say. It's all Greek to me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这些人说的话我一半都听不懂。对我来说全是天书。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"And I thought they were famous for their poetry.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我还以为他们以诗歌闻名呢。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I slipped earlier. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我刚才滑了一跤。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I wish these tides would just make up their mind. In and out, in and out...\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"真希望这潮汐能拿定主意。进进出出，进进出出……\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A turtle bit me. I hate turtles.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"有只乌龟咬了我。我恨乌龟。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This tentacle just came out of nowhere and touched me. I hate tentacles!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这根触手不知从哪冒出来碰了我一下。我讨厌触手！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"There's a spider on your neck!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你脖子上有只蜘蛛！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate crawling things.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我恨爬来爬去的东西。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Someone should clean these parts. I hate webs.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"该有人清理一下这些角落。我恨蜘蛛网。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"My uncle had bigger webs in his attic. I hated that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我叔叔的阁楼有更大的蜘蛛网。我恨那个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate getting stuck.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌被困住。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Dancing spiders? With no cane or a top hat?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"会跳舞的蜘蛛？没有手杖也没有高帽？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Something's up my trousers! Aieee!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"有东西爬进我裤子里了！啊啊啊！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate venom. I hate getting bitten.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我恨毒液。我恨被咬。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Arachnophobia is no disease, it's common sense.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"蜘蛛恐惧症不是病，是常识。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"There, on the ceiling! And on that wall!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那里，天花板上！还有那面墙上！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Where's all the loot?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"战利品都哪去了？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I feel like a jelly sandwich, now.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我现在觉得自己像个果冻三明治。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This place is the Pits.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这地方简直是个蛇坑。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the colour green.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我恨绿色。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I can't smell anything here. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"在这里我什么都闻不到。我恨这个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I can't get this icky slime off my feet.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我脚上这恶心的黏液弄不掉了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I keep getting this feeling like someone's watching me. Creepy.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我老觉得有人在看着我。好诡异。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I always freeze up when I think I'm being watched.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"每次觉得有人在看我的时候，我就僵住了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Acid blobs make me think of reflux. I hate reflux.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"酸液泡让我想起胃反流。我恨反流。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's up with all this goo? It's like a world of goo. I hate goo.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这些黏糊糊的东西是什么情况？简直是黏液世界。我恨黏液。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Someone said I could use acid to solve all my problems. It just made them worse.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"有人说我可以靠酸来解决所有问题。结果只是让问题更糟了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hope the rune isn't sticky.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"希望符文别是黏的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A rock stubbed itself on my toe. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"一块石头硌了我的脚趾。我恨那个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's so magical about quicksilver, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"水银到底有什么神奇的啊？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You know that hissing noise? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你知道那种嘶嘶声吗？我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You know that slithering noise? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你知道那种滑行声吗？我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'd like to make these snakes into gloves, but I hate gloves.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我想把这些蛇做成手套，但我讨厌手套。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What do naga need barding for?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"纳迦要马铠有什么用？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's a barding, anyway? Does it sing for its supper?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说，马铠是什么？它会唱歌讨饭吃吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Robes are for wimps. Real warriors wear heavy armour!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"长袍是给软蛋穿的。真正的战士穿重甲！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Nagas are pretty ugly. I hate nagas.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"纳迦丑得很。我讨厌纳迦。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Did all the warriors here go to shield school or something?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这儿的战士都上过盾牌学校还是怎么的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"So, why is that serpent talking?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那么，那条蛇为什么要说话？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What sort of name is 'naga' anyway? They're not even good at nagging.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说'纳迦'算什么名字？它们连唠叨都不擅长。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"At least there aren't any garudas. I hate garudas.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"至少这里没有迦楼罗。我讨厌迦楼罗。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You'd think there'd be more pits. I haven't seen any.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你可能会以为这里坑会更多。我一个也没见着。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm sick of this place. Or maybe that's poison...\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我受够这地方了。也许那是中毒……\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate mutated serpents.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌突变巨蛇。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"So, nagas are stealthy? Don't make me laugh.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"纳迦很擅长潜行？别逗我笑了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I wish they'd hurry up and stop blocking the corridors.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"真希望它们快点别堵着走廊了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Man, snails must be faster than these guys.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"老天，蜗牛都比这些家伙快。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How does a snake shoot lightning, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"蛇怎么能射出闪电？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"First nagas, now salamanders. What's next, crocodiles with mirrors on their heads?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"先是纳迦，再是沙罗曼蛇。接下来是什么，头上顶镜子的鳄鱼？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The Vaults? They should've called it the Dumps.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"宝库？叫垃圾堆还差不多。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't bother, there's only junk at the bottom.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"不用找了，底下只有破烂。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I asked the warden where the rune was. She slammed the door in my face.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我问典狱长符文在哪。她当面把门摔上了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I don't remember getting an invitation to a convocation.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我不记得收到过什么聚会的邀请函。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Who designed this place? It's just a bunch of weird little rooms stuck together.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这地方谁设计的？就是一堆奇怪的小房间拼起来的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This is an awful lot of space just to hold some junk.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"为了放些破烂占这么大地方。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I saw some yaktaurs earlier, but I bolted.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"之前看到了一些半人马骑兵，不过我先溜了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I saw a dragon earlier, but I didn't get too close - it seemed pretty mercurial.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"之前看到了一条龙，不过我没靠太近——它脾气看起来挺善变的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why are there poltergeists guarding this place, but not the Crypt?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"为什么是骚灵在守着这地方，而不是墓穴？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Zombies are pretty boring.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"丧尸挺无聊的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Man, I can't wait until I find the rune.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"老天，我等不及找到符文了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"They must've been making zombies for centuries to fill this place.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"他们肯定做了几百年丧尸才填满这地方。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"My neck hurts.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我脖子疼。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Is it cursed, or does it curse? I can never tell.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"是它被诅咒了，还是它会诅咒人？我永远分不清。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Curse skulls, curse toes... What next?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"诅咒骷髅头，诅咒脚趾头……下一个是什么？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This isn't even all that spooky.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这地方甚至没那么阴森。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This place is pretty cryptic.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这地方还挺神秘兮兮的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Skeletons give me the creeps.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"骷髅让我起鸡皮疙瘩。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate skeletons.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌骷髅。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate draugr.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌尸鬼。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate zombies.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"我讨厌丧尸。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate vampires.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌吸血鬼。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"That ghoul gave me heartburn.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那只食尸鬼害我胃灼热。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What sort of name is 'necrophage', anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说'食尸者'算什么名字？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Where are all the doors?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"门都去哪了？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You know, I thought there'd be more coffins in a crypt...\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你知道吗，我还以为墓穴里棺材会更多……\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Have you seen a sarcophagus full of treasure around? Me neither.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你见过装满财宝的石棺吗？我也没有。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I just hope the loot isn't guarded by liches. I hate liches.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我只希望战利品不是巫妖在看守。我讨厌巫妖。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"That mummy wasn't so great.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那木乃伊也不怎么样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This place has the same junk as everywhere else. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这地方跟别处一样全是破烂。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why is it so quiet?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"为什么这么安静？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"So much for the uneasy undead.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"还说什么亡灵令人不安。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"They don't shamble much, do they? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"它们也不怎么蹒跚游荡，对吧？我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"They don't even play music.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"它们连音乐都不放。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Some mausoleum.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"还陵墓呢。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I saw a sphinx earlier. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我之前看到一只斯芬克斯。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The Crypt, the Tomb, what's next? The Coffin?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"墓穴、陵墓，接下来呢？棺材？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"All these vampires have me hopping mad!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这些吸血鬼气得我跳脚！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate revenants, but I forget why! And I hate that, too!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌归来者，但我不记得为什么了！而这一点我也讨厌！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I got a splinter from a draugr. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我被尸鬼的木刺扎了一下。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"But I don't want to have to go deeper!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"可我不想再往深处走了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What does 'eldritch' mean, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说，'诡异'到底是什么意思？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I keep hearing this weird shrieking in my head. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我脑子里一直有奇怪的尖叫声。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I've never heard of a star cursing anything.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我从没听说过星星会诅咒什么东西。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I've never heard of a star spawning anything.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我从没听说过星星会生出什么东西。\"","@The_monster@ throws up @possessive@ hands and says, \"Alright, I admit it, I'm lost!\"":"@The_monster@ 摊开@possessive@双手说：\"好吧，我承认，我迷路了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate wrenching sensations.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌被撕裂般的感觉。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's so abyssal about tentacles and stars?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"触手和星星到底有什么深渊可言？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Screaming refractions? What's next, yodelling boulders?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"尖叫的折射？下一步是什么，会唱约德尔歌的巨石？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I saw a draconian who kept changing colours. Some people are so indecisive.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我看到一只不断变色的龙人。有些人真是优柔寡断。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How come everyone is wearing a cloak down here?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"怎么这下面人人都穿斗篷？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I offered a draconian some spare armour, but he said it didn't fit.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我拿备用的盔甲给一个龙人，他说不合身。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I keep feeling something staring at me. Is it you?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我总觉得有东西在盯着我。是你吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How do you make a golem out of electricity?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"怎么用电做魔像？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's an 'Orb Guardian', anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说，'宝珠守卫'是什么？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Orbs of fire, orbs of destruction, the Orb of Zot... what's with all the orbs?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"火焰之球、毁灭法球、佐特宝珠……怎么全是球？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate orbs.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌宝珠。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate clowns.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌小丑。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate draconians.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌龙人。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate purple.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌紫色。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are they setting up a circus down here?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"他们是要在这下面开马戏团吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This place probably doesn't see many tourists.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这地方大概没什么游客。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, so that's what those runes are for!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哦，原来那些符文是干这个用的！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why do the walls change colour every floor? Did they keep running out of paint?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"为什么每层墙壁都换颜色？他们老是把油漆用光吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's stopping the guards from just stealing the Orb themselves?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"是什么阻止守卫们自己偷走宝珠？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hope I don't run into any orbs of ice down here!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"希望我不会在这下面遇到冰宝珠！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Did you bring your rings of ice?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你带寒冰戒指了吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The Orb of Power is here? Where are the others, then?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"力量宝珠在这里？那其他的呢？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I saw some tasty-looking maize earlier, but it tried to eat me. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"之前我看到些看着很美味的玉米，但它想吃掉我。我讨厌那样。\"","w:25":"w:25","@The_monster@ says, \"Thanks for carrying the Orb of Power for me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"谢谢你帮我拿着力量宝珠。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Isn't that thing heavy? I could take a turn.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那东西不重吗？我可以替你拿一会儿。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Aren't you worried about radiation? You should put that down.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你不担心辐射吗？你最好把它放下。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What are you going to do with that Orb?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你打算拿那颗宝珠做什么？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you think the Orb of Power was down there for a reason?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你不觉得力量宝珠被放在那么深的地方是有原因的吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I heard that the world ends if you bring it to the surface.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我听说把它带到地表世界就会终结。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Someone is going to come looking for that Orb.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"总会有人来找那颗宝珠的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are you sure that's the real Orb, and not some cheap imitation?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你确定那是真的宝珠，不是什么廉价仿品？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You have the Orb. Was it worth it?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你拿到宝珠了。这一切值得吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"So much for spreading the word; you get punched in the face instead.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"还传播什么福音呢；你只会挨一记老拳。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This pamphlet doesn't say what the point to Recitation is.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这本小册子没说诵经到底有什么意义。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I wanna be an adventurer, not a preacher!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我想当冒险者，不想当传教士！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What does Zin need our gold for, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说，辛要我们的金子做什么？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Something seems a little bit odd about a God who wants to be paid.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"一个要收钱的神，总让人觉得有点不对劲。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I've got two hundred gold pieces. Is that enough to cure these mutations?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我有两百枚金币。够治好这些突变吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Didn't you like your horns?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你不喜欢自己的角吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If I give you twenty gold pieces, can you get rid of this nasty case of scales I've got?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"如果我给你二十枚金币，你能帮我治掉这身讨厌的鳞片吗？\"","@The_monster@ covers @possessive@ ears. \"Shut up!\"":"@The_monster@ 捂住@possessive@耳朵。\"闭嘴！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Wouldn't you get more for your money with Gozag?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"同样的钱，哥萨戈那边不是更划算吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's the point of being chivalric if nobody's going to be chivalric back?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"如果没人以骑士精神回报你，当骑士又有什么意义？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I open the door for a goblin; he punches me in the face. I hate chivalry.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我替一个地精开门；他一拳打在我脸上。我讨厌骑士精神。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Hah! I saw you coming a mile away.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哈！大老远就看见你了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You stick out like a sore thumb. Or at least, a shining one.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你特扎眼。至少可以说，耀眼夺目。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Won't need this ring of positive energy, then, will I?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那这正能量戒指是用不着了，对吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Can you turn the glow down a bit? I can't see you to hit you.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你能把光芒调暗一点吗？太亮了看不清打哪。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Cleansing flame? What's it supposed to be cleansing? The floor?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"净化之焰？净化什么？地板？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate haloes.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌光环。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Kikubaa-what? How do you even say that?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"奇库巴库……什么？这名字怎么念？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Sorry, didn't catch that. You worship who? How do you spell it?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"抱歉，没听清。你信谁？怎么拼？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Can you spell it for me - slowly?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你能拼给我听吗——慢点？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How do you pronounce that?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那个怎么发音？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Yuck, you smell of miasma!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"呕，你一身瘴气！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate wretches.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌活尸。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How deep do you have to dig to get a never-ending supply of wretches?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"要挖多深才能有源源不断的活尸？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You must really love pain. I hate it.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你一定很爱痛苦。我讨厌它。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Do you just use necromancy for everything, then?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你是不是什么事都用死灵术解决？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why a 'Demon-God'? Wouldn't a 'Zombie-God' be more appropriate?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"为什么是'恶魔之神'？'丧尸之神'不是更贴切吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate ruin.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌毁灭。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate despair.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌绝望。\"","@_yredelemnul_Donald_@":"@_yredelemnul_Donald_@","__NEXT":"__NEXT","@The_monster@ says, \"How does a bone dragon fly, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"话说骨龙到底是怎么飞的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How do you flay a ghost, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"话说鬼魂到底是怎么剥皮的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Pah! You're not even a real necromancer.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"呸！你连个真正的死灵法师都算不上。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Did you drop out of Necromancy School?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"你是从死灵术学校辍学了还是怎么的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Ah. You're responsible for all those zombies.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"啊。那些丧尸是你搞出来的吧。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Zombies? Spectres? Don't you get bored without any real company?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"丧尸？幽灵？没有真正的同伴，你不无聊吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Angels painted black are so last century.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"涂黑的天使早就过时了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If you wanted the light to be dimmer, you could have said so.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"你要是想暗一点，说一声不就行了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of torch can only be lit once per level?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"什么火炬一层楼只能点一次？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How does that torch stay lit when you throw its fire all over?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"你把火炬的火焰四处乱扔，它怎么还亮着？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate being shackled.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"我讨厌被束缚。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Okawaru always makes me think of chokos.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"奥卡瓦鲁总让我想起巧克力。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, hey! I could use a new shield. Have you got any spares?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哦，嘿！我正想换个新盾牌。你有备用的吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Nice kit.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"装备不错。\"","@The_monster@ asks, \"How many innocent creatures did you kill for those shoes?\"":"@The_monster@ 问道：\"你为了那双鞋杀了多少无辜生灵？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Okawaru's gifts are murder.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"奥卡瓦鲁的馈赠就是谋杀。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You can only wear one cloak at a time, you know?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你一次只能穿一件斗篷，知道吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Do you think you're a hero? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你以为自己是英雄？我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How much finesse does it take to swing your arms real fast, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说回来，快速挥舞手臂需要多少灵巧度？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I could take you in a fair duel. No cheating!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"公平决斗的话我能赢你。不许作弊！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"At least you've got demons for company.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"至少你有恶魔作伴。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are you sure that summoning demons is a good idea?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你确定召唤恶魔是个好主意？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Hey, watch where you throw those bolts!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"嘿，扔那些能量箭的时候看着点！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What will you do after everything's destroyed?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"等一切都毁灭之后，你打算做什么？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate demons.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌恶魔。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate blood.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌血。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate suffering.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌苦难。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate branding.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌烙印。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate pacts.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌契约。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the Hells.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌地狱诸界。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I just stubbed my toe. Does that mean I'm cleansed?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我刚才踢到了脚趾。这算被净化了吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If I carve 'Go Away' into myself, will Makhleb do that?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"如果我在自己身上刻'滚开'，马科列布会照做吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's the Crucible of Flesh? Some kind of fancy barbecue place?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"血肉熔炉是什么？某种高档烧烤店？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you wish for a portable bookcase?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你不想要一个便携书柜吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Imagine how many trees were cut down to fuel your hobby.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"想想为了满足你的爱好砍了多少树。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Man, that must be some big library.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"老天，那图书馆肯定很大。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Found the spell you wanted yet?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"找到你想要的法术了吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If you wanted to read so much, why didn't you become a librarian?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"既然这么爱看书，怎么不去当图书管理员？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Did you remember that thing that you forgot? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你想起你忘记的那件事了吗？我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"It's like an all you can read... something.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"就像无限畅读……什么的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate books.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌书。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Surely there's a limit to the number of books you can carry. Right?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你能带的书的数量肯定有限吧。对吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"It's good how you can learn magic as if by magic.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"不费吹灰之力就学会魔法，真不错。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate spells.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌法术。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you just hate miscasts?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你难道不讨厌法术失误吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"So, are you allowed to read books?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那么，你被允许看书吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You troglodyte!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你这穴居人！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I heard Trog has abandonment issues.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我听说特洛格有被抛弃的心理阴影。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I bet Trog's next axe will take you to the Abyss.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我敢打赌特洛格的下一把斧头会把你送进深渊。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I considered Trog, but the aftereffects of berserk scare me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我考虑过信特洛格，但狂暴的后遗症吓到我了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I bet you wish you could cast spells now, right?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我打赌你现在肯定希望自己能施法，对吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are you sure you're allowed to read scrolls?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你确定你被允许读卷轴吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Hey, I thought wands weren't allowed!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"嘿，我还以为魔杖也不许用呢！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If I tell you I hate magic, will you worship me?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"如果我说我讨厌魔法，你会来崇拜我吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate ogres.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌食人魔。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's all in the cards? Your future?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"牌里有什么？你的未来吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I bet you're feeling stupid now, huh?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我打赌你现在觉得自己很蠢，对吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If I draw a card, can you tell me which one it is?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我抽一张牌，你能告诉我是什么牌吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Where do you keep all those decks?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你那些牌组都藏哪了？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm sure I saw a card fall out of that deck.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我肯定看到有张牌从牌组里掉了出来。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I've seen this trick before. You've got the ace up your sleeve, right?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这招我看过了。你把王牌藏袖子里了，对吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You need to come to terms with your gambling problem.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你得正视自己的赌博问题了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How about a game of 52 card pickup?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"来一把五十二张牌捡捡乐怎么样？\"","@The_monster@ laughs, \"An explosive gambit... I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 笑道：\"一个爆炸性的开局……我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Whatever happened to, 'First, do no harm'?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"'首要之务是不伤害'这话怎么说来着？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Doesn't healing your enemies sound rather pointless?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"治疗你的敌人，听起来不是很蠢吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Maybe you should start praying.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"也许你该开始祈祷了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If I give you my weapon, will you leave me alone?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我把武器给你，你能别管我吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Come on. Make me an offer of peace that I can't refuse!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"来啊。提出一个我无法拒绝的和平条件！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"For every monster you don't kill, I'll kill three.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你每放过一个怪物，我就杀三个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why would you want to visit the Abyss? For a holiday?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"为什么要访问深渊？度假吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Nothing ever attacks me when I'm in the Abyss.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我在深渊里从没被袭击过。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are you going to banish me, too?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你也要放逐我吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The world's bad enough without you corrupting it.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这世道本来就够糟了，你还要去腐化它。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You must really love eldritch horrors. I hate them.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你一定很喜欢那些异界恐怖。我讨厌它们。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How can a god be banished to the Abyss?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"一个神祇怎么会被放逐到深渊？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Beogh must be pretty vain, having all those worshippers get remade in Beogh's image.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"比欧弗肯定很虚荣，让所有信徒都按比欧弗的形象重塑。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"One of the priests looked like she was going to ask me to join... I guess she changed her mind.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"有个祭司看起来要邀请我入伙……我猜她改了主意。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You think walking on water is cool? I can swim.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你觉得水上行走很酷？我会游泳。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Isn't it annoying when people just start challenging you, and you can't get away from them?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"总有人突然来挑战你，你还躲不开，烦不烦？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'd get sick of only having three followers at most.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"顶多只有三个信徒，我会腻的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How do you find enough ash and charcoal to anoint them all?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你是怎么找到足够的灰烬和木炭，给他们全都涂上的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You'll need more than orcs to take me on.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"想跟我打，光靠兽人可不够。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Do you like preaching on mountaintops?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你喜欢在山顶上布道吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What is divine providence, anyway? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"天意到底是什么？我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You'd better watch out. The one on the left looks like he gets lost easily.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你最好小心点。左边那个看起来容易迷路。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You think you're the Messiah? I met another orc who thought that, too.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你以为你是救世主？我遇到过另一个也这么想的兽人。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Messiah? I hate messiahs.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"救世主？我讨厌救世主。\"","@The_monster@ bows and submits to you. \"Nah, just kidding.\"":"@The_monster@ 向你鞠躬臣服。\"开玩笑的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't fight so hard! You'll just burn out.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"别打得太拼！你会把自己烧光的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Huh, so Ignis will die when you do... how's that make you feel?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哈，这么说伊格尼斯会随你一起死……你听了是什么感觉？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You'd think a god of fire would be a bit brighter.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你可能会以为火神会聪明一点。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Feel like your fire's burning out? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"觉得自己的火焰快熄了？我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You know a god's a real winner when you're their only follower, right?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"当一个神只有你一个信徒时，你就该知道他是真能处了，对吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, I wondered where that burning smell was coming from.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哦，我还纳闷那股焦味是从哪来的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why not join one of those new, up-and-coming flame gods instead?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"为什么不改信那些新兴的火焰神祇呢？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Doesn't it hurt to go crashing headfirst through the ceiling?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"一头撞穿天花板，不疼吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Wow, you can rise to a higher floor... isn't that called 'climbing stairs'?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哇，你能升到更高的楼层……那不就是'爬楼梯'吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Wow, fire everywhere! I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"哇，到处都是火！我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Come slime with me!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"跟我到史莱姆那边散个步！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You look a bit slimy.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你看起来有点黏糊糊的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Ah. That explains where all the items went.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"啊。这下知道那些东西都去哪了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are you going to open a jelly farm when you find the Orb?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"找到宝珠之后你打算开个史莱姆养殖场吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate it when jellies take over a level.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌史莱姆占领一整层。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Your jellies ate my lunch. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你的史莱姆吃了我的午餐。我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate slime.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌黏液。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You must hate doors a lot.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你一定很讨厌门。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If I pretend to be a jelly, can I have your stuff?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我装成史莱姆的话，能拿你的东西吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's with all that fungus?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那些真菌是怎么回事？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate [trees|plants|fungi].\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌[树木|植物|真菌]。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Do you like gardening? I hate gardening.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你喜欢园艺吗？我讨厌园艺。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"So, how do you deal with the weeds?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那么，你都是怎么对付杂草的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A plant spat acid at me. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"有棵植物朝我喷了酸液。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Better hope you don't develop allergies.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"最好祈祷你不会过敏。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Slow down!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"慢点！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You're not very quick on the uptake, are you?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你反应不太快，是吧？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You know, if you want, I know a very good posture trainer.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你知道吗，你要是想，我认识一个很棒的体态教练。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Am I talking too fast for you?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"是我说得太快了吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Look at me! I'm running, I'm running!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"看我！我在跑，我在跑！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Quick, run away!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"快，快跑！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How about we settle this with a race?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"要不咱们赛跑来一决胜负？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Xom? Are you insane?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"佐姆？你疯了吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I don't get Xom.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我搞不懂佐姆。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate Xom.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌佐姆。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate maniacal laughter.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌狂笑。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate divine lightning.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌神罚闪电。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If it's mutations you're wanting, wouldn't Jiyva be a better deal?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"如果你想要突变，吉瓦不是更好的选择吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hope you love dancing weapons. I hate them.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"希望你爱会跳舞的武器。我讨厌它们。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Been surrounded by packs of demons recently? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"最近有没有被成群恶魔包围？我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Xom just doesn't make any sense. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"佐姆就是不讲道理。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of name is 'Xom', anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说'佐姆'算什么名字？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What is a 'random number god' anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"'随机数之神'又是什么东西？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I had a teddy bear once. I hated it.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我以前有只泰迪熊。我讨厌它。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of god gives you spells but not spellbooks?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"什么神祇只给你法术却不给法术书？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Let it end in hellfire? Why is there only one hellfire spell?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"以地狱火终结一切？那为什么只有一种地狱火法术？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate Vehumet.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌维胡梅特。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate hellfire.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌地狱火。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's the point of conjuring, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说回来，念法术有什么意义？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Do you find it easier to cast spells, now?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你现在施法是不是更容易了？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate explosions.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌爆炸。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You're supposed to blow everything up for a god who barely gives you powers?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"一个几乎不给力量的所谓神祇，却指望你把一切都炸掉？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You seem like a real know-it-all. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你看起来像个无所不知的人。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What's the point of being all-knowing if you can't do anything?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"就算全知全能，要是啥也做不了，又有什么意义？\"","@The_monster@ makes a face at you and exclaims, \"Curses!\"":"@The_monster@ 朝你做了个鬼脸，喊道：\"该死！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I got nailed to the sky once. No big deal, really.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我以前被钉在天空上过一次。其实也没什么大不了的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate voyeurs.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌窥私癖。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What does a god have to do to get cursed, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"一个神到底要怎么做才会被诅咒？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Sounds like you're dealing with a pretty shady god there.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"听起来你侍奉的神祇可真够阴险的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'll bet you have a pretty dark future.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我打赌你的未来一片黑暗。\"","@The_monster@ squints around. \"I can't see a thing. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 眯起眼睛环顾四周。\"我什么都看不见。我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate shadows.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌影子。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate starless nights.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌没有星星的夜晚。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are you still afraid of the dark?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你到现在还怕黑吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Careful; you might trip over your own shadow.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"小心点；说不定会被自己的影子绊倒。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Spare some coin?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"赏点硬币？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the rich.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌有钱人。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I bet you have to pay people to get friends.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我打赌你交朋友都得花钱。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Couldn't find enough potions?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"药剂不够用了？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"So the shops here weren't enough for you?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这里的商店还满足不了你？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I saw some gold over there. Quick, better go get it!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那边有金币。快，赶紧去捡！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What do potions have to do with a god of gold, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"话说回来，药剂跟金币之神有什么关系？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If you give me all your gold, I promise I'll be your friend too.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"把你全部金币给我，我保证也会做你的朋友。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How do you sleep at night with all those storm clouds?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"整天被那些暴风云笼罩着，你怎么睡得着？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Must be pretty hard to see through all that dust.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"满天尘土肯定很难看清东西。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate storms.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌暴风雨。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate disasters.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌灾难。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate elementals.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌元素。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What was that? Sorry, I couldn't hear you over all this noise.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你说什么？抱歉，太吵了听不见。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Well, at least you're never short of company.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"嗯，起码你永远不缺伴。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Great. Now my shield is all dirty.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"太好了。现在我的盾牌都脏了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Missing something?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"缺了点什么？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate sacrifices.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌献祭。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate sacrificants.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌献祭者。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Once, I gave up eating meat for a week. I hated that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"有一次，我戒肉戒了一周。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Once, I gave up drinking for a week. I hated that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"有一次，我戒酒戒了一周。我讨厌那样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate hidden layers of reality.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌隐藏的现实层次。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate existential doubt.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌存在主义的怀疑。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The great annihilating truth is that I hate you.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"伟大的湮灭真理就是我讨厌你。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate inventors.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌发明家。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What are you with all those gadgets, some kind of pawn shop?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你带那么多小玩意儿，是开当铺的吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What would you do with the Orb, anyway? Experiment on it?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你拿了宝珠打算干嘛？拿来做实验？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Bet you can't [analyse|invent] your way out of this one.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"赌你这次[分析|发明]不出什么花样来。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Can I borrow that [wand|lamp|fan] for a second? You must have some to spare.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"能借你那[魔杖|灯|扇子]用一下吗？你肯定有多余的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I went to a family reunion once. I hated it.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我参加过家族聚会。我讨厌那回事。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Who would want to remember their ancestors? They're dead.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"谁会想记住自己的祖先？他们都死了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"If your ancestor was so tough and powerful, how come they're dead?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你祖先要真有那么厉害，他怎么死的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Would you happen to remember where the Orb is?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"顺带问一句，你记不记得宝珠在哪？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Ghost stories? Ooh, I'm so scared!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"鬼故事？哦哟，吓死我了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Isn't it convenient that your ancestor always knows how to fight?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你祖先永远知道怎么打架，真方便不是吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I forgot what I was going to say. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我忘了我刚才想说什么。我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Dance? No thanks, I don't dance.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"跳舞？不了，我不跳舞。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate drums.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌鼓声。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate chants.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌吟唱。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Poetry of the foot? All you're doing is stomping around.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"足尖诗篇？你不过是跺跺脚罢了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You look ridiculous with all that flailing around.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你手舞足蹈的样子看上去真可笑。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"That's not dancing; that's just a fancy way of killing things.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"那不叫跳舞；那只是杀人的花哨方式。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of dance blows up spectators?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"什么舞会连观众一起炸飞的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Path? I don't see a path anywhere.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"道？哪里有什么道。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You're jumping off the walls? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你在墙上跳来跳去？我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Watching you spin around is making me dizzy. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"看你转来转去我头都晕了。我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Why not just HIT them without all this spinning and flipping nonsense?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"直接打不行吗，非要又转又翻的？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you get tired of all these old geezers telling you what to do?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"整天听这些老家伙指手画脚，你不累吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"No way as a way? Sounds like nonsense.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"无道即是道？听着就像胡扯。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you get lonely without a god?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"没有神，你不觉得孤单吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the gods.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌诸神。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate atheists.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我讨厌无神论者。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the gods, and the gods hate me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我恨诸神，诸神也恨我。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You must run out of gods to curse by.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你一定把能用来赌咒的神都骂光了吧。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Did you miss the Ecumenical Temple?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你错过了普世神庙吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You're really ugly. Did you know that?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你真丑。你知道吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"This is such a pointless quest.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这真是个毫无意义的远征。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"They wouldn't let me join their adventuring club without the Orb.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"没有宝珠，他们不让我加入他们的冒险俱乐部。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate this place.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我恨这地方。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hate you, too.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我也恨你。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"My feet hurt.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我的脚疼。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"My hands hurt, too.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我的手也疼。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I think I'm starting to get a cough. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我觉得我开始咳嗽了。我恨那个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I've got a headache. I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我头疼。我恨那个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"That colour you're wearing? I hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你穿的那颜色？我恨那个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Like 