 说：\"被放逐到深渊了。我讨厌这样。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I won. I... don't hate that.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我赢了。我……倒也不讨厌这个。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Well, maybe you weren't so bad after all.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"嗯，也许你也没那么差劲嘛。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes with grief.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@悲痛地颤抖。","@The_monster@ says, \"Magic will overcome all!\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"魔法终将战胜一切！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Her death will not be in vain!\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"她的死不会白费的！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How can I live without her?\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"没有她，我该怎么活下去？\"","@The_monster@ breathes, \"And she was my only...\"":"@The_monster@轻声说出：\"而她是我唯一的……\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I will find her! I will get her back!\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"我会找到她的！我会把她带回来！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"She won't be lost forever!\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"她不会永远消失的！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I will find a way to undo this!\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"我会找到办法挽回这一切！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Turn her back! At once!\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"把她变回来！立刻！\"","@_Dowan_common_@":"@_Dowan_common_@","@_Dowan_rare_@":"@_Dowan_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ cries in horror.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 惊恐地哭喊着。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ smirks and points a slender finger @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 得意地笑着，朝 @foe@ 伸出一根修长的手指。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My weaknesses are her strengths!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我的弱点就是她的强项！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Stay away from my face!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"离我的脸远点！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Magic and the sword, together, will defeat you.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"魔法与剑，合在一起，将打败你。\" @player_only@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ throws and catches a handful of magical flame, then smirks.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 抛起又接住一把魔法火焰，然后得意地笑了。","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ robes are whipped around by a magical breeze.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@长袍被一阵魔法微风吹得飘起。","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ feet meld with the ground, briefly.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双脚短暂地与地面融为了一体。","VI