_monster@ shakes in grief and horror.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@在悲痛和恐惧中颤抖。","@The_monster@ says, \"What have I done? What have I done?\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"我做了什么？我做了什么？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"How can I live after this?\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"在这之后我该怎么活下去？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I will get him back!\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"我会把他带回来的！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ is wide-eyed with horror.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@惊恐地瞪大了眼睛。","@The_monster@ shakes @possessive@ head, saying, \"No, no, no!\"":"@The_monster@摇着@possessive@头说道：\"不，不，不！\"","@The_monster@ screams, \"No! What have I done?\"":"@The_monster@尖叫道：\"不！我做了什么？\"","@_Duvessa_common_@":"@_Duvessa_common_@","@_Duvessa_rare_@":"@_Duvessa_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures with @possessive@ weapon @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 用@possessive@武器朝 @foe@ 比划了一下。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My weaknesses are his strengths!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我的弱点就是他的强项！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Where magic fails, the sword succeeds!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"魔法失败的地方，剑就会成功！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"When magic and the sword combine, nothing stands against them.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"当魔法与剑合在一起，没什么能挡在它们面前。\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@ @to_foe@, \"You can run, but you cannot escape us forever!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ @_shouts_@：\"你可以跑，但你永远也逃不出我们的手心！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I don't care about looks, I care about technique!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我不在乎外表，我在乎的是技巧！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Did you see that move? Perfect!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你看见那个动作了吗？完美！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Beauty is only skin deep, and my weapons penetrate much further than that.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"美貌只是表面的，而我的武器能穿透得比那深得多。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Practise, practise, practise! One day you'll be as good as me.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"练习，练习，练习！总有一天你会和我一样好。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ screams in rage.":"@The_monster@ 愤怒地尖叫着。","@The_monster@ screams, \"No! How DARE you!\"":"@The_monster@ 尖叫道：\"不！你怎么敢！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ weeps, and shakes @possessive@ weapon @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 哭泣着，朝 @foe@ 挥舞着 @possessive@武器。","@The_monster@ screams in a voice full of rage, \"No, no!\"":"@The_monster@ 用充满怒火的声音尖叫道：\"不，不！\"","@The_monster@ shouts wrathfully, \"No!\"":"@The_monster@ 愤怒地喊道：\"不！\"","You hear a distant scream of rage.":"你听到远处传来一声愤怒的尖叫。","@The_monster@ screams in horror.":"@The_monster@惊恐地尖叫。","@The_monster@ screams, \"NO! What have I done?\"":"@The_monster@尖叫道：\"不！我做了什么？\"","@Duvessa_Dowan_dies_distance@":"@Duvessa_Dowan_dies_distance@","@_Edmund_common_@":"@_Edmund_common_@","@_Edmund_rare_@":"@_Edmund_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures @at_foe@ with @possessive@ flail.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 用 @possessive@链枷朝 @foe@ 比划了一下。","@The_monster@ clears @possessive@ throat.":"@The_monster@ 清了清 @possessive@喉咙。","@The_monster@ says, \"You wouldn't believe how much I paid for this flail.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你不会相信我花了多少钱买这把链枷。\"","@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Have you met my wondrous brother?\"":"@The_monster@ 问 @foe,@「你见过我那了不起的哥哥吗？」","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I might not be good at magic, but I can still kill you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我虽然不擅长魔法，但我还是能杀了你！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"People think my brother is the best. I think he's crazy.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"人人都觉得我哥最厉害。我觉得他疯了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm quite good with sums, too.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我还挺擅长算数的。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"People accused me of being a cutpurse!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"居然有人诬陷我是扒手！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ grinds @possessive@ teeth, and then sighs.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 磨了磨@possessive@牙，然后叹了口气。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks rather jealous.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 看起来相当嫉妒。","@The_monster@ says, \"A flail is better than a scythe, any day of the week!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"链枷比镰刀强多了，一周哪一天都是！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What use are spells, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"法术到底有什么用？\"","@The_monster@ mutters, \"Who needs spells, anyway?\"":"@The_monster@ 咕哝道：\"谁需要法术啊？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Everyone always remembers my brother. 'Who's Edmund?' they ask!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"人人都记得我哥。'埃德蒙是谁？'他们都这么问！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"People will remember me! They'll remember me and die!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"人们会记住我的！他们会记住我，然后死掉！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Maybe I'll buy a title. How does Count Edmund sound?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"也许我该买个爵位。埃德蒙伯爵听起来如何？\"","@The_monster@ whines, \"My parents never had time for me!\"":"@The_monster@ 哀怨道：\"我父母从来没时间陪我！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"That'll show my brother!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这下我哥该服气了吧！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'd like to see a scythe do that!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我倒想看看镰刀能不能做到这个！\"","@The_monster@ whines, \"They better pay attention to me now!\"":"@The_monster@ 哀怨道：\"他们最好现在注意到我了！\"","@_Erica_common_@":"@_Erica_common_@","@_Erica_rare_@":"@_Erica_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ writhes her tentacles angrily.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 愤怒地扭动着她的触手。","@The_monster@ burbles wildly.":"@The_monster@ 疯狂地咕噜着。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm so much better than you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我比你强太多了。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I love to horrify, but killing's even better.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我喜欢吓人，但杀戮更棒。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Fast and perfect. Such is my way of killing.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"又快又完美。这就是我的杀戮之道。\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Your blood will spurt and your skin will burst!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"你的血会喷涌，你的皮会炸裂！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Hurry, death AWAITS you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"快，死亡在等着你！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'll never tell where it is!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"我绝不会告诉你在哪！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You'll never get it!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"你永远也得不到它！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The claw is nothing compared to the sucker!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"爪子跟吸盘比起来，不值一提！\"","@The_monster@ boasts @to_foe@, \"If terror be the object, I am a masterpiece!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 夸耀道：\"如果恐怖是目标，我就是杰作！\"","@The_monster@ boasts @to_foe@, \"Reason would be justified, if not for me!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 夸耀道：\"理性本应合理——要不是有我的话！\"","@The_monster@ begins burbling mirthfully and uncontrollably.":"@The_monster@ 开始欢快地、不可抑制地咕噜起来。","@_Erolcha_common_@":"@_Erolcha_common_@","@_Erolcha_rare_@":"@_Erolcha_rare_@","@The_monster@ roars.":"@The_monster@ 咆哮着。","@The_monster@ growls.":"@The_monster@ 低吼着。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to grin evilly.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 试图邪恶地咧嘴笑。","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"DIE!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"死！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Lunch!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"午餐！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Erolcha kill you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"伊罗查杀了你！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Eat!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"吃！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Stand! Erolcha hit you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"站住！伊罗查打你！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Blood!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"血！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Erolcha crush your head!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"伊罗查捏碎你的头！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Erolcha happy to kill you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"伊罗查很高兴杀你！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Erolcha angry!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"伊罗查生气了！\"","@The_monster@ screams, \"Wait! Erolcha supposed to do that!\"":"@The_monster@ 尖叫道：\"等等！该由伊罗查来做这件事！\"","@_Eustachio_common_@":"@_Eustachio_common_@","@_Eustachio_rare_@":"@_Eustachio_rare_@","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"At last I'll have my revenge!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"我终于要复仇了！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Hey, you killed my favourite bat!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"嘿，你杀了我最心爱的蝙蝠！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Summoning is fun!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"召唤术真好玩！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My allies will avenge me.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我的盟友会为我复仇。\"","@The_monster@ screams, \"This atrocity can only be purified with blood!\"":"@The_monster@ 尖叫道：\"这种暴行只能用鲜血来净化！\"","@The_monster@ utters an oath, \"I will die for my friends!\"":"@The_monster@ 立下誓言：\"我要为朋友们而死！\"","@The_monster@ growls, \"To hell with you, honourless miscreant!\"":"@The_monster@ 低吼道：\"见鬼去吧，无荣誉的恶棍！\"","@The_monster@ asks, \"How can you live without manners, virtues and honour?\"":"@The_monster@ 问：\"没有礼貌、美德与荣誉，你怎么活得下去？\"","@The_monster@ yells @at_foe@, \"Perjured traitor, DIE!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 喊道：\"发假誓的叛徒，去死！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ twirls @possessive@ moustache.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 捻着@possessive@胡子。","@The_monster@ calls on the powers of shadow!":"@The_monster@ 呼唤着阴影的力量！","@The_monster@ brags, \"I can call spirits from the vasty deep.\"":"@The_monster@ 吹嘘道：\"我能从无垠深渊唤来魂灵。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Such is the fate of all honourless rascals.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"所有无荣誉的流氓都是这个下场。\"","@_Frances_common_@":"@_Frances_common_@","@_Frances_rare_@":"@_Frances_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ sneers @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 朝 @foe@ 冷笑了一声。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ runs a finger over @possessive@ scar.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 用手指抚过@possessive@伤疤。","@The_monster@ speaks in an indecipherable language.":"@The_monster@ 说着一种无法理解的语言。","@The_monster@ mutters a nigh-unspeakable word.":"@The_monster@ 咕哝出一个几乎不可言说的词。","@The_monster@ says, \"Show me proof of your conquests, and I will call you a great adventurer.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"拿出你征服的战绩给我看，我就称你为伟大的冒险者。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"I command an army of devils. What do you command?\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我统率着一支魔鬼大军。你统率着什么？\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"I value strength and power. I see none of this in you.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我看重力量与权势。而在你身上，我一点也看不到。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"I speak the language of demons!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我说的是恶魔的语言！\"","@The_monster@ howls an indescribable curse.":"@The_monster@ 嚎叫出一句难以形容的诅咒。","@The_monster@ says, \"I have seen worlds and universes beyond all imagining.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我见过超乎一切想象的世界与宇宙。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ takes a defensive stance.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 摆出了防御架势。","@The_monster@ growls a series of guttural syllables.":"@The_monster@ 低吼出一连串喉音音节。","@The_monster@ says, \"There is a strange beauty in the demonic, don't you think?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"恶魔之中有一种奇异的美，你不觉得吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Would you challenge me, knowing my power?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"明知我的力量，你还敢挑战我吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I am undefeated in single-handed combat.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"在单打独斗中我未尝一败。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Warriors are made for war and combat. Do you call yourself a warrior?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"战士为战争与搏斗而生。你配称自己为战士吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Even the Halls of Hell could not contain me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"就连地狱的大殿也困不住我。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I will defeat you, of this I have no doubt!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我会打败你，对此我毫不怀疑！\" @player_only@","@_Frederick_common_@":"@_Frederick_common_@","@_Frederick_rare_@":"@_Frederick_rare_@","@The_monster@ says, \"You didn't bring enough reinforcements. Come back later!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你带的援兵不够。等叫齐了再来！\"","@Frederick@":"@Frederick@","@The_monster@ says, \"Pah! Those who rely on gods for strength get nowhere in life.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"呸！靠神祇获取力量的人注定一事无成。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ pines for a worthy opponent.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 渴望一个值得一战的对手。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ yawns in an exaggerated manner.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 夸张地打了个哈欠。","@The_monster@ offers a few words of tactical advice.":"@The_monster@ 说了几句战术建议。","@The_monster@ says, \"Adventurers these days do not know how to walk, let alone fight.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"如今的冒险者连走路都不会，更别提战斗了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"In my day, to be a hero meant something. Now, it just means you die quicker.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"在我那个年代，当英雄是有分量的。现在嘛，只意味着你死得更快。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You call yourself an adventurer? Hah!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你也配叫冒险者？哈！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I've killed five 'adventurers' today. Will you be the sixth?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我今天已经宰了五个'冒险者'了。你会是第六个吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Challenge me? You, and whose army?\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"挑战我？就凭你和你那根本不存在的军队？\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Why should I even bother fighting the likes of you?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我为什么要费心跟你这种人打？\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ polishes @possessive@ monocle.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 擦拭着@possessive@单片眼镜。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks bored.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 显得百无聊赖。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ sighs.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 叹了口气。","@The_monster@ rants about the fall of honour.":"@The_monster@ 慷慨激昂地痛斥荣誉的沦丧。","@The_monster@ says, \"All of you adventurers look the same to me! Bumbling weaklings, the lot!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你们这些冒险者在我眼里全都一个样！笨手笨脚的软蛋，一帮子！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"For you, today is the most challenging fight of your life. For me... well, I will have lunch shortly.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"对你而言，今天是你人生中最艰难的一战。对我嘛……嗯，我马上要去吃午饭了。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"Perhaps I should have been a lumberjack. The trees might put up more of a fight.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"也许我该去当个伐木工。那些树说不定还能多撑一会儿。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Killing you would be a chore, not a joy.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"杀你是个苦差事，而不是乐事。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ eyes @foe@ carefully. \"They told me only worthy opponents would get this far.\"":"@The_monster@ 仔细打量着@foe@。\"他们告诉我，只有够格的对手才能走到这一步。\"","@The_monster@ scoffs, \"You didn't have a chance.\"":"@The_monster@ 嗤笑道：\"你根本没有机会。\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Someday I'll have a real challenge.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹气道：\"总有一天我会遇到真正的挑战。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What a chore.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"真是苦差事。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You don't even know how to die right.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你连怎么死都不会。\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Killing weak @player_genus_plural@ does nothing to prove my superiority.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹气道：\"杀死弱小的@player_genus_plural@丝毫不能证明我的优越。\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Another waste of time.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹气道：\"又浪费了一次时间。\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Your wits are somehow even duller than your claws.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹气道：\"你的才智竟比你的爪子还要迟钝。\"","@The_monster@ shakes @possessive@ head sadly, \"Willingly donning a god's shackles... pitiful.\"":"@The_monster@ 悲哀地摇了摇@possessive@头，\"甘愿戴上神祇的枷锁……可悲。\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Your brethren were only holding you back, @player_genus@.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹了口气，\"你的同族只会拖你后腿，@player_genus@。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Be happy - you can't get any slower than dead.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"高兴点吧——你再也不能比死更慢了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Time for you to vanish into the darkness.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"该你消失在黑暗中了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Healer, heal thyself.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"医者，自医吧。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You're grass, mortal.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你只是杂草罢了，凡人。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Your greed held you back.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你的贪婪拖了你的后腿。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Relying on the deeds of your ancestors brought you no glory.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"依赖祖先的功绩并没有给你带来荣耀。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Foolish to worship a god whose flame is even dimmer than you.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"崇拜一个火焰比你还要暗淡的神祇，真是愚蠢。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Our battle was as dull and shapeless as your god.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我们的战斗和你侍奉的神祇一样，乏味无形。\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Join the corpses you idolise, mortal.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹了口气，\"加入你崇拜的尸堆中去吧，凡人。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A more permanent form of banishment for you, mortal.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"给你一个更加永久的放逐方式，凡人。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"And take your demons with you.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"把你的恶魔也带走吧。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Looks like you fold, gambler.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"看来你输光了，赌徒。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Now do you deem me a worthy opponent?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"现在你觉得我是值得尊敬的对手了吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Finally, I'll be able to get some peace and quiet.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"终于，我能清静一会儿了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You gave up too much of yourself.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你放弃了自己太多了。\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Relying on the knowledge of others got you nowhere, mortal.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹了口气，\"依赖别人的知识让你一无所成，凡人。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm sure you'll make a fine angry ghost.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我肯定你会成为一个不错的愤怒鬼魂。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You've danced your last steps.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你已经跳完了最后的舞步。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A mage should rely only on their own abilities.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"法师应该只靠自己的能力。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You should only rely on techniques you've developed yourself.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你只应该依赖自己研习的技巧。\"","@The_monster@ frowns, \"Willingly giving yourself over as a plaything to Xom... strange behaviour.\"":"@The_monster@ 皱起眉头，\"甘愿把自己当作佐姆的玩物……真是奇怪。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Find comfort in joining the legions you worship.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"加入你崇拜的军团，从中找到安慰吧。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The only thing more annoying than a worshipper is a proselytiser.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"比信徒更烦人的只有传教者。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"The adventurer who shines twice as bright burns out twice as fast.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"燃烧得加倍明亮的冒险者，熄灭得也加倍快。\"","@_Fannar_common_@":"@_Fannar_common_@","@_Fannar_rare_@":"@_Fannar_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ glares icily @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 冷冷地瞪着@foe@。","VISUAL:Some snowflakes condense on @the_monster@.":"VISUAL:一些雪花凝结在 @the_monster@ 身上。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ brushes some snowflakes from @possessive@ robe.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 从 @possessive@长袍上拂去几片雪花。","@The_monster@ murmurs some mystic words to @reflexive@.":"@The_monster@ 对着 @reflexive@ 低语了几句神秘的话语。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Freeze!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"冻结！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I shall freeze you to your soul!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我要把你冻到灵魂深处！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"An icy embrace awaits you...\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"一个冰冷的拥抱在等着你……\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will make a fine ice sculpture.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你会成为一座精美的冰雕。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Does this not give you the chills?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"这难道不让你胆寒吗？\"","@_Gastronok_common_@":"@_Gastronok_common_@","@_Gastronok_rare_@":"@_Gastronok_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ sloshes about.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 摇晃着发出噗噗声。","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"I'll eat you, I will!\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"我会吃了你的，一定会的！\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"A snack! A snack!\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"点心！点心！\"","@The_monster@ makes a strange noise.":"@The_monster@ 发出了一种奇怪的声音。","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ mouth opens, radula flailing wildly.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@嘴张开，齿舌疯狂地挥舞着。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ is buffeted by a sudden breeze.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 被一阵突然的微风吹得东倒西歪。","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyestalks wobble, almost dislodging @possessive@ wizard hat.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@眼柄晃动着，差点把 @possessive@巫师帽抖下来。","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"You're how I like my food. Fast!\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"你这速度正好是我喜欢的食物。快！\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Slow down, so I can eat you.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"慢下来，让我吃了你。\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Are you a wizard? Wizards taste nice...\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"你是法师吗？法师味道好……\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Huuuuuuuuuuungry!\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"饿饿饿饿饿饿——！\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"It's true, you are what you eat.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"真的，人如其食。\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"I bet you'll be tasty.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"我打赌你会很好吃。\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Time to dig in!\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"开吃的时间到了！\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"About time. I'm starving!\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"终于。我快饿死了！\"","@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Let's see if you taste as good as that wizard did.\"":"@The_monster@ 咕噜道：\"让我看看你是不是和那个法师一样好吃。\"","@_Grinder_common_@":"@_Grinder_common_@","@_Grinder_rare_@":"@_Grinder_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ grins, showing sharp teeth.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 咧嘴露出锋利的牙齿。","@The_monster@ says, \"You look like you could use a good racking.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你看起来需要来一场好的拉肢刑。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I used to sell toenails on the black market.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我以前在黑市卖过脚趾甲。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"There's only one good use for a tongue: cutting it out.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"舌头只有一个好用处：割掉。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Mostly I couldn't keep them alive.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"大多数情况下我都没能让他们活下来。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"DUCK!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"趴下！\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"No one appreciates my work.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹了口气：\"没人欣赏我的工作。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Wait up.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"等一下。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Just stop there for a second...\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"就站在那里别动一下……\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't move a muscle.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"别动一根肌肉。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Tell me all your secrets, or I'll kill you.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"告诉我你所有的秘密，否则我就杀了你。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Are you a fish?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你是鱼吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What is the universe for?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"宇宙是为了什么？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"My boss said I was rubbish. His entrails said otherwise.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我老板说我是废物。他的内脏说了相反的话。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"At least @my_God@ appreciates what I'm doing.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"至少 @my_God@ 欣赏我的工作。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Make like a tree!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"表现得像棵树！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ rolls @possessive@ eyes.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 翻了翻 @possessive@眼睛。","@The_monster@ says, \"Now the real fun starts!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"真正的乐趣现在才开始！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Hey, I wasn't done torturing you yet!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"嘿，我还没折磨完你呢！\"","@The_monster@ sighs, \"Dead already? I want a refund.\"":"@The_monster@ 叹了口气：\"已经死了？我要退款。\"","@_Grum_common_@":"@_Grum_common_@","@_Grum_rare_@":"@_Grum_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ bares @possessive@ teeth.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 露出了 @possessive@牙齿。","@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@.":"@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@。","@The_monster@ stares @at_foe@ intently and @_Grum_verb_@.":