 right?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"出卖灵魂也没那么糟。反正都是地狱了，对吧？\"","@The_monster@ moans, \"It's cold... so cold.\"":"@The_monster@呻吟道：\"好冷……太冷了。\"","@_Harold_common_@":"@_Harold_common_@","@_Harold_rare_@":"@_Harold_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks eager to get this over with.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 看起来急于把这事了结。","@The_monster@ yells @at_foe@, \"I don't have all day!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 喊道：\"我可没一整天时间！\"","@The_monster@ grumbles @at_foe@, \"Just give up already, I want to go home!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 嘟囔道：\"赶紧放弃吧，我想回家了！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I was hoping my final job would be more of a challenge, but money is money.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"我本来希望最后一单工作更有挑战性的，但钱就是钱。\"","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Can you die now? I had plans for the rest of the day!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 喊道：\"你现在能死了吗？我今天还有别的计划！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Do you have any idea what people are willing to pay to have you killed, @player_name@?\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你知道有人愿意出多少钱来要你的命吗，@player_name@？\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Let's make it quick, okay? I've got mouths to feed.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"咱们快点，好吗？我还有嘴要喂呢。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Listen, it's nothing personal. It's just a job.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"听着，这不是私人恩怨。只是工作而已。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"This is so exciting! What a great way to end my career!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"这太令人兴奋了！用这个来结束我的职业生涯真是太好了！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Ah, this is what I got into this business for!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"啊，我就是为了这个才入这行的！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ pauses a moment, imagining something with a smile on @possessive@ face.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 停顿了片刻，@possessive@脸上带着微笑想象着什么。","@The_monster@ considers, \"I think I'll use your bounty to get a @_Harold_retirement_plan_@...\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 盘算道：\"我想用你的赏金买个 @_Harold_retirement_plan_@……\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ asks, \"Do you mind if I name my boat the '@player_name@'? Your head will