oe@ 说：\"我守着宝库，很好！你不许进！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ stamps @possessive@ feet.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@跺了跺@possessive@脚。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Work for me? I pay good.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"给我干活？我出好价钱。\"","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Taste the thunder!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 吼道：\"尝尝雷霆！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ adjusts @possessive@ apparatus.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@调整了一下@possessive@装置。","@The_monster@ shouts, \"Zap! Ha ha ha, made you jump.\"":"@The_monster@吼道：\"电击！哈哈哈，吓了你一跳。\"","@The_monster@ roars, \"I Iron Bound! You Brass... Trash!\"":"@The_monster@咆哮道：\"我铁打的！你废铜……烂铁！\"","@The_monster@ grins wickedly and says, \"Money make world go round.\"":"@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴一笑，说：\"钱让世界转。\"","@The_monster@ winks @at_foe@ and says, \"Everything have price.\"":"@The_monster@ 朝 @foe@ 眨了眨眼，说：\"万物皆有价。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"All wealth is product of labour.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"一切财富都是劳动的产物。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Productive ogre is happy ogre.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"有生产力的食人魔是快乐的食人魔。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I proud of my employees.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"我为我的员工自豪。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Lodul motto: Secure Vault? My fault!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"罗杜尔座右铭：宝库安全？我的功劳！\"","@The_monster@ frowns @at_foe@ and says, \"You violating area security.\"":"@The_monster@ 朝 @foe@ 皱起眉头，说：\"你正在违反区域安全条例。\"","@_Louise_common_@":"@_Louise_common_@","@_Louise_rare_@":"@_Louise_rare_@","@The_monster@ says, \"Want to take a trip?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"想来一次旅行吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Even the Abyss couldn't kill me! What makes you think you can?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"就连深渊都没能杀死我！你凭什么觉得你能？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Powers from beyond reality are at my beck and call!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"超越现实的力量任由我召唤！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Need a shortcut to the ORB? Here, let me help!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"需要一条通往宝珠的捷径吗？来，让我帮你！\"","@The_monster@ gibbers incoherently.":"@The_monster@ 语无伦次地胡言乱语着。","@The_monster@ screams!":"@The_monster@ 尖叫着！","@The_monster@ laughs uncontrollably.":"@The_monster@ 不可抑制地