 the way forward.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @reflexive@ 咕哝道：\"兰斯大师不会要我回去了。这就是前进的路。\"","@_Mara_common_@":"@_Mara_common_@","@_Mara_rare_@":"@_Mara_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ face changes twice.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@脸庞变幻了两次。","@The_monster@ says, \"I mislead the hearts of men!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我误导凡人的心灵！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"What good are steel and magic against my illusions?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"钢铁与魔法在我的幻象面前有什么用？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Entranced by some poetic flight, are you?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"被某种诗意的遐想迷住了，是吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Bound art thou by all the snares!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你已被重重陷阱束缚！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ points ostentatiously.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 炫耀般地一指。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ weaves an illusion.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 编织出一道幻象。","@The_monster@ screams, \"Tenfold be your damnation!\"":"@The_monster@ 尖叫道：\"愿你的诅咒加重十倍！\"","@The_monster_possessive@ features momentarily become yours. \"Wouldst slay thyself?\"":"@The_monster_possessive@面容瞬间变成了你的模样。\"你可愿杀死自己？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I stand as high above you as a star above the ocean's bottom.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我凌驾于你之上，正如星辰高悬于海底之上。\"","@The_monster@ smirks. \"I am one who seeks the Path and the Right.\"":"@The_monster@ 得意地一笑。\"我是寻求正道与真理之人。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Thou art lean, ill-favoured, death is in thy neighbourhood!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你瘦削、丑陋，死亡就在你身边！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Difficult is the way of exertion, difficult to pass, difficult to enter upon.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"精进之道艰难，难以通过，难以踏入。\"","@The_monster@ calls, \"Stop! In seven days from now the wheel of empire will appear!\"":"@The_monster@ 高呼：\"停下！七日之后，帝国之轮将现！\"","@The_monster@ boasts, \"I am lord over the four continents and the two thousand adjacent isles.\"":"@The_monster@ 夸耀道：\"我是四大陆与两千毗邻岛屿之主。\"","@The_monster@ smirks. \"I shall give thine eyesight a greater riddle by far.\"":"@The_monster@ 得意地一笑。\"我要出一个远比这难懂的谜语，考考你的眼力。\"","@_Margery_common_@":"@_Margery_common_@","@_Margery_rare_@":"@_