_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to stalk through the shadows.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 试图潜行穿过阴影。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ lashes his vines and gnashes his teeth.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 抽动着藤蔓，咬牙切齿。","@The_monster@ says, \"Nice gear. Can I borrow some?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"好装备。能借我用用吗？\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"Mine, all mine!\"":"@The_monster@ 喊道：\"我的，全是我的！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks lost in thought, consulting taken memories.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@眼神恍惚，似乎在翻阅窃取的记忆。","@The_monster@ says, \"Lost something?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"丢了什么东西吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Very interesting.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"非常有趣。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Have you got some gold to spare?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"有金币可以施舍吗？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Betcha didn't see that coming, eh?\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你肯定没想到这一手吧，嗯？\"","@The_monster@ says to @foe@, \"Money or life? Never mind, I think I'll take both.\"":"@The_monster@ 对@foe@说：\"要钱还是要命？算了，我两个都要。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Killing adventurers, taking their stuff. It's what he did, it's what I do.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"杀掉冒险者，拿走他们的东西。他当年是这么干的，我也是。\"","@The_monster@ grunts, \"Curses!\"":"@The_monster@咕哝道：\"该死的！\"","@The_monster@ mutters, \"Now where did you hide it?\"":"@The_monster@嘟囔道：\"你把它藏哪了？\"","@The_monster@ groans, \"What are you, a monk?\"":"@The_monster@呻吟道：\"你是什么，苦行僧吗？\"","w:70":"w:70","@The_monster@ clumsily fails to latch onto your valuables.":"@The_monster@笨拙地没能抓住你的财物。","@The_monster@ fumbles for your pockets and misses.":"@The_monster@摸索你的口袋却扑了个空。","@The_monster@ lunges for your pockets and trips.":"@The_monster@扑向你的口袋却绊倒了。","@The_monster@ sings off-key, \"You got some money for me?\"":"@The_monster@走调地唱着：\"有没有钱给我呀？\"","@_Menkaure_common_@":"@_Menkaure_common_@","@_Menkaure_rare_@":"@_Menkaure_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ bandages flutter.":"VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@裹尸布飘动着。","@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@ in an indecipherable tongue.":"@The_monster@ 用一种无法辨识的语言 @_Menkaure_verb_@。","@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"Why can't you leave me to my rest?\"":"@The_monster@ @_wails_@：\"为什么你们不能让我安息？\"","@The_monster@ giggles, \"These cerements are ticklish...\"":"@The_monster@ 咯咯笑道：\"这裹尸布好痒……\"","@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@, \"Let me perform the rites...\"":"@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@：\"让我来履行仪式……\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ breathes soot at you.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 朝你呼出了烟灰。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ blazes with dark energy!":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 迸发出黑暗的能量！","@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@ a few words.":"@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@几个词。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@ drily.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 干巴巴地@_Menkaure_verb_@。","@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@, \"It doesn't hurt if you pull your brain out of your nose yourself.\"":"@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@：\"如果你自己把脑子从鼻子里拉出来，其实不疼。\"","@The_monster_possessive@ ankle releases a plume of dust as @subjective@ confides, \"I'm not really a mummy, you know.\"":"@The_monster_possessive@脚踝释放出一缕尘烟，@subjective@坦白道：\"其实我不是真的木乃伊，你知道的。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ forgets how to speak, silenced by the ages.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 忘记了如何说话，被岁月沉寂了。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures ominously @at_foe@.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 不祥地朝 @foe@ 打了个手势。","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You disturbed my rest! Die!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 喊道：\"你打扰了我的安息！死！\"","@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"From dust you came, to dust you will return.\"":"@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@对 @foe@ 说：\"尘归尘，土归土。\"","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"The sands of time shall wipe you from history!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 喊道：\"时光之沙将把你从历史中抹去！\"","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"The curse of the Pharaohs be upon you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 喊道：\"法老之诅咒降临于你！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ draws the symbol \"Udjat\" in the dust.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 在尘土中画下了\"乌加特\"之眼。","hums":"哼着调子","murmurs":"低语着","sighs":"叹息着","rustles":"沙沙作响地","whispers":"低语着","VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures at you. @player_only@":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 向你做了个手势。 @player_only@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks to the heavens.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 仰望苍天。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes @possessive@ head sadly.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 悲哀地摇了摇@possessive@头。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ is caught in a moment of prayer.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 停下片刻祈祷。","@_Murray_common_@":"@_Murray_common_@","@_Murray_rare_@":"@_Murray_rare_@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ rolls in a circle.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 转着圈地滚。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ rolls around.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 滚来滚去。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ spins like a top.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 像陀螺一样转着。","@The_monster@ laughs evilly.":"@The_monster@邪恶地大笑。","@The_monster_possessive@ teeth chatter loudly.":"@The_monster_possessive@牙齿发出响亮的咔嗒声。","@The_monster@ cackles @at_foe@, \"I will rule the world!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 咯咯笑道：\"我将统治世界！\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You're the second biggest fool I've ever met!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你是我见过第二大的傻瓜！\"","@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"If I had legs, you would be dead twenty times over!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 尖叫道：\"我要是有腿，你早就死了二十回了！\"","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Give me your head, so I can impale it on a pike!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 吼道：\"把你的头给我，我要把它插在长矛上！\"","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Let the forces of evil and voodoo overcome you!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 吼道：\"让邪恶与巫毒的力量吞噬你吧！\"","@The_monster@ yells @at_foe@, \"I'm a mighty demonic power!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 吼道：\"我可是强大的恶魔之力！\"","@The_monster@ yells @at_foe@, \"My visage is famous all over the dungeon!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 吼道：\"我的面容在整个地牢都赫赫有名！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ says something you can't hear. It was probably not a compliment. @player_only@":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 说了些你听不到的话。大概不是什么好话。 @player_only@","@_Natasha_common_@":"@_Natasha_common_@","@_Natasha_rare_@":"@_Natasha_rare_@","@The_monster@ hisses @at_foe@.":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 嘶嘶作响。","@The_monster@ growls @at_foe@.":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 低吼着。","@The_monster@ mewls in sadness.":"@The_monster@ 悲伤地呜咽着。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ extends @possessive@ claws.":"VISUAL:@Th