cep menacingly.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 威胁地绷紧了一条肱二头肌。","@The_monster@ points @at_foe@. \"Kill!\"":"@The_monster@ 指着 @foe@。\"杀！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"A pitiful @player_genus@ like you will never find the ORB!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"像你这样可怜的小 @player_genus@，永远也找不到宝珠！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Bow before me, strongest of all the hobgoblins!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"匍匐在我面前吧，哥布林中最强大的存在！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"My goblins will feast on your bones.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我的哥布林们会大啖你的骨头。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"We wiped out the hill dwarves - you're next!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我们把山地矮人都灭了——你就是下一个！\"","@The_monster@ lets out a smug laugh.":"@The_monster@ 发出一声得意的笑声。","@The_monster@ calls out, \"Let's celebrate! Time for a feast!\"":"@The_monster@ 喊道：\"来庆祝吧！该摆宴了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"And that's why I'm the boss.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"这就是为什么我是老大。\"","@_Nellie_common_@":"@_Nellie_common_@","@_Nellie_rare_@":"@_Nellie_rare_@","@The_monster@ says, \"Can you balance on a beach ball? I can!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你能在沙滩球上平衡吗？我能！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Circuses are really nothing more than prisons.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"马戏团其实不过是监狱。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I won't go back, never!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我不会回去的，绝不！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'll never walk a tight-rope again!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我再也不走钢索了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Don't worry about being fed to the lions. Worry about being fed to me.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"别担心被喂给狮子。担心被喂给我。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ stomps the ground.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 跺了跺地面。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ stares at you suspiciously.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 怀疑地凝视着你。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ flaps @possessive@ ears in an attempt at flight.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 扇动 @possessive@耳朵，试图飞行。","@The_monster@ says, \"Do you know Lommy? A good friend!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你认识罗米吗？一个好朋友！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I trampled a caravan once.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我曾经踩平过一个车队。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"No, I don't have a problem with mice.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"不，我对老鼠没