 @foe@ 说：\"到头来，万物皆水。\"","@The_monster@ sighs @at_foe@, \"Enlightenment is such responsibility.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 叹气道：\"觉悟是一种沉重的责任。\"","@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Let's feed the skysharks together.\"":"@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@对 @foe@ 说：\"让我们一起喂天鲨吧。\"","@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"We're all made of gods.\"":"@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@对 @foe@ 说：\"我们都由神明构成。\"","softly says":"轻声说道","absently says":"心不在焉地说道","@The_monster@ says, \"Ooh, I'm jealous!\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"哇哦，我嫉妒了！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Enjoy eternity.\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"享受永恒吧。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'll see you on the other side, friend.\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"朋友，我们在另一边见。\"","@_Pikel_common_@":"@_Pikel_common_@","@_Pikel_rare_@":"@_Pikel_rare_@","@The_monster@ cracks @possessive@ whip.":"@The_monster@ 甩响了@possessive@鞭子。","@The_monster@ says, \"Hell isn't that bad.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"地狱也没那么糟。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You'll make a fine lemure.\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你会成为一个不错的劣魔。\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You'll feel the lick of my whip!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你会尝到我鞭子的滋味！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ waves @possessive@ whip at you.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 朝你挥舞着@possessive@鞭子。","@The_monster@ says, \"You'll rot in Tartarus!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你会在塔尔塔罗斯烂掉！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"You'll burn in Gehenna!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你会在欣嫩谷焚烧！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"You'll freeze in Cocytus!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你会在悲叹河冻僵！\" @player_only@","@The_monster@ says, \"You'll rust in Dis!\" @player_only@":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你会在铁城生锈！\" @player_only@","VISUAL:@The_monster@ checks @possessive@ coin pouch and frowns.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 检查着 @possessive@钱袋，皱起眉头。","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Time is money, and you're costing me too much!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"时间就是金钱，而你在浪费我太多时间！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"It's all about the gold, really.\"":"@The_mo