ys, \"Intruder eliminated.\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"入侵者已清除。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"All clear. Let's check for more.\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"安全。继续搜索。\"","@_Wiglaf_common_@":"@_Wiglaf_common_@","@_Wiglaf_rare_@":"@_Wiglaf_rare_@","@_Wiglaf_nondwarf_@":"@_Wiglaf_nondwarf_@","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll gie ye a proper bath in magma.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"俺给你在岩浆里好好洗个澡。\"","@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"By thae beards o' ma forefathars, ye wilnae live tae see tha morn'!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 吼道：\"以俺列祖列宗的胡子起誓，你活不过明天！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I got whit I came for, but wha passes up a proper rammy?\"":"@The_monster@说：\"该拿的俺拿到了，但谁肯错过一场痛快的干架？\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Ye nae take from a dwarf whit's his!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"你甭想从矮人这儿拿走他的东西！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Hit me lik' ye mean it, ye dafty glaikit!\"":"@The_monster@说：\"使点劲儿打，你个憨头憨脑的呆子！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Och, ye'r asking fur it now.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"哼，你这是自找的。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ straightens out a crease in @possessive@ hat.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@抚平了@possessive@帽子上的一道褶痕。","@The_monster@ mutters, \"Wee kobolds think thay ken whit a cannon is.\"":"@The_monster@咕哝道：\"小狗头人还以为他们懂什么叫大炮。\"","@The_monster@ growls, \"I'll break a bone for every stich ye rip.\"":"@The_monster@低吼道：\"你每撕破一道缝，俺就打断一根骨头。\"","@The_monster@ mumbles, \"If ye must ken, mah gran stiched it fur me.\"":"@The_monster@嘟囔道：\"非要问的话，是俺奶奶给俺缝的。\"","@The_monster@ sings a few bars of a dwarven mine shanty. Very poorly.":"@The_monster@唱了几段矮人矿工号子。唱得非常难听。","@The_monster@ says, \"I havnae been down this way for yonks. They've redecorated.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"俺可有年头没走这条路了。他们重新装修了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I hear the Orcs make a nippy scran these days.\"":"@The_monster@说：\"俺听说兽人们最近做的糊糊还挺有滋味。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Ye cannae match dwarven artillery.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你可比不了矮人的火炮。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Have ye nae fought a dwarf before?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"你就没跟矮人打过仗？\"","@The_monster@ pon