essiah? You don't even look the part!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 咕哝道：\"你？救世主？你连个样子都不像！\"","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"The messiah will not be a {{ return you.race() }}!\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@：\"救世主绝不会是个 {{ return crawl.t_(you.race()) }}！\"","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"The messiah will be a true Orc!\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@：\"救世主必定是个真正的兽人！\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@ @at_foe@, \"Die, @_orc_heathen_@!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ @_shouts_@：\"去死吧，@_orc_heathen_@！\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Die, @foe_name@, for besmirching Beogh's name!\"":"@The_monster@ @_shouts_@：\"去死吧，@foe_name@，竟敢玷污比欧弗之名！\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ grimaces.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 做了个鬼脸。","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"Orcs don't need Beogh!\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@：\"兽人不需要比欧弗！\"","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"Beogh's messiah is just a fairy-tale.\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@：\"比欧弗的救世主不过是童话故事罢了。\"","@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Even if there were a messiah, it wouldn't be you.\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 说：\"就算真有救世主，也轮不到你。\"","@The_monster@ laughs @at_foe@, \"You, our saviour!?\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ 笑道：\"你，我们的救世主？！\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@ @at_foe@, \"Orcs! @foe_name@ is lying!\"":"@The_monster@ 对 @foe@ @_shouts_@：\"兽人们！@foe_name@ 在撒谎！\"","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"For a messiah, you look rather [sorry|pathetic|miserable].\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@：\"身为救世主，你看起来可真够[可怜的|窝囊的|凄惨的]。\"","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"Your [costumes|disguise|tricks] cannot [fool|deceive] me.\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@：\"你的[伪装|假扮|花招]可[骗|蒙]不了我。\"","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"I wonder, will Beogh raise you from the dead?\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@：\"我倒要看看，比欧弗会不会让你复活？\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ stares at you quizzically. @player_only@":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 疑惑地盯着你看。 @player_only@","w:12":"w:12","@_friendly_beogh_speech_@":"@_friendly_beogh_speech_@","@_friendly_beogh_speech_common_@":"@_friendly_beogh_speech_common_@","@_friendly_beogh_speech_rare_@":"@_friendly_beogh_speech_rare_@","@The_monster@ @_loudly_or_repeatedly_@ @_shouts_@ encouragement@_orc_modifier_@":"@The_monster@ @_loudly_or_repeatedly_@ @_shouts_@ 打气@_orc_modifier_@","@The_monster@ shouts, \"Orcs kill for Beogh, Orcs die for Beogh!\"":"@The_monster@ 喊道：\"兽人为比欧弗杀，兽人为比欧弗死！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Your appearance changed my life!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"你的出现改变了我的一生！\"","@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@, \"Dying for Beogh gives my life meaning.\"":"@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@：\"为比欧弗而死，我的人生才有了意义。\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Blood in Beogh's name!\"":"@The_monster@ @_shouts_@：\"以比欧弗之名洒血！\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"All our enemies must die!\"":"@The_monster@ 喊道：\"所有敌人都得死！\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Let's [kill|smash|burn|maim] whoever stands in our way!\"":"@The_monster@ @_shouts_@：\"谁敢挡路，就[杀了|砸烂|烧死|砍翻]谁！\"","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_@, \"With Beogh's help we'll overthrow all the false gods!\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_@：\"有比欧弗相助，我们将推翻所有伪神！\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Smite the @_orc_heathen_@s!\"":"@The_monster@ @_shouts_@：\"消灭 @_orc_heathen_@！\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Take back everything that was taken from us!\"":"@The_monster@ @_shouts_@：\"夺回属于我们的一切！\"","@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@, \"I'm proud to serve; I'm ready to die.\"":"@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@：\"效力为荣，赴死无悔。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"May Beogh smile on you, @player_name@.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"愿比欧弗对你微笑，@player_name@。\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"Fear not, @player_name@! Beogh smiles on those who fall in battle!\"":"@The_monster@ 喊道：\"别怕，@player_name@！比欧弗对战场上的阵亡者微笑！\"","@The_monster@ lets loose a series of foul curses in Beogh's name.":"@The_monster@ 以比欧弗之名发出一连串肮脏的咒骂。","@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@, \"I fight for @player_name@, for Beogh shepherds all!\"":"@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@：\"我为 @player_name@ 而战，比欧弗牧养众生！\"","@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@, \"Orcs will kill them all!\"":"@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@：\"兽人会把他们都杀光！\"","@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Orcs rule!\"":"@The_monster@ @_shouts_@：\"兽人统治一切！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I just want to die in your service, @player_name@!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我只愿为你效死，@player_name@！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Beogh doesn't mind all this killing, you know.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"比欧弗可不介意这些杀戮，你知道的。\"","@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@, \"Beogh is great, and so is @player_name@!\"":"@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@：\"比欧弗伟大，@player_name@ 也同样伟大！\"","@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@, \"I am so glad I met you.\"":"@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@：\"真高兴能遇到你。\"","@The_monster@ @_orc_says_@, \"A dead @_orc_heathen_@ will not bedevil my soul.\"":"@The_monster@ @_orc_says_@：\"死了的 @_orc_heathen_@ 就不会再折磨我的灵魂了。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I never had a vision before.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我以前从没见过异象。\"","@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@, \"Our fallen brethren won't be forgotten.\"":"@The_monster@ @_says_or_shouts_@：\"我们倒下的兄弟不会被遗忘。\"","VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks @at_foe/around@ nervously.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 紧张地看了看四周。","@The_monster@ looks @at_foe@ and says, \"I'd rather not die in your service, @player_name@.\"":"@The_monster@ 看着 @foe@ 说：\"我实在不想为你效劳而死，@player_name@。\"","@The_monster@ chants, \"I shall fear no evil, for @player_name@ is my saviour.\"":"@The_monster@ 吟诵道：\"我必不怕邪恶，因 @player_name@ 是我的救主。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm proud to be an orc.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"身为兽人，我自豪。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"I'm an Orc, you're an Orc, it's OK.\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我是兽人，你也是兽人，没毛病。\"","@The_monster@ seems like @subjective@ is about to say something to you, then stops.":"@The_monster@ 看起来 @subjective@ 想对你说些什么，但又停住了。","@The_monster@ @_mutters_@, \"When this is all over, I'm going to start a fungus farm.\"":"@The_monster@ @_mutters_@：\"等这都结束了，我要去开个蘑菇农场。\"","@related beogh orc@":"@related beogh orc@","@Blorkula the orcula@":"@Blorkula the orcula@","@Urug@":"@Urug@","@The_monster@ stares at you in amazement and kneels.":"@The_monster@惊讶地盯着你，跪了下来。","@The_monster@ relaxes @possessive@ fighting stance and smiles at you.":"@The_monster@放松了@possessive@战斗姿态，对你微笑。","@The_monster@ falls on @possessive@ knees before you.":"@The_monster@以@possessive@双膝跪在你面前。","@Subjective@ shouts, \"@player_name@ is one of us!\"":"@Subjective@喊道：\"@player_name@是我们的人！\"","@Subjective@ shouts, \"Surely Beogh must have sent you!\"":"@Subjective@喊道：\"一定是比欧弗派你来的！\"","@Subjective@ asks, \"Are you our saviour?\"":"@Subjective@问道：\"你是我们的救世主吗？\"","@Subjective@ says, \"I'm so glad you are here now.\"":"@Subjective@说道：\"真高兴你现在来了。\"","@The_monster@ surrenders.":"@The_monster@投降了。","@The_monster@ falls to @possessive@ knees.":"@The_monster@以@possessive@双膝跪倒在地。","@The_monster@ raises @possessive@ hands in surrender.":"@The_monster@举起@possessive@双手投降。","@Subjective@ shouts, \"I'll follow you! Let me live!\"":"@Subjective@喊道：\"我愿意追随你！饶我一命！\"","@Subjective@ says, \"You must be the Messiah, I see it now!\"":"@Subjective@说道：\"你一定是救世主，我现在明白了！\"","@Subjective@ yells, \"I follow Beogh's word, I swear it!\"":"@Subjective@喊道：\"我遵从比欧弗之言，我发誓！\"","@Subjective@ shouts, \"You have your revenge! Let me go!\"":"@Subjective@喊道：\"你已经报仇了！放我走吧！\"","@Subjective@ shouts, \"Spare me, and you'll never see me again!\"":"@Subjective@喊道：\"饶了我，你永远不会再见到我！\"","@Subjective@ says, \"I deserve death, but Beogh is merciful!\"":"@Subjective@说道：\"我罪该万死，但比欧弗是仁慈的！\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"You saved me!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"你救了我！\"","@The_monster@ says, \"You really are the Messiah.\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"你真的是救世主。\"","@The_monster@ thanks you for bringing @objective@ back to life.":"@The_monster@感谢你让@objective@复活。","@The_monster@ says, \"I knew I could rely on you.\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"我就知道可以依靠你。\"","@The_monster@ says, \"Now I can live to fight another day.\"":"@The_monster@说道：\"现在我可以活下来再战了。\"","@beogh_converted_orc_reaction_battle@":"@beogh_converted_orc_reaction_battle@","@beogh_converted_orc_speech_battle@":"@beogh_converted_orc_speech_battle@","@beogh_converted_orc_speech_vengeance@":"@beogh_converted_orc_speech_vengeance@","The priest shouts, \"Disloyal scoundrel, leave my sight!\"":"祭司喊道：\"不忠的恶棍，从我眼前消失！\"","The priest snarls, \"I'll spare you only if you run away! Begone!\"":"祭司咆哮道：\"只有你滚了我才会饶你一命！滚！\"","The priest curses, \"Your faithless show of piety disgusts me!\"":"祭司咒骂道：\"你那毫无信仰的假虔诚让我恶心！\"","The priest sneers, \"Beogh may forgive you, but I don't!\"":"祭司冷笑道：\"比欧弗也许会原谅你，但我不会！\"","The priest shouts, \"You had your chance, apostate scum!\"":"祭司喊道：\"给过你机会了，叛教渣滓！\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"Beogh offers mercy even to people such as you. Join us and be reborn!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"比欧弗甚至对你这种人也会施以仁慈。加入我们，重获新生！\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"The Pantheon deserves no one's loyalty. Let us show you the true path!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"万神殿不值得任何人的忠诚。让我们指引你走上真正的道路！\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"Surrender to Beogh and we'll let you live!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"向比欧弗投降，我们就饶你一命！\"","@The_monster@ threatens, \"Beogh's wrath is as vast as Beogh's mercy. Make your choice!\"":"@The_monster@威胁道：\"比欧弗的愤怒如其仁慈一般无边。做出你的选择！\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"I yield! You are indeed the chosen one!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"我投降！你确实是天选之人！\"","@The_monster@ shouts, \"I yield! Victory is yours!\"":"@The_monster@喊道：\"我投降！胜利属于你！\"","@The_monster@ falls to @possessive@ knees and submits.":"@The_monster@以@possessive@双膝跪倒在地，表示臣服。","@The_monster@ says, \"I will never forget you!\"":"@The_monster@ 说：\"我永远不会忘记你！\"","@The_monster@ leaves to spread the word of Beogh to the surface.":"@The_monster@ 离开，去地面传播比欧弗的福音。","@The_monster@ salutes you before departing.":"@The_monster@ 在离开前向你行礼。","VISUAL:@The_monster@ pulls a severed tentacle out of their boot and sighs heavily.":"VISUAL:@The_monster@ 从靴子里拽出一截断掉的触手，重重地叹了口气。","@The_monster@ grins, \"Not even the Unformed can stop the chosen ones of Beogh!\"":"@The_monster@ 咧嘴笑道：\"连无形者都挡不住比欧弗的选民！\"","@The_monster@ shouts triumpantly, \"Who's laughing NOW?\"":"@The_monster@ 得意地喊道：\"现在是谁在笑了？！\"","@The_monster@ shudders. 