essive_God@.":"@The_monster@赞美着@possessive_God@。","@The_monster@ grins. \"So many cards! Brought to you by @my_God@!\"":"@The_monster@咧嘴笑道：\"这么多牌！全都拜@my_God@所赐！\"","@The_monster@ refuses insurance.":"@The_monster@拒绝提供保险。","@_deck_of_destruction_line_@":"@_deck_of_destruction_line_@","@_deck_of_escape_line_@":"@_deck_of_escape_line_@","@_deck_of_summoning_line_@":"@_deck_of_summoning_line_@","@_deck_of_punishment_line_@":"w:5","@The_monster@ draws @_deck_of_oddities_card_@. \"Wait, this doesn't belong here!\"":"w:5","@The_monster@ draws @_misplaced_card_@. \"Wait, where'd this come from?\"":"w:5","@The_monster@ fumbles a card and drops it. \"Whoops!\"":"w:1","the Bargain":"交易","the Curse":"诅咒","Famine":"饥荒","Focus":"专注","the Feast":"盛宴","the Genie":"精灵","the Helix":"螺旋","the Ace of Spades":"黑桃A","the Joker":"鬼牌","the Old Maid":"老处女牌","the Hanged Man":"倒吊人","the Happy Squirrel":"快乐松鼠","Wild Draw Four":"万能+4","@The_monster@ draws Degeneration. \"So many ways to mutate things!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了堕落。\"有太多方法可以变异了！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Orb. \"Orbs of destruction hurt!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了宝珠。\"毁灭之球可疼了！\"","@The_monster@ draws Pain. \"Necromancy hurts!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了痛苦。\"死灵术可疼了！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Storm. \"Thunder and lightning everywhere!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了风暴。\"到处都是雷与电！\"","@The_monster@ draws Vitriol. \"Acid hurts!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了硫酸。\"强酸可疼了！\"","@The_monster@ draws Wild Magic. \"So many ways magic can go wrong!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了狂野魔法。\"魔法出错的方式有千千万！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Cloud. \"No fresh air for enemies!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了云雾。\"敌人别想呼吸新鲜空气！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Elixir. \"Healing and magic? Woohoo!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了灵药。\"回血又回魔？哇呼！\"","@The_monster@ draws Exile. \"The Abyss is a horrible place!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了放逐。\"深渊可是个可怕的地方！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Tomb. \"I don't want to be sealed in with no windows!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了坟墓。\"我可不想被封在没窗户的地方！\"","@The_monster@ draws Velocity. \"Know when to walk away, know when to run.\"":"@The_monster@抽到了速度。\"知道何时该走，知道何时该跑。\"","@The_monster@ draws the Dance. \"Hope the weapon's aim is true!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了剑舞。\"希望武器的准头不错！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Elements. \"Elemental beasts everywhere!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了元素。\"到处都是元素兽！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Illusion. \"I have a twin now!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了幻象。\"我现在有个分身了！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Pentagram. \"Hope the demon is friendly!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了五芒星。\"希望恶魔友善点！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Rangers. \"New friends who can shoot!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了游侠。\"会射击的新朋友！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Swarm. \"Bees, bees everywhere!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了蜂群。\"蜜蜂，到处都是蜜蜂！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Swine. \"I'm a pig now!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了猪化。\"我现在是猪了！\"","@The_monster@ draws Torment. \"Half my health gone? Yikes!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了折磨。\"一半生命没了？哎呀！\"","@The_monster@ draws the Wraith. \"Draining hurts!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了幽魂。\"吸取生命可疼了！\"","@The_monster@ draws Wrath. \"So many ways gods can punish you!\"":"@The_monster@抽到了神怒。\"神明惩罚你的方式太多了！\"","This creature has temporarily gained the ability to cast specific spells. It will lose access to them again once sufficiently injured.":"这个生物暂时获得了施放特定法术的能力。 一旦受到足够伤害，它将再次失去这些能力。","After a short delay, this creature will be teleported to somewhere else on the current floor.":"短暂延迟后，这个生物将被传送到当前楼层的其他地方。","This creature suffers AC-ignoring cold damage every turn, and may sometimes explode in a burst of ice that damages nearby allies. When it dies, it may spread rimeblight to other nearby allies. Natural, demonic, or holy creatures will be instantly killed once they reach low health, and be replaced with pillars of rime.":"这个生物每回合受到无视AC的寒冷伤害，有时会爆发出寒冰冲击，伤害附近的盟友。 当它死亡时，可能会将霜疫传播给其他附近的盟友。 自然、恶魔或神圣生物在生命值降到低点时会被立即杀死，并被冰霜之柱取代。","This creature is being targeted by one or more of your allies.":"这个生物正被你的一个或多个盟友锁定为目标。","When this creature deals damage, it will suffer damage equal to the damage it dealt.":"当这个生物造成伤害时，它将受到等同于其所造成伤害量的伤害。","This creature has 50% more health, deals 50% more damage with melee attacks, and both moves and acts 50% faster. They cannot perform any action besides moving or attacking. When the berserk rage wears off, they will be slowed and unable to berserk for a short duration.":"这个生物的生命值提升50%，近战攻击伤害提升50%，移动和行动速度提升50%。 除了移动和攻击之外，它们无法执行任何其他动作。 当狂暴消退后，它们将被减速，并在短时间内无法再次狂暴。","This creature cannot move under its own power, but may still use translocations or be forcibly displaced by someone else.":"这个生物无法依靠自身力量移动，但仍可以使用传送或被他者强行位移。","This monster has been called from a parallel reality. Killing it will grant no experience points, but it will be immediately cast back to its original reality as soon as the tesseract is destroyed.":"这个怪物是从平行现实召唤而来的。击杀它不会获得经验值， 但当超立方体被摧毁后，它会被立即送回原来的现实。","This creature has used a breath ability recently and cannot use it again for a short while.":"这个生物最近使用过吐息能力，短时间内无法再次使用。","This creature is chanting a Word of Recall. This will recall intelligent allies from elsewhere on the floor to the caster's vicinity after a short delay, but can be interrupted by most effects which would normally prevent it from casting spells.":"这个生物正在吟唱召回之词。这会在短暂延迟后将楼层中其他地方的 有智力的盟友召唤到施法者附近，但可以被大多数阻止施法的效果打断。","This creature has been charmed and will fight for your cause for a short while. This effect will wear off immediately if you attempt to harm it in any way.":"这个生物被魅惑了，会短暂地为你的目标而战。如果你以任何方式试图伤害它， 效果会立即消失。","This creature's natural venom has been intensified, giving any poison it inflicts through attacks or breath weapons a chance to slow and asphyxiate susceptible targets.":"这个生物的天然毒液被强化了，使其通过攻击或吐息武器施加的毒素 有概率减速和窒息易受影响的目標。","This creature has been contaminated by transmutational energy, and will suffer significant damage every third time such energy is inflicted upon them.":"这个生物已被变形能量污染，每当第三次被施加此类能量时将受到显著伤害。","This creature is being constricted by tree roots, which reduces their evasion and inflicts some damage each turn. It may also prevent them from moving, though each attempt to do so has a chance to break this effect entirely.":"这个生物正被树根缠绕，降低了它们的闪避并每回合造成一些伤害。 也可能阻止它们移动，但每次尝试移动都有概率完全打破此效果。","This creature is being constricted by clutching corpses from deep beneath the earth, which reduces their evasion and inflicts some damage each turn. It may also prevent them from moving, though each attempt to do so has a chance to break this effect entirely.":"这个生物正被从地底深处伸出的死尸之手缠绕，降低了它们的闪避并每回合 造成一些伤害。也可能阻止它们移动，但每次尝试移动都有概率完全打破此效果。","This formerly-friendly creature has been charmed by another creature to join their side. If you slay the source of this charm, it will regain its senses.":"这个原本友好的生物被其他生物魅惑了，加入了对方阵营。 如果你杀死魅惑的来源，它会恢复神智。","This creature's AC is reduced by 8.":"这个生物的AC降低了8点。","This creature has been coated in sticky flame, and will take AC-ignoring fire damage each turn. Movement will shake off the flames, causing it to expire much more rapidly and stepping into water will extinguish it entirely.":"这个生物被粘性火焰覆盖，每回合受到无视AC的火焰伤害。 移动会甩掉火焰，使其更快熄灭；踏入水中则会完全熄灭火焰。","This creature is unable to evade attacks or turn invisible. If it dies, it will leave behind a cloud of magnetised fragments. Each time Magnavolt is cast, a beam of electricity will automatically be fired at this creature.":"这个生物无法闪避攻击或隐身。如果它死亡，会留下一团磁化碎片云。 每次施放磁暴时，会向这个生物自动射出一道闪电束。","This creature has been afflicted with illusory wounds by a flayed ghost. These wounds will disappear with time or when the flayed ghost is destroyed.":"这个生物被剥皮幽灵施加了幻觉伤口。这些伤口会随着时间流逝消失， 或者在剥皮幽灵被摧毁时消失。","This creature moves slightly faster.":"这个生物的移动速度略微加快。","This creature is stuck in liquefied ground, causing it to move more slowly and also fumble 25% of the melee attacks it makes.":"这个生物陷入液化地面中，移动速度减慢，其25%的近战攻击会失手。","This creature will be automatically destroyed in a few turns.":"这个生物将在几回合后自动被摧毁。","This creature is cursed, and will lose half its current health after the next time the source of the curse hits it with a melee attack.":"这个生物被诅咒了，在诅咒来源的下一次近战攻击命中后将失去其当前生命值的一半。","This creature takes no damage by any means unless the original source of that damage is adjacent to them. Non-damaging side-effects happen normally. (The source of damage from clouds and projectile-like monsters, such as foxfires, is always considered whatever creature first created them.)":"除非伤害的原始来源与这个生物相邻，否则无论以何种方式都无法对其造成伤害。 不造成伤害的附带效果仍会正常发生。 （云雾和狐火等类投射物怪物的伤害来源，始终视为最初创造它们的生物。）","This creature is temporarily unable to act, but any hostile action will cause it to immediately regain its senses.":"这个生物暂时无法行动，但任何敌对行为将使其立即恢复神智。","This creature's spells are less powerful - dealing less damage, being less able to overcome their target's willpower, and occasionally being weaker in other ways.":"这个生物的法术威力降低——造成的伤害更少，更难以克服目标的意志力， 并在其他方面偶尔变弱。","This monster's current and maximum health are temporarily doubled.":"这个怪物的当前和最大生命值暂时翻倍。","This creature has been granted great power by Beogh to challenge you. Their melee and ranged attacks deal 33% more damage, their health is increased, and they cast spells more frequently. They are also able to track you, no matter where on the current floor you flee. They will lose these bonuses once the challenge is concluded.":"这个生物被贝奥格赋予了强大的力量来挑战你。它们的近战和远程攻击伤害 提升33%，生命值增加，施法更频繁。它们还能追踪你，无论你逃到当前楼层 的任何地方。 一旦挑战结束，它们将失去这些加成。","This creature has been flash-frozen and its movement speed is greatly reduced for a short time.":"这个生物被瞬间冻结，其移动速度在短时间内大幅降低。","This creature suffers poison damage every turn and cannot be poisoned any further.":"这个生物每回合受到毒素伤害，且无法被进一步中毒。","This creature moves and acts 50% faster.":"这个生物的行动和移动速度提升50%。","This creature is but a fragile duplicate of another creature. Its health is reduced by 66%, it deals 33% less damage with attacks, and its spells are significantly weakened.":"这个生物只是另一个生物的脆弱复制体。其生命值减少66%，攻击伤害减少33%， 法术威力显著减弱。","This creature has been empowered by the flames of Ignis. It deals additional fire damage with its melee attacks, moves 33% more quickly, and has increased AC and resistance to fire.":"这个生物被伊格尼斯的火焰强化了。其近战攻击造成额外火焰伤害，移动速度提升33%， AC和火焰抗性提高。","This creature is fleeing in fear and will attempt each turn to move away from the source of this fear. Beside movement, it may only cast spells which it thinks could help it escape, such as Blink. If harmed directly or cornered against terrain, it will turn around to fight once more.":"这个生物因恐惧而逃跑，每回合都会尝试远离恐惧来源。除移动外， 它只能施放认为有助于逃跑的法术，比如闪烁。 如果被直接伤害或被地形逼入绝境，它会回头再次战斗。","This creature receives 50% more damage from all sources.":"这个生物受到的所有来源伤害增加50%。","This creature deals 50% more damage with melee attacks and both moves and attacks 50% faster. It cannot cast spells and will prioritise attacking the closest other creature present each turn, whether they are friend or foe.":"这个生物近战攻击伤害提升50%，移动和攻击速度提升50%。它无法施法， 每回合会优先攻击最近的生物，无论对方是友方还是敌方。","This creature has gathered all the power it needs to cast its spells.":"这个生物已积攒了施法所需的全部能量。","This creature has been struck with a kinetic grapnel. The next melee attack from the grapnel's source will always hit and deal slightly increased damage.":"这个生物被动能抓钩击中了。来自抓钩来源的下一次近战攻击将必定命中 并造成略微增加的伤害。","This creature has been heavily drained, lowering the accuracy of their melee attacks, the power of their spells and special attack properties, and making them more vulnerable to many status effects.":"这个生物被严重削弱，其近战攻击命中率降低，法术和特殊攻击属性威力降低， 并且更容易受到许多状态效果的影响。","This creature has glows with the perfection of their best self. They deal 100% more damage with melee attacks, have additional AC, and cast spells with substantially more strength.":"这个生物闪耀着完美自我的光辉。其近战攻击伤害提升100%，拥有额外的AC， 施法威力大幅增强。","This creature has been roused into great speed by the wrath of Gozag Ym Sagoz. Their haste or berserk state is permanent and will not wear off with time or through deliberate magical intervention.":"这个生物因戈扎格·伊姆·萨戈兹之怒而被激发至极高的速度。 它们的加速或狂暴状态是永久的，不会随时间或通过刻意的魔法干预而消退。","This creature is neither hostile nor allied and may attack creatures of all dispositions, should it wander into them.":"这个生物既不敌对也不友好，如果碰到任何生物，无论对方的立场如何都可能攻击。","This creature is infested with a death scarab, which will emerge from their body once they die.":"这个生物被一只死亡圣甲虫寄生，虫将在其死后从尸体中钻出。","Whenever this creature suffers damage, a flame cloud will briefly appear beneath them. When they die, they will explode in a violent burst of fire, damaging anything nearby and leaving behind additional flame clouds. Giant creatures will trigger an even larger explosion when they die.":"每当这个生物受到伤害时，其身下会短暂出现一团火焰云。 当它死亡时，会爆发出猛烈的火焰爆炸，伤害附近的一切并留下更多火焰云。 巨型生物死亡时会引发更大的爆炸。","You are currently terrified of this creature, preventing you from deliberately moving close to them and causing 33% of the melee attacks you make again against them fail. This effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.":"你当前对这个生物感到极度恐惧，无法故意靠近它，你对其33%的近战攻击会失败。 如果你失去这个生物的视野，此效果会消失。","This creature's melee attacks may inflict additional damage of a random element or cause various irresistible status effects.":"这个生物的近战攻击可能会造成随机元素的额外伤害，或引发各种不可抵抗的状态效果。","This creature has been magically vexed and is forced to attack a random adjacent space each turn instead of performing any other actions. It is more likely to attack a space containing a creature than an empty one, but will attack its own allies as readily as its enemies.":"这个生物被魔法激怒了，每回合被迫攻击一个随机的相邻位置，而不是执行其他动作。 它更可能攻击有生物的位置而非空格，但会同样毫不犹豫地攻击自己的盟友和敌人。","This creature has been lightly drained, somewhat lowering the accuracy of their melee attacks, the power of their spells and special attack properties, and making them slightly more vulnerable to many status effects.":"这个生物被轻度削弱，其近战攻击命中率略有下降，法术和特殊攻击属性威力有所降低， 并且稍微更容易受到许多状态效果的影响。","This creature has been driven to madness by the power of Zin. It will never again use spells or abilities and will stumble around at random, attacking whatever it bumps into - be they friend or foe or sometimes even themselves.":"这个生物被辛的力量逼疯了。它将再也不会使用法术或能力，会随机踉跄而行， 攻击撞到的任何东西——无论是友方、敌方，有时甚至是它们自己。","This creature's spells and magical abilities have been disrupted and may fail when used. The chance of failure depends on the remaining duration of this effect.":"这个生物的法术和魔法能力已被打断，使用时有概率失败。 失败概率取决于此效果的剩余持续时间。","This creature has had its access to magic tainted. Whenever it casts a spell, its magic will be severely disrupted, making it likely any subsequent spells it casts will fail.":"这个生物的魔法通道被污染了。每当它施放法术时，其魔法会被严重打断， 使其后续施放的法术很可能失败。","This creature has been condemned to inexorable decay and ruin. Whenever it takes damage from melee attacks, it will be drained heavily and either slowed, weakened, or blinded.":"这个生物被诅咒为注定的衰败与毁灭。每当其受到近战攻击伤害时， 将被严重削弱，并且被减速、虚弱或致盲。","This creature has mesmerised you, making you unable to voluntarily move away from them. This effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.":"这个生物已经迷住了你，使你无法主动远离它。 如果你失去这个生物的视野，此效果会消失。","This creature has been created by magic and will cease to be once its creator dies.":"这个生物是由魔法创造的，一旦其创造者死亡就会消失。","This creature's shadow has been torn away from it and cannot be affected by Aphotic Marionette ever again.":"这个生物的影子被夺走了，它再也无法受到无光傀儡的影响。","This creature's AC is reduced by 8 and its accuracy, spell power, brand damage, and willpower are moderately reduced.":"这个生物的AC降低了8点，其命中率、法术威力、武器特效伤害和意志力均中度降低。","This creature's fire resistance is reduced by one level.":"这个生物的火焰抗性降低了一级。","This creature's poison resistance is reduced by one level.":"这个生物的毒素抗性降低了一级。","This creature has been stricken permanently mute by the power of Zin. This prevents all noise the creature could make, including the vocalisations required for most creatures to cast spells.":"这个生物被辛的力量永久地沉默了。这将阻止该生物发出的一切噪音， 包括大多数生物施法所需的发声。","This creature has built up part of the charge it needs to cast a spell or activate an ability.":"这个生物已积攒了施放法术或激活能力所需的部分能量。","This creature will never attack you and may attack other creatures hostile to you, but will neither follow you nor obey any direct instructions.":"这个生物永远不会攻击你，可能会攻击对你敌对的生物，但既不会跟随你， 也不会服从任何直接指令。","This creature suffers poison damage every turn.":"这个生物每回合受到毒素伤害。","This creature is surrounded by a field of unnatural silence which eliminates all noise made within it as well as preventing the vocalisations required for many creatures (including you) to read scrolls, cast spells, or invoke divine aid. If this effect was caused by a spell, the radius of the field will shrink over time.":"这个生物被一圈不自然的沉默力场环绕，力场内消除所有噪音， 阻止许多生物（包括你）阅读卷轴、施法或祈求神助所需的发声。 如果此效果是由法术引起的，力场范围会随时间缩小。","This creature shines with Olgreb's Toxic Radiance and will continuously inflict poison damage on all foes in sight for several turns.":"这个生物闪耀着奥尔格雷布之毒辐射的光芒，将在数回合内持续对视野中的所有 敌人造成毒素伤害。","This creature has been defeated in honourable combat and may be recruited as one of your apostles via the ability menu.":"这个生物在光荣的战斗中被击败，可以通过能力菜单招募为你的使徒。","This creature has not yet inflicted you with Oblivion Howl and may attempt to do so.":"这个生物尚未对你施加湮灭嚎叫，可能会尝试这样做。","This creature's Sundering weapon is fully charged and its next attack will be more accurate, inflict greatly increased damage, and cleave with increased range. This effect will be lost if it moves.":"这个生物的崩裂武器已完全充能，其下一次攻击将更加精准、造成大幅增加的伤害、 并且劈砍范围扩大。如果它移动了，此效果将消失。","This creature reflects any projectile it blocks back to their original source.":"这个生物将任何被格挡的投射物反射回其原始来源。","Whenever this creature suffers damage, it inflicts 2/3rds as much damage back upon whatever damaged it.":"每当这个生物受到伤害时，它会将伤害量的三分之二反射回造成伤害的来源。","This creature regenerates health at a greatly increased rate, proportion to their maximum health.":"这个生物以与其最大生命值成比例的大幅提高的速度恢复生命值。","This creature has +15 EV when dodging projectiles, whether physical or magical.":"这个生物在闪避投射物（无论是物理还是魔法）时拥有+15 EV。","This creature has been ordered to flee in a given direction, and will not attack or return to your side until they are given new instructions or have travelled a sufficient distance":"这个生物被命令向指定方向撤退，在获得新指示或行进足够距离之前， 它不会攻击或回到你身边。","This creature has curled into a ball, increasing its movement speed and melee damage by 100% until the next time it attacks something (or becomes unable to move).":"这个生物蜷成了一个球，移动速度和近战伤害提升100%， 直到下一次攻击某物（或无法移动为止）。","This creature will inflict a portion of all damage it suffers upon nearby allies, with those closer to it receiving a greater amount.":"这个生物将所受伤害的一部分分摊给附近的盟友，离它越近的盟友承受越多。","Half of the damage suffered by this creature is redirected to the ally protecting it instead.":"这个生物受到的一半伤害被转移到保护它的盟友身上。","This creature is sick and cannot naturally regenerate.":"这个生物生病了，无法自然恢复生命值。","This creature is engulfed in a field of unnatural silence, preventing any noise it might make, including the vocalisations required for many creatures to cast spells.":"这个生物被一片不自然的沉默力场吞没了，阻止其发出任何噪音， 包括大多数生物施法所需的发声。","This creature will take minor damage whenever it moves.":"这个生物在移动时都会受到少量伤害。","This creature is normally invisible, but your magical sight allows you to see it nonetheless. This has no effect on you, though any allies you have may not be able to see it as you can.":"这个生物通常是隐形的，但你的魔法视力让你仍然可以看到它。 这对你没有任何影响，但你的盟友可能无法像你一样看到它。","This creature moves and acts at 66% of normal speed.":"这个生物以正常速度的66%移动和行动。","This creature has been outlined with a halo of light and is easier to hit and revealed, if invisible.":"这个生物被光环勾勒出来，更容易被击中，如果是隐形状态也会暴露出来。","This creature's soul has been bound in ice. When it dies, a simulacrum of its original form will rise in its place.":"这个生物的灵魂被束缚在寒冰中。当它死亡时，一个其原形态的拟像将从其 所在位置升起。","This creature's soul will be bound in service to you once they die, though allowing them to stray from your line of sight for more than a brief moment will cause you to lose your grasp on it.":"这个生物的灵魂将在死后被迫为你服务，但如果它超出你的视线范围 超过短暂的一瞬，你将失去对它的掌控。","A fragment of this creature's soul has been extracted into a soul wisp, preventing further use of this spell until the wisp reunites with them again.":"这个生物的一部分灵魂被提取成了灵魂光球，在光球重新与它结合之前， 无法再次使用此法术。","This creature's spells are strengthened and it will cast them more frequently.":"这个生物的法术被增强了，施法频率也会增加。","This creature's spells are significantly weakened.":"这个生物的法术威力显著减弱。","This creature is preventing any clouds from being created on the current floor.":"这个生物正在阻止当前楼层产生任何云雾。","This creature's melee attacks deal 50% more damage.":"这个生物的近战攻击伤害提升50%。","This creature's willpower is increased by 2 pips.":"这个生物的意志力提升了2档。","This creature is the source of a devastating polar vortex.":"这个生物是毁灭性极地漩涡的中心。","This creature trails a ring of acidic fog clouds around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈酸性雾气云。","This creature trails a ring of seething chaos clouds around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈沸腾的混沌云。","This creature trails a ring of flame clouds around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈火焰云。","This creature trails a ring of purple smoke around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈紫色烟雾。","This creature trails a ring of foul miasma around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈恶臭瘴气。","This creature trails a ring of freezing clouds around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈冰冻云。","This creature trails a ring of mutagenic fog around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈变异雾气。","This creature trails a ring of clouds of excruciating misery around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈极度痛苦的负能量云。","This creature has recently cast Polar Vortex and cannot cast it again for a short time.":"这个生物最近施放了极地漩涡，短时间内无法再次施放。","This creature trails a ring of thunder clouds around itself.":"这个生物周围环绕着一圈雷电云。","This creature has contributed to the death of one of your apostles. Defeating all targets of orcish vengeance will significantly speed up the time it takes for Beogh to resurrect your apostles.":"这个生物参与了杀害你的一位使徒。击败所有兽人复仇目标将显著加快 贝奥格复活你使徒的时间。","Whenever you perform a ranged attack aimed at a different creature, a copy of the projectile will be teleported to this creature at the end of its flight.":"每当你对另一个生物进行远程攻击时，投射物的一个副本将在其飞行结束时 被传送到这个生物身上。","This creature's melee attacks deal 25% more damage, its accuracy is slightly increased, and its spells and abilities have been mildly strengthened.":"这个生物的近战攻击伤害提升25%，命中率略微提高，法术和能力被轻度增强。","This creature has become unmoored in space, allowing it to Manifold Assault as a natural ability. Whenever they do, there is 33% chance they will also blink to a random nearby location.":"这个生物在空间中失去了锚定，使其能够将多重攻击作为天生能力使用。 每当它这样做时，有33%的概率也会闪烁到附近随机位置。","This creature cannot blink or teleport.":"这个生物无法闪烁或传送。","Despite being engulfed in unnatural silence, this creature's magic does not require vocalisations and thus is unaffected.":"尽管被不自然的沉默力场吞没，这个生物的魔法不需要发声，因此不受影响。","This creature provides no experience or piety when slain.":"这个生物在被杀死时不提供经验值或虔诚值。","Each turn, this creature blinks a short distance further away from you and suffers a small amount of damage.":"每回合，这个生物会向远离你的方向闪烁一小段距离，并受到少量伤害。","This creature's evasion is slightly increased.":"这个生物的闪避略微提升。","This creature's resistance to fire, cold, poison, electricity, and corrosion are all increased by one level.":"这个生物对火焰、寒冷、毒素、电击和腐蚀的抗性都提升了一级。","This creature is poisoned and will take damage every turn.":"这个生物中毒了，每回合将受到伤害。","This creature is unable to breathe and cannot cast spells or invoke divine aid. It also takes minor asphyxiation damage every turn.":"这个生物无法呼吸，不能施法或祈求神助。每回合还会受到少量窒息伤害。","This creature's melee attacks deal 33% less damage.":"这个生物的近战攻击伤害降低33%。","This creature's willpower is reduced by half.":"这个生物的意志力降低了一半。","This creature is preparing to launch a clockwork bee and must focus on this task for several turns. Most effects that would prevent this creature from casting spells will also interrupt this process.":"这个生物正在准备发射一只发条蜜蜂，必须专注于这个任务数回合。 大多数阻止该生物施法的效果也会中断这个进程。","This creature will die in a few turns.":"这个生物将在几回合后死亡。","<blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"<blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有概率（与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）使其措手不及， 造成额外伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","<blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature will deal greatly increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"<blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击将造成大幅增加的伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge. Any hostile action will awaken it, though melee attacks against it (even by other monsters) will deal increased damage. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature will deal greatly increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物无法移动、行动、格挡或闪避。任何敌对行为都会唤醒它， 但对它的近战攻击（即使是来自其他怪物的）会造成更高的伤害。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击将造成大幅增加的伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature cannot see properly. Its accuracy is greatly decreased, it cannot make attacks of opportunity, and spells it casts may sometimes be aimed at the wrong locations. It may also stumble around and eventually lose track of its target, especially if it has low intelligence. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物无法正常视物。其命中率大幅降低，无法进行借机攻击， 施放的法术有时可能会瞄准错误的位置。 它也可能会踉跄而行，最终失去对目标的追踪，尤其是智力低下的生物。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有概率（与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）使其措手不及， 造成额外伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature is unable to block or use spells or abilities and will stumble around at random, attacking whatever it bumps into - be they friend or foe or sometimes even themselves. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物无法格挡或使用法术和能力，会随机踉跄而行，攻击撞到的任何东西—— 无论是友方、敌方，有时甚至是它们自己。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有概率（与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）使其措手不及， 造成额外伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature is caught in a net, greatly reducing its evasion and preventing it from blocking. Any attempt it makes to move or attack will instead struggle against the net, which may eventually destroy it. Spellcasting is unimpaired. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物被网缠住了，大大降低了闪避能力并阻止其格挡。 任何移动或攻击的尝试都会转而挣扎于网中，最终可能摧毁网。 施法不受影响。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有概率（与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）使其措手不及， 造成额外伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature is caught in a spider's web, greatly reducing its evasion and preventing it from blocking. Any attempt it makes to move or attack will instead struggle against the web, which may eventually destroy it. Spellcasting is unimpaired. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物被蜘蛛网缠住了，大大降低了闪避能力并阻止其格挡。 任何移动或攻击的尝试都会转而挣扎于网中，最终可能摧毁网。 施法不受影响。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有概率（与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）使其措手不及， 造成额外伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature has been briefly distracted by something else. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物被其他事物短暂地分散了注意力。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有概率（与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）使其措手不及， 造成额外伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge attacks. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature will deal greatly increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物无法移动、行动、格挡或闪避攻击。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击将造成大幅增加的伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature will soon become fully petrified. Its movement and actions are 50% slower and it is nearly unable to dodge attacks, though it also takes 33% less damage. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物很快就会完全石化。其移动和行动速度减慢50%，几乎无法闪避攻击， 但也受到33%的伤害减免。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有概率（与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）使其措手不及， 造成额外伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge attacks. By being made of stone, it also takes 50% less damage, gains immunity to negative energy and poison, but become vulnerable to deconstruction. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature will deal greatly increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物无法移动、行动、格挡或闪避攻击。由于变成了石头，它受到的伤害 减少50%，免疫负能量和毒素，但变得容易被瓦解伤害。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击将造成大幅增加的伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature has been struck dumb by the power of Zin and cannot act. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature will deal greatly increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物被辛的力量震慑而无法行动。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击将造成大幅增加的伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>","This creature is unable to see you because you are invisible. Its accuracy against you is greatly decreased, it cannot make attacks of opportunity, and spells it casts may sometimes be aimed at the wrong locations. It may also stumble around and eventually lose track of you, especially if it has low intelligence. <blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>":"这个生物因为你隐身而看不到你。它对你的命中率大幅降低，无法进行借机攻击， 施放的法术有时可能会瞄准错误的位置。 它也可能会踉跄而行，最终失去对你的追踪，尤其是智力低下的生物。 <blue>你对该生物进行的近战攻击有概率（与你的潜行和武器技能成正比）使其措手不及， 造成额外伤害，使用短剑时效果尤佳。</blue>"}}
