lls and view spell\\n    library (get books to add to it)":"记忆法术并查看法术\\n    库（获取书籍以添加法术）","<console><cyan>)</cyan> : </console>hand weapons (<w>%</w>ield)":"<console><cyan>)</cyan> ：</console>手持武器（<w>%</w>持）","<console><brown>(</brown> : </console>missiles (<w>%</w>uiver, <w>%</w>ire, <w>%</w>/<w>%</w> cycle)":"<console><brown>(</brown> ：</console>弹药（<w>%</w>装填、<w>%</w>瞄准、<w>%</w>/<w>%</w>切换）","<console><cyan>[</cyan> : </console>armour (<w>%</w>ear and <w>%</w>ake off)":"<console><cyan>[</cyan> ：</console>护甲（<w>%</w>穿上和<w>%</w>脱下）","<console><w>?</w> : </console>scrolls (<w>%</w>ead)":"<console><w>?</w> ：</console>卷轴（<w>%</w>读）","<console><magenta>!</magenta> : </console>potions (<w>%</w>uaff)":"<console><magenta>!</magenta> ：</console>药水（<w>%</w>喝）","<console><blue>=</blue> : </console>rings (<w>%</w>ut on and <w>%</w>emove)":"<console><blue>=</blue> ：</console>戒指（<w>%</w>戴上和<w>%</w>取下）","<console><red>\"</red> : </console>amulets (<w>%</w>ut on and <w>%</w>emove)":"<console><red>\"</red> ：</console>项链（<w>%</w>戴上和<w>%</w>取下）","<console><lightred>percent</lightred> : </console>talismans (e<w>%</w>oke)":"<console><lightred>percent</lightred> ：</console>护符（<w>%</w>激发）","<console><lightgrey>/</lightgrey> : </console>wands (e<w>%</w>oke)":"<console><lightgrey>/</lightgrey> ：</console>魔杖（<w>%</w>激发）","</lightcyan> : </console>books (<w>%</w>emorise, <w>%</w>ap, <w>%</w>ap,\\n    pick up to add to spell library)":"</lightcyan> ：</console>书籍（<w>%</w>记忆、<w>%</w>翻阅、<w>%</w>翻阅、\\n    捡起以添加至法术库）","</brown> : </console>staves (<w>%</w>ield)":"</brown> ：</console>法杖（<w>%</w>持）","\\n<h>Targeting\\n<w>Enter</w> or <w>.</w> or <w>Del</w> : confirm target\\n<w>+</w> and <w>-</w> : cycle between targets\\n<w>f</w> or <w>p</w> : shoot at previous target\\n         if still alive and in sight\\n":"\\n<h>瞄准\\n<w>Enter</w>或<w>.</w>或<w>Del</w>：确认目标\\n<w>+</w>和<w>-</w>：在目标之间切换\\n<w>f</w>或<w>p</w>：射击上一个目标\\n        如果目标还活着且在视野内\\n","You feel yourself growing ill in the presence of %s.":"你在%s面前感到身体不适。","\\nIf you bind an item with this curse Ashenzari will enhance the following skills:\\n":"\\n如果你用此诅咒绑定一件物品，阿莎扎丽将强化以下技能：\\n","\\nIf you make this sacrifice, your powers granted by Ru will become stronger in proportion to the value of the sacrifice, and you may gain new powers as well.\\n\\nSacrifices cannot be taken back.\\n":"\\n如果你做出此牺牲，茹赐予你的力量将根据牺牲的价值变强，你可能还会获得新的力量。\\n\\n牺牲不可撤销。\\n"," will brand one of your weapons with the corruption of the Abyss.":" 将用深渊的腐化之力为你的某件武器附魔。","Your lungs are flooded with %s and you cannot breathe.":"你的肺部被%s淹没，无法呼吸。","<white>Welcome!</white>\\n\\n<cyan>You can be:</cyan>":"<white>欢迎！</white>\\n\\n<cyan>你可以选择：</cyan>","Remember to rest between fights and to enter unexplored terrain with full health and magic. Ideally you should retreat into areas you've already explored and cleared of monsters; resting on the edge of the explored terrain increases the chances of your rest being interrupted by wandering monsters. To rest, press <w>5</w> or <w>Shift-numpad 5</w><tiles>, or <w>click the rest button</w></tiles>.":"记得在战斗之间休息，以满生命和法力进入未探索区域。理想情况下，你应该在遇险时撤退。","\\nAlso, berserking might help you not to lose so much health in the first place. To use your abilities press <w>a</w>.":"\\n此外，狂暴可能有助于你一开始就不会损失那么多生命。要使用你的能力，请按<w>a</w>。",". You can learn about any monster by hovering your mouse over it, and read its description by <w>right-clicking</w> on it.":"。你可以将鼠标悬停在任何怪物上来了解它，并通过<w>鼠标右键</w>阅读其描述。"," is a monster, usually depicted by a letter. Some typical early monsters look like <brown>r</brown>, <green>l</green>, <brown>K</brown> or <lightgrey>g</lightgrey>. ":" 是一个怪物，通常用字母表示。一些典型的早期怪物看起来像 <brown>r</brown>、<green>l</green>、<brown>K</brown> 或 <lightgrey>g</lightgrey>。","Your console settings allowing, you'll always see a list of monsters somewhere on the screen.\\n":"如果你的控制台设置允许，你总能在屏幕某处看到怪物列表。\\n","You can gain information about it by pressing <w>x</w> and moving the cursor over the monster, and read the monster description by then pressing <w>v</w>. ":"你可以按<w>x</w>并将光标移到怪物上来获取信息，然后按<w>v</w>阅读怪物描述。","\\nTo attack this monster with your wielded weapon, just move into it. ":"\\n要用已装备的武器攻击此怪物，直接向它移动即可。","Note that as long as there's a non-friendly monster in view you won't be able to automatically move to distant squares, to avoid death by misclicking.":"注意，只要视野中有非友好怪物，你就无法自动移动到远处格子。","However, as a hunter you will want to deal with it using your bow. If you have a look at your shortbow from your <w>i</w>nventory, you'll find an explanation of how to do this. ":"然而，作为一名猎手，你会想用弓箭来对付它。如果你从<w>i</w>背包中查看你的短弓，你会找到相关的操作说明。","First <w>w</w>ield it, then follow the instructions.<tiles>\\nAs a short-cut you can also <w>right-click</w> on your shortbow to read its description, and <w>left-click</w> to wield it.</tiles>":"首先<w>w</w>持它，然后按照说明操作。<tiles>\\n作为快捷方式，你也可以<w>鼠标右键</w>点击你的短弓来阅读其描述。</tiles>","<tiles>Clicking with your <w>right mouse button</w> on your shortbow will also let you read its description.</tiles>":"<tiles>用<w>鼠标右键</w>点击你的短弓也可阅读其描述。</tiles>","However, as a conjurer you will want to deal with it using magic. If you look at the help entry for the <w>M</w>emorisation screen you'll find an explanation of how to do this.":"然而，作为一名咒法师，你会想用魔法来对付它。如果你查看<w>M</w>记忆法术界面的帮助条目，就能了解具体操作。"," just excommunicated you for running out of piety (your divine favour went to nothing). Maybe you repeatedly violated the religious rules, or maybe you failed to please your deity often enough, or some combination of the two. If you can find an altar dedicated to ":" 刚刚因你的虔诚耗尽而将你逐出教门（你的神恩已化为乌有）。也许你一再违反教规，或者未能经常取悦你的神祇，抑或两者皆有。如果你能找到","wasn't such a smart move after all, and you'd like to return to your old faith, you'll have to find an altar dedicated to ":" 并不是那么明智的选择，你想回到原来的信仰，你需要找到一座","Otherwise, you'll have to weather this god's displeasure until their divine wrath is spent.":"否则，你将不得不忍受这位神祇的不满，直到祂的神怒消散。","Note that this kind of alliance only exists between the three good gods, so don't expect this to be the norm.":"注意，这种联盟仅存在于三位善良神祇之间，所以不要指望这是常态。"," is one of the good gods who generally are rather forgiving about change of faith - unless you switch over to the path of evil, in which case their retribution can be nasty indeed!":" 是善良神祇之一，通常对改信相当宽容——除非你投身邪恶之路，那时他们的报复可不会留情！","! But really, changing from one of the good gods to an evil one, what did you expect!? For any god not on the opposing side of the faith, ":"！但是，从善良神祇改信邪恶神祇，你还想怎样！？对于任何不站在信仰对立面的神祇，","! (Actually, only the three good gods will usually be forgiving about this kind of faithlessness.) ":"！（实际上，只有三位善良神祇通常会对这种背信行为表示宽容。）",", so you're stuck with having to suffer the wrath of one god or another.":"，所以你只能承受某位神祇的怒火了。","Welcome back! If it's been a while, you may want to refresh your memory.\\nYour <w>%</w>nventory, ":"欢迎回来！如果有一段时间没玩了，你可能需要回顾一下。\\n你的<w>%</w>背包","This screen shows your character's set of talents. You can gain new abilities via certain items, through religion or by way of mutations. Activation of an ability usually comes at a cost, e.g. Magic power. Press '<w>!</w>' or '<w>?</w>' to toggle between ability selection and description.":"此界面显示你的角色的天赋集。你可以通过特定物品、宗教信仰或变异来获得新能力。","This screen shows the skill set of your character. The number next to the skill is your current level, the higher the better. <w>Training</w> displays training percentages. <w>Costs</w> displays relative training costs. <w>Targets</w> displays skill training targets. You can toggle which skills to train by pressing their slot letters. A <darkgrey>grey</darkgrey> skill will not be trained and ease the training of others.":"此界面显示你的角色技能集。技能旁边的数字是你的当前等级，等级越高越好。","The training percentage (in <brown>brown</brown>) shows the relative amount of the experience gained which will be used to train each skill. It is automatically set depending on which skills you have used recently. Disabling a skill sets the training rate to 0.":"训练百分比（以<brown>棕色</brown>显示）表示获得的经验值中将用于训练该技能的相对比例。","The training cost (in <cyan>cyan</cyan>) shows the experience cost to raise the given skill one level, relative to the cost of raising an aptitude zero skill from level zero to level one.":"训练成本（以<cyan>青色</cyan>显示）表示将指定技能提升一级所需的经验值，相对于当前","Press the letter of a skill to set a training target. When the target is reached a message will appear and the training of the skill will be disabled.":"按技能对应的字母来设定训练目标。达到目标后会有消息显示，训练会自动停止。","This screen shows the skill set of your character. Press the letter of a skill to read its description, or press <w>?</w> again to return to the skill selection.":"此界面显示你的角色技能集。技能旁边的数字是你的当前等级，等级越高越好。","then be taken to target mode with the nearest monster or previous target already targeted. You can also cycle through all hostile monsters in sight with <w>+</w> or <w>-</w>. Once you're aiming at the correct monster, simply hit <w>f</w>, <w>Enter</w> or <w>.</w> to shoot at it. If you miss, <w>":"然后进入瞄准模式，最近的怪物或上一个目标已被自动锁定。你也可以循环切换所有可见目标。","This screen shows the spells in your spell library. From here you can memorise spells by selecting them, as well as view spell descriptions, search for them, and organize them. As a conjurer, you start with five memorisable spells, and one already memorised: Magic Dart. (To view memorised spells, you can exit this menu and select <w>I</w>.)":"此界面显示你的法术库中的法术。你可以在此选择法术进行记忆，也可以查看","\\n\\nA spell that isn't <darkgray>grayed out</darkgray> or <lightred>forbidden</lightred> can be memorised right away by selecting it at this menu.":"\\n\\n没有<darkgray>变灰</darkgray>或<lightred>禁止</lightred>的法术可以立即被记忆。","spells right now. This will change as you grow in levels and Spellcasting proficiency. ":"目前的法术。随着你等级和法术技能的提升，这种情况会改变。","you can <w>left mouse click</w> on the monster you wish to target (or on your player character to cast a spell on yourself) while pressing the <w>Control key</w>, and then select a spell from the menu. Or you can switch to the spellcasting display by <w>clicking on the</w> corresponding <w>tab</w>.\\n\\nAlternatively, ":"你可以<w>点击鼠标左键</w>选择你想要瞄准的怪物（或点击你自己的角色对自己施法），同时按住<w>Ctrl键</w>，然后从菜单中选择法术。或者你也可以切换到法术界面，<w>点击</w>对应的<w>标签</w>。\\n\\n或者，","you can press <w>%</w> and choose a spell, e.g. <w>a</w> (check with <w>?</w>). For attack spells you'll ":"你可以按<w>%</w>并选择一个法术，比如<w>a</w>（用<w>?</w>查看）。对于攻击法术，你","enter the ability menu with <w>%</w>, and then choose the corresponding ability. Note that such an attempt of activation, especially by the untrained, is likely to fail.":"用<w>%</w>进入能力菜单，然后选择对应的能力。注意，这种激活尝试，尤其是未经训练的尝试，很可能会失败。","When wielded, some weapons (such as this one) offer certain abilities you can activate. ":"持握时，某些武器（比如这把）会提供一些可激活的能力。","You can wield this weapon with <w>%</w>, or use <w>%</w> to switch between the weapons in slot a and b. (Use <w>%i</w> to adjust item slots.)":"你可以用<w>%</w>持握这把武器，或用<w>%</w>在插槽 a 和 b 之间切换。（用<w>%i</w>调整物品栏槽位。）","</w> for a while, so maybe you should continue training that rather than <w>":"</w>一段时间，所以也许你应该继续训练那个而不是<w>","</w>. (Press <w>%</w> to see the skill management screen for the actual numbers.)":"</w>。（按<w>%</w>查看技能管理界面了解实际数值。）","Because of your horns you cannot wear helmets. (Press <w>%</w> to see a list of your mutations and innate abilities.)":"因为你的角，你无法戴头盔。（按<w>%</w>查看你的变异和天生能力列表。）","\\nNote that body armour with a high encumbrance rating may hinder your ability to cast spells. Light armour such as robes and leather armour will be generally safe for any aspiring spellcaster.":"\\n请注意，高负重等级的护甲可能影响你施法的能力。轻甲（如长袍和皮甲）通常适合任何有志成为施法者的角色。","\\nNote that shields will hinder your ability to cast spells, until you've gained enough Shields skill to remove the penalty.":"\\n请注意，盾牌会影响你施法的能力，直到你提升足够的盾牌技能来消除惩罚。","\\nNote that many ranged weapons are two handed and so cannot be used with an offhand item.":"\\n请注意，许多远程武器是双手武器，不能与副手物品同时使用。","\\n\\nWhen worn, some types of armour (such as this one) offer certain <w>%</w>bilities you can activate. ":"\\n\\n穿戴时，某些类型的护甲（比如这件）提供一些可<w>%</w>激活的能力。","The magic within can be unleashed by evoking (<w>%</w>) it.":"其中的魔力可以通过<w>%</w>激发来释放。","\\n\\nWhen worn, some types of jewellery (such as this one) offer certain <w>%</w>bilities you can activate. ":"\\n\\n穿戴时，某些类型的首饰（比如这件）提供一些可<w>%</w>激活的能力。","A manual can greatly help you in training a skill. After you pick one up, the skill in question will be trained more efficiently and will level up faster until you exhaust the manual's contents.":"手册能极大帮助你训练某一技能。捡起手册后，相关技能的训练效率将大幅提高，并会更快升级，直到手册内容耗尽。","\\nYou can pick up a spellbook to add its spells to your spell library. (View your spell library with <w>%</w>.)":"\\n你可以捡起法术书将其法术添加到你的法术库中。（用<w>%</w>查看你的法术库。）","Skeletons and corpses can be used as components for certain necromantic spells. Apart from that, they are largely useless.":"骷髅和尸体可以用作某些死灵法术的组件。除此之外，它们基本没什么用。","This staff can enhance your spellcasting, making spells of its related spell school more powerful.":"这根法杖可以增强你的施法能力，使其相关学派的法术更加强大。","Miscellaneous items sometimes harbour magical powers that can be harnessed by e<w>%</w>oking the item.":"杂项物品有时蕴藏着魔法力量，可以通过<w>%</w>激发物品来利用。","These nasty constructions can cause a range of unpleasant effects. You won't be able to avoid tripping traps by flying over them; their magic construction will cause them to be triggered anyway.":"这些讨厌的构造会造成一系列令人不快的效果。你无法通过从陷阱上方飞过来避免触发；它们的魔法构造仍会使其生效。","The dungeon contains a number of natural obstacles such as shafts, which lead one to three levels down. Once you know the shaft is there, you can safely step over it.\\nIf you want to jump down there, use <w>></w> to do so. Be warned that getting back here might be difficult.":"地牢中有许多天然障碍，比如陷坑，会让你掉下一到三层。一旦你知道陷坑在那里，就可以安全地从上面走过。\\n如果想跳下去，请按<w>></w>。但要注意，返回这里可能会很困难。","Some areas of the dungeon, such as the Spider Nest, may be strewn with giant webs that may ensnare you for a short time. Insects, oozes and incorporeal entities can navigate the webs safely.":"地牢的某些区域，比如蜘蛛巢穴，可能布满巨大的蛛网，会让你短暂被困。昆虫、软泥和无实体生物可以安全穿过蛛网。","You can enter the next (deeper) level by following them down (<w>></w>). To get back to this level again, press <w><<</w> while standing on the upstairs.":"你可以顺梯而下进入下一层（更深处）（<w>></w>）。要回到这一层，请站在上行楼梯上按<w><<</w>。","\\n\\nYou have not yet passed through this particular set of stairs. ":"\\n\\n你还没有走过这组特定的楼梯。","These stairs lead out of the dungeon. Following them will end the game. The only way to win is to transport the fabled Orb of Zot outside.":"这些楼梯通往地牢之外。沿楼梯出去会结束游戏。获胜的唯一方法是将传说中的佐特宝珠带到地牢外。","You can enter the previous (shallower) level by following these up (<w><<</w>). This is ideal for retreating or finding a safe resting spot, since the previous level will have less monsters, and monsters on this level can't follow you up unless they're standing right next to you. To get back to this level again, press <w>></w> while standing on the downstairs.":"你可以顺梯而上进入上一层（更浅处）（<w><<</w>）。这很适合撤退或寻找安全的休息地点，因为上一层的怪物较少，而本层的怪物除非紧挨着你，否则无法跟随你上楼。要回到这一层，请站在下行楼梯上按<w>></w>。","Escape hatches can be used to quickly leave a level with <w><<</w> and <w>></w>, respectively. Note that you will usually be unable to return right away.":"上下逃生口分别可以用<w><<</w>和<w>></w>来快速离开当前楼层。注意，你通常无法立即返回。","\\nTo avoid accidentally opening a door you'd rather remain closed during travel or autoexplore, you can mark it with an exclusion from the map view (<w>X</w>) with <w>ee</w> while your cursor is on the grid in question. Such an exclusion will prevent autotravel from ever entering that grid until you remove the exclusion with another press of <w>Xe</w>.":"\\n为避免在旅行或自动探索时意外打开你希望保持关闭的门，你可以在光标位于该格时，从地图视图（<w>X</w>）中按<w>ee</w>将其标记为排除区域。此排除标记会阻止自动旅行进入该格，直到你再次按<w>Xe</w>将其移除。","This is your chance to join a religion! In general, the gods will help their followers, bestowing powers of all sorts upon them, but many of them demand a life of dedication, constant tributes or entertainment in return.\\n":"这是你加入宗教的机会！通常，神祇会帮助其信徒，赐予各种力量，但其中许多神祇会要求你以奉献一生、不断进贡或娱乐作为回报。\\n","This particular altar is so ancient that you cannot make out which god it is dedicated to! Converting here by pressing <w>></w> while standing on the altar will enter you into service of a random god, who will grant you some additional piety in thanks.":"这座祭坛古老得令你无法辨认它供奉哪位神祇！站在祭坛上按<w>></w>改信，会使你投入一位随机神祇的麾下；祂会赐予你一些额外的虔诚作为感谢。","</w> by pressing <w>></w> while standing on the altar. Before taking up the responding faith you'll be asked for confirmation.":"</w>，请站在祭坛上按<w>></w>。在改信相应神祇前，系统会要求你确认。","This particular altar is so ancient that you cannot make out which god it is dedicated to, and ":"这座祭坛古老到你无法辨认它属于哪位神祇，而且","</w>, press <w>></w> while standing on the altar. Before taking up the responding faith (and abandoning your current one!) you'll be asked for confirmation.":"</w>，请站在祭坛上按<w>></w>。在改信相应神祇（并放弃当前信仰）前，系统会要求你确认。","An entryway into one of the many dungeon side branches in Crawl. ":"通往地牢众多侧支之一的入口。","probably dangerous, and you should stay out of it if you can. ":"可能有危险，如果可能的话你应该远离它。","currently harmless, but that could change at some point. Check the overview screen (<w>%</w>) to view your resistances.":"目前无害，但情况可能在某个时候改变。查看概览界面（<w>%</w>）来了解你的抗性。","Did you think you were the only adventurer in the dungeon? Well, you thought wrong! These unique adversaries often possess skills that normal monsters wouldn't, so be careful.\\n\\n":"你以为自己是地牢里唯一的冒险者吗？你错了！这些独特的对手往往拥有普通怪物没有的技能，所以要小心。\\n\\n","The ghost of a deceased adventurer, it would like nothing better than to send you the same way.\\n\\n":"这是已故冒险者的鬼魂，它最想做的就是让你也走上同一条路。\\n\\n","A berserking monster is bloodthirsty and fighting madly. Such a blood rage makes it particularly dangerous!\\n\\n":"狂暴的怪物嗜血好战，疯狂战斗。这种血狂状态使其格外危险！\\n\\n","Friendly monsters will follow you around and attempt to aid you in battle. You can order nearby allies by <w>t</w>alking to them.":"友方怪物会跟随你并尝试在战斗中协助你。你可以通过<w>t</w>与附近的盟友对话来下达指令。","\\n\\nHowever, it is only <w>temporarily</w> friendly, and will become dangerous again when this friendliness wears off.":"\\n\\n但它只是<w>暂时</w>友好的，当这种友好状态消失时它将重新变得危险。","You can easily mark its square as dangerous to avoid accidentally entering into its field of view when using auto-explore or auto-travel. To do so, enter targeting mode with <w>x</w> and then press <w>e</w> when your cursor is hovering over the monster's grid. Doing so will mark this grid and all surrounding ones within a radius of 8 as \"excluded\" ones that explore or travel modes won't enter.":"你可以轻松地将其所在格子标记为危险，以避免在使用自动探索时意外进入它的视野。","Apparently it has not noticed you - yet. Note that you do not have to engage every monster you meet. Sometimes, discretion is the better part of valour.":"它似乎还没有注意到你——至少目前还没有。注意，你并非必须与遇到的每一个怪物交战。有时，谨慎行事才是明智之举。","Apparently it has been distracted by something. You could use this opportunity to sneak up on this monster - or to sneak away.":"它似乎被什么东西分散了注意力。你可以利用这个机会潜行靠近它——或者悄悄溜走。","\\nThis monster doesn't appear to have any resistances or susceptibilities. It cannot fly and is of average speed. Examining other, possibly more high-level monsters can give important clues as to how to deal with them.":"\\n这只怪物似乎没有任何抗性或易受性。它不会飞，速度一般。查看其他可能更高级的怪物，或许能为如何对付它们提供重要线索。","If you linger in this branch for another %d turns, the power of Zot will shatter your %s gem.\\n":"如果你在此分支再逗留%d回合，佐特之力将粉碎你的%s宝石。\\n","%s and a teleportation trap spontaneously manifests!":"%s随后，一个传送陷阱突然出现了！","This entrance appears to skip some branches and may be quite dangerous. Continue anyway?":"这个入口似乎跳过了某些分支，可能相当危险。仍然继续吗？","discovered their monstrous ancestry!":"发现了他们怪物般的血统！","A magic seal in the Gauntlet prevents long-range teleports.":"手套关卡中的魔法封印阻止了远距离传送。","This %s%s is marked as excluded! Open it anyway?":"这个%s%s被标记为已排除！要打开它吗？","\\nTrigger chance:  %d%%\\nBase damage:     %d\\n\\n":"\\n触发几率：%d%%\\n基础伤害：%d\\n\\n","\\nTrigger chance:  %d%%\\nBase damage:     %d":"\\n触发几率：%d%%\\n基础伤害：%d","\\n\\nThis branch can only be %sed while carrying at least %d rune%s of Zot.":"\\n\\n此分支只有在携带至少%d个佐特符文时才能进入。","\\n(If you entered the Abyss now, you could be pulled as deep as Abyss:%d.)":"\\n（如果你现在进入深渊，你可能会被拖到深渊：%d层。）","<lightgrey>: <w>%s</w> [toggle: <w>!</w>], by <w>%s</w> [<w>/</w>], <w>%s</w> useless & duplicates [<w>=</w>]</lightgrey>":"<lightgrey>：<w>%s</w> [切换：<w>!</w>]，按<w>%s</w> [<w>/</w>]，<w>%s</w>无用与重复 [<w>=</w>]</lightgrey>","Pikel's spell is broken, but his former %s can only feel hate for you!":"皮克尔的法术被打破了，但他曾经的%s只能对你满怀仇恨！","What monsters to dismiss (ENTER for all, \"harmful\", \"mobile\", \"los\" or a regex, \"keepitem\" to leave items)? ":"要遣散哪些怪物（回车表示全部、「harmful」「mobile」「los」或正则表达式、「keepitem」保留物品）？","You are silenced but the monster isn't; you will probably hear/see nothing.":"你处于沉默状态但怪物没有；你很可能听/看不到什么。","Both you and the monster are silenced, so you likely won't hear anything.":"你和怪物都处于沉默状态，所以你很可能听不到任何动静。","Your spells cost less MP as you Rev up. Whenever you cast a spell, you make a melee attack against a random enemy in range.":"你的法术消耗法力随热机等级增加而减少。每当你施法时，你会对范围内的随机敌人进行一次近战攻击。","Your AC increases as you Rev (up to +5) and while fully Revved, your attacks may disarm enemies.":"你的护甲等级会随着热机而增加（最多 +5），完全热机时你的攻击可能缴械敌人。","It sometimes fires a blinding ray at enemies whose attacks you dodge.":"它有时会向闪避了它攻击的敌人发射致盲光线。","\\nWhile standing here, you can exit the dungeon with the <w>%s</w> key.":"\\n站在这里时，你可以按<w>%s</w>键离开地牢。","\\nWhile standing here, you can traverse %s with the <w>%s</w> key.":"\\n站在这里时，你可以按<w>%s</w>键穿越%s。","\\nWhile standing here, you can %senter %s with the <w>%s</w> key; it will vanish after you do so.":"\\n站在这里时，你可以按<w>%s</w>键进入%s；进入后它就会消失。","\\nWhile standing here, you can %s %s with the <w>%s</w> key%s.":"\\n站在这里时，你可以按<w>%s</w>键%s%s。","\\nWhile standing here, you can enter <w>%s</w> with the <w>%s</w> key.":"\\n站在这里时，你可以按<w>%s</w>键进入<w>%s</w>。","\\nWhile standing here, you can enter %s with with the <w>%s</w> key.":"\\n站在这里时，你可以按<w>%s</w>键进入%s。","\\nWhile adjacent to it, you can %s%s it by pressing the <w>%s</w> key.":"\\n在它旁边时，你可以按<w>%s</w>键%s%s它。","\\nIf you are struck by this, you will no longer be %s.\\n":"\\n如果你被此击中，你将不再%s。\\n","\\nYou currently have no enchantments that could be removed by this.\\n":"\\n你目前没有任何可以以此移除的附魔。\\n","\\n\\n<magenta>This spell cannot be performed via Aphotic Marionette.</magenta>\\n":"\\n\\n<magenta>此法术无法通过暗影牵线木偶施展。</magenta>\\n","\\n\\n<magenta>When cast via Aphotic Marionette, this spell will affect the player instead.":"\\n\\n<magenta>通过暗影牵线木偶施展时，此法术将影响施法者本人。","%s can sustain at most %s creature summoned by this spell.\\n":"%s最多能维持该法术召唤的%s个生物。\\n","%s can sustain at most %s creatures summoned by this spell.\\n":"%s最多能维持该法术召唤的%s个生物。\\n","You cannot be affected by this spell right now. %s\\n":"你目前无法受到此法术的影响。%s\\n","\\n<lightmagenta>This bane will be lifted from you when you gain another %.1f XLs worth of experience.</lightmagenta>":"\\n<lightmagenta>当你再获得相当于%.1f个经验等级的经验值后，此灾祸便会解除。</lightmagenta>","It will release varied jellies when damaged or killed, with the number of jellies proportional to the amount of damage.\\n":"它会在受到伤害或被杀死时释放各种果冻怪，果冻的数量与受到的伤害成正比。\\n","If this monster is a \"program bug\", then it's recommended that you save your game and reload. Please report monsters who masquerade as program bugs or run around the dungeon without a proper description to the authorities.\\n":"如果这只怪物是“程序错误”，建议保存游戏并重新加载。请向相关人员报告那些伪装成程序错误，或在地牢中四处乱跑却没有适当描述的怪物。\\n","\\nThis cloud is opaque; one tile will not block vision, but multiple will.\\n":"\\n这片云是不透明的。如果你和一个格子之间有两片或更多不透明的云，你将无法看到那个格子里的任何东西。\\n","\\nClouds of this kind an adventurer makes will vanish %s once outside their sight.\\n":"\\n冒险者制造的这类云团一旦离开其视野%s就会消散。\\n","<white>The lance glows brightly as it skewers %s. You feel that it has reached its full power.</white>":"<white>长枪刺穿%s时发出耀眼的光芒。你感到它已达到了力量的巅峰。</white>","Dead mon also at (%d, %d): %s,midx = %d":"死亡怪物也位于（%d，%d）：%s，midx = %d","Monster %s (%d, %d) holding invalid item in slot %d (midx = %d)":"怪物%s（%d，%d）在槽位%d中持有无效物品（midx = %d）","Monster %s (%d, %d) [midx = %d] holding item %s, but item thinks it's held by monster %s (%d, %d) [midx = %d]":"怪物%s（%d，%d）[midx = %d]持有物品%s，但该物品认为自己由怪物%s（%d，%d）[midx = %d]持有","On %s; %d g, %d fail, %u err%s, %u uniq, %d try, %d (%.2f%%) vetos":"位于%s；生成%d，失败%d，错误%u%s，唯一%u，尝试%d，否决%d（%.2f%%）","On %d of %d; %d g, %d fail, %u err%s, %u uniq, %d try, %d (%.2f%%) vetoes":"第%d次，共%d次；生成%d，失败%d，错误%u%s，唯一%u，尝试%d，否决%d（%.2f%%）","Placing %s on top of you would put part of the map outside of the level, cancelling.":"将%s放置在你身上会使部分地图位于关卡外，已取消。","Ok; try placing with &L or go to the relevant location to safely place with &P.":"好的；请尝试用&L放置，或前往相关位置后再用&P安全放置。","Set Abyss speed to what? (now %d, higher value = higher speed) ":"将深渊速度设为多少？（当前为%d，数值越高速度越快） ","Mipmap Setup: Disabled because OpenGL version: %s does not provide glGenerateMipmap.":"Mipmap设置：已禁用，因为OpenGL版本%s不提供glGenerateMipmap。","\\nYour %s, %s, and %s are currently affected.\\n":"\\n你当前的%s、%s和%s受到影响。\\n","the Removed":"已移除者","You feel a strange sense of nostalgia.":"你感到一股莫名的怀旧之情。","You cannot see that place.":"你看不到那里。","Out of range.":"超出范围。","Please select a direction to dig.":"请选择要挖掘的方向。","Digging in that direction won't affect any walls.":"朝那个方向挖掘不会影响任何墙壁。","You can't transfer your ancestor with themself.":"你无法将先祖与其自身交换位置。","%s has no magical effects to unravel.":"%s没有可解除的魔法效果。","You cannot do harm to %s.":"你无法伤害%s。","You cannot affect that.":"你无法影响那个目标。","You can't get through.":"你无法通过那里。","There's already a cloud there.":"那里已经有一片云了。","You can't place harmful clouds in a sanctuary.":"你无法在庇护所中放置有害云雾。","The effect is blocked.":"效果被阻挡了。","You cannot grow anything here.":"你无法在这里种植任何东西。","%s cannot be affected by poisonous vapours.":"%s不受毒气影响。","There's a thick-headed creature in the way.":"有个脑袋很硬的生物挡住了路。","You can only roll a boulder in a compass direction.":"你只能沿八个方位之一滚动巨石。","You cannot conjure a boulder there.":"你无法在那里召出巨石。","You cannot conjure a boulder in an occupied space.":"你无法在被占据的位置召出巨石。","You can't see anything there.":"你在那里什么也看不到。","You cannot bind the soul of an ally.":"你无法束缚盟友的灵魂。","You are unable to grasp such an alien soul.":"你无法掌控如此异质的灵魂。","You cannot bind the soul of a summoned being.":"你无法束缚召唤生物的灵魂。","That does not possess a soul you can bind.":"那个目标没有可供你束缚的灵魂。","Their soul is too badly injured.":"其灵魂受损过重。","Gravity is already pointing downward.":"重力已经指向下方。","You can only reorient gravity in a cardinal direction.":"你只能沿四个正方向重新定向重力。","You don't see a valid target there.":"你在那里看不到有效目标。","Their shadow is too faded to take hold of.":"其暗影过于黯淡，无法控制。","A summoned shadow is too ephemeral to take hold of.":"召唤出的暗影过于虚幻，无法控制。","They have no useful spells to cast right now.":"其目前没有可施放的有效法术。","You cannot putrefy a friendly monster.":"你无法使友方怪物腐烂。","You can only putrefy natural creatures.":"你只能使自然生物腐烂。","This isn't wounded badly enough.":"其伤势还不够严重。","There's nothing to be tempered there.":"那里没有可供淬炼的目标。","You cannot target a construct which is already augmented.":"你无法以已经强化的构装体为目标。","You can only target your own Forgecraft constructs.":"你只能选择自己以锻造术制造的构装体。","You see nothing there you can launch.":"你在那里看不到可发射的东西。","That cannot be teleported.":"那个目标无法被传送。","You can see nowhere safe to land near that.":"你看不到目标附近有任何安全落点。","You must target an enemy who is afraid.":"你必须选择一名正在恐惧的敌人。","Your paragon could not survive being deployed there.":"你的白金典范无法在该位置存活。","you are already filled with unstable energy.":"你体内已经充满不稳定能量。","Sorry, this item was removed!":"抱歉，该物品已被移除！","You can't evoke that!":"你无法激活那个！","This wand has no charges.":"这根魔杖已经没有充能了。","That item cannot be used by those who cannot gain allies!":"无法获得盟友者不能使用该物品！","You can't produce a sound!":"你无法发出声音！","Please select an adjacent position to wall jump against.":"请选择一个相邻位置作为蹬墙跳的支点。","You have no room to wall jump there.":"你没有空间在那里蹬墙跳。","You don't have control over your spell memory.":"你无法控制自己的法术记忆。","Trog doesn't allow you to memorise spells!":"特洛格不允许你记忆法术！","There's no point in enhancing weapons you can't use!":"强化你无法使用的武器毫无意义！","There's no point in enchanting armour you can't use!":"为你无法使用的护甲附魔毫无意义！","There is nothing left to identify.":"已经没有需要鉴定的东西了。","You have no need of identification.":"你不需要进行鉴定。","You can't read that!":"你无法阅读那个！","You have no spells to forget.":"你没有可忘却的法术。","This place cannot be mapped!":"这里无法绘制地图！","You can't drink.":"你无法饮用药水。","You cannot drink potions in your current state!":"你当前的状态无法饮用药水！","You refuse to indulge in frivolous drinking.":"你拒绝沉溺于无谓的饮用。","It's too cold; everything's frozen solid!":"这里太冷了；一切都已经冻得坚硬无比！","You can't drink that!":"你无法饮用那个！","you lack the shapeshifting skill to coax this talisman into a stable form.":"你的变形术技能不足，无法使这枚护符稳定变形。","you can never gain the skill to use this talisman.":"你永远无法获得使用这枚护符所需的技能。","you need to leave your temporary form first.":"你需要先解除临时形态。","you have forsworn all allies in Okawaru's name.":"你已以奥卡瓦鲁之名誓绝所有盟友。","you are loveless.":"你无法感受爱。","Long-range teleportation is disallowed in Dungeon Sprint.":"地牢冲刺中不允许进行长距离传送。","This will place you under penance!":"这会使你受到惩戒！","Your god hates spellcasting!":"你的神祇厌恶施法！","Your god hates this spell!":"你的神祇厌恶这个法术！","You can't make a simulacrum of that!":"你无法用那个制作拟像！","That would be terribly rude!":"那样做太无礼了！","You can't see a valid target there.":"你在那里看不到有效目标。","There's not enough room behind you.":"你身后没有足够的空间。","It isn't safe to move backwards.":"向后移动并不安全。","You already have %s game saved under the name '%s';\\ndo you want to load that instead?":"你已经有一个%s游戏存档，名称为“%s”；\\n是否改为加载该存档？","Please use a different name to start a new %s game, then.":"请换一个名称开始新的%s游戏。","This game comes from a previous release of Crawl (%s).\\n\\nIf you load it now, you won't be able to go back. Continue?":"该存档来自较早版本的 Crawl（%s）。\\n\\n如果现在加载，将无法回退。是否继续？","Please use version %s to load %s then.":"请使用%s版本加载%s。","There exists a save by that name but it appears to be invalid.\\nDo you want to delete it?\\nError: %s":"存在同名存档，但该存档似乎无效。\\n是否删除？\\n错误：%s","This Lava Orc save game cannot be loaded as-is. If you load it now,\\nyour character will be converted to a Mountain Dwarf. Continue?":"该熔岩兽人存档无法保持原状加载。如果现在加载，\\n你的角色将被转换为山矮人。是否继续？","Please load the save in an earlier version if you want to keep it as a Lava Orc.":"如果想保留熔岩兽人角色，请使用较早版本加载该存档。","This Vampire save game cannot be loaded as-is. If you load it now,\\nyour character will be converted to a Human. Continue?":"该吸血鬼存档无法保持原状加载。如果现在加载，\\n你的角色将被转换为人类。是否继续？","Please load the save in an earlier version if you want to remain a Vampire.":"如果想继续作为吸血鬼，请使用较早版本加载该存档。","Another game is already in progress using this save!":"该存档正被另一个游戏进程使用！","a regular":"普通","a Seeded":"自定义种子","a Tutorial":"教程","an Arena":"竞技场","a Dungeon Sprint":"地牢冲刺","a Dungeon Descent":"地牢下降","an Unknown":"未知类型","You can't see any enemies this would affect, really %s?":"你看不到任何会受此影响的敌人，确定要%s吗？","read the %s":"阅读%s","Pick up how many?":"拾取多少？","Drop how many?":"丢弃多少？","Arrows/[<w>enter</w>] to select, [<w>bksp</w>] to clear selected, [<w>?</w>] for help\\n":"方向键/[<w>enter</w>]选择，[<w>bksp</w>]清除所选项，[<w>?</w>]查看帮助\\n","<lightgray>([<w>~</w>] to enter by keycode)</lightgray>":"<lightgray>（[<w>~</w>]按键码输入）</lightgray>","Raw input: [<w>esc</w>] to abort, [<w>enter</w>] to accept.":"原始输入：[<w>esc</w>]中止，[<w>enter</w>]接受。","Input a key sequence. Use <w>\\\\{n}</w> to enter keycode <w>n</w>. [<w>esc</w>] for menu":"输入按键序列。使用<w>\\\\{n}</w>输入按键码<w>n</w>。[<w>esc</w>]返回菜单","[<w>?</w>] Keycode help. Quick reference: 8: [<w>bksp</w>], 9: [<w>tab</w>], 13: [<w>enter</w>], 27: [<w>esc</w>]":"[<w>?</w>]按键码帮助。快速参考：8：[<w>bksp</w>]，9：[<w>tab</w>]，13：[<w>enter</w>]，27：[<w>esc</w>]","Enter keycode by number:":"输入数字按键码：","<cyan>Press Esc to close, arrows/pgup/pgdn to scroll.</cyan>":"<cyan>按 Esc 关闭，使用方向键/pgup/pgdn 滚动。</cyan>","Trunk doesn't count for the tournament, you want %s. Still play Trunk? (Y/N)":"Trunk 不计入锦标赛，你想参加%s。仍然游玩 Trunk 吗？（Y/N）"," Use anyway?":" 仍然使用？","bugs":"错误","<lightcyan>Items</lightcyan>":"<lightcyan>物品</lightcyan>","<lightcyan>Spells</lightcyan>":"<lightcyan>法术</lightcyan>","<lightcyan>Abilities</lightcyan>":"<lightcyan>能力</lightcyan>","Next page":"下一页","Previous page":"上一页","Display abilities":"显示能力","Use abilities":"使用能力","[L-Click] Use (%)":"[左键] 使用 (%)","\\n[R-Click] Describe":"\\n[右键] 查看说明","Display inventory":"显示物品栏","Use items":"使用物品","Next page\\n