ampage MPRegen)":"你向敌人翻滚时会恢复法力。（冲锋法力再生）","You regenerate magic and health when rolling toward enemies. (Rampage Regen)":"你向敌人翻滚时会恢复法力和生命。（冲锋再生）","Your shaggy fur will keep you warm. (AC + 3, rC+)":"你的浓密皮毛将为你保暖。（AC + 3, rC+）","You feel space start to knot itself around you.":"你感到周围的空间开始纠结在一起。","mutation|acidic bite":"酸性撕咬","mutation|beak":"鸟喙","mutation|clever":"聪慧","mutation|clumsy":"笨拙","mutation|repulsion field":"排斥力场","mutation|dopey":"愚钝","mutation|fangs":"尖牙","mutation|horns":"角","mutation|molten scales":"熔融鳞片","mutation|rugged brown scales":"粗糙褐鳞","mutation|shaggy fur":"浓密皮毛","mutation|sharp scales":"锐利鳞片","mutation|thin skeletal structure":"纤细骨骼","mutation|tough skin":"硬化表皮","status|acrobatic":"身手敏捷","status|gold aura":"金币光环笼罩","status|in a heavenly storm":"身处天界风暴","status|parry":"招架中","status|phalanx barrier":"方阵屏障","status|under a protective aura":"受到防护光环保护","status|strong-willed":"意志坚定","coated in regenerative ooze":"你被再生软泥覆盖。","Welcome to the Realm of Zot!\\nYou feel the power of the Orb interfering with translocations here.":"欢迎来到佐特领域！\\n你感到宝珠的力量在这里干扰着空间转移。","You enter the halls of Pandemonium!\\nTo return, you must find a gate leading back.":"你进入了万魔殿的厅堂！\\n若想返回，必须找到通往外界的门。","Trove":"宝藏库","Hurry and find it before the portal closes forever!":"赶快在传送门永久关闭前找到它！","creaking":"吱嘎作响","they move on!":"他们启程前找到入口！","tolling":"鸣响","flickering gateway to a bazaar":"通往集市的闪烁门户","Upon your arrival, your hatred by all makes the other customers disperse.":"你一到来，因为所有人都憎恨你，其他顾客便纷纷散去。","Upon your arrival, your lonesome duelist's vow makes the other customers flee.":"你一到来，孤高决斗者的誓言便让其他顾客纷纷逃走。","Xom shifts dimensions to make the bazaar a little more interesting.":"佐姆扭转维度，让集市变得更有趣了一点。","You hear the bustle and chatter of other... customers...?":"你听到了其他……顾客……？的喧闹与交谈声。","You hear the chatter and bustle of other customers!":"你听到了其他顾客的交谈与喧闹声！"," Hurry and find it before the gateway collapses!":"赶快在入口坍塌前找到它！","There is a portal to the Desolation of Salt on this level.":"这个楼层有一个通往盐之荒原的传送门。","whistling":"呼啸","gateway":"入口","Find the entrance quickly before the gate is sealed!":"赶快在大门封闭前找到入口！","beating":"敲击","Hurry and find it before the portal melts!":"赶快在传送门融化前找到它！","crackling":"噼啪作响","archway":"拱门","Hurry and find it before the portal closes!":"赶快在传送门关闭前找到它！","You hear the {distance} {noisemaker} {prefix}.":"你听到{distance}{noisemaker}中传来{prefix}。","<red>Going directly to Necropolis without placing an entry vault is buggy. Placing a Depths / Crypt Necropolis.</red>":"<red>未放置入口地图就直接前往死灵城会导致错误。现正放置一个位于深层区 / 墓穴的死灵城。</red>","Hurry and find it before the portal is buried!":"赶快在传送门被掩埋前找到它！","There is a click, and some walls slide away!":"咔哒一声，几面墙滑开了！","Hurry and find it before the portal rusts away!":"赶快在传送门锈蚀殆尽前找到它！","rusting":"锈蚀","The drain falls to bits.":"排水口散架了。","Entered %s":"进入了%s","Saw a vision of the %s.":"看到了%s的幻象。","Saw a vision of the %s and the %s.":"看到了%s与%s的幻象。","Entered the realm of %s.":"进入了%s的领域。","Arena points: %s (+%s) [x%s]":"竞技场点数：%s（+%s）[x%s]","Round %s.":"第%s回合。","Entered arena %s.":"进入了竞技场%s。","You've discovered %s!":"你发现了%s！","Hurry and find it before the entrance collapses!":"赶快在入口坍塌前找到它！","rumble":"轰隆作响","tunnel":"隧道","There is a rumble as the volcano erupts. The roof shakes.":"火山爆发时传来一阵轰鸣，洞顶随之震动。","The volcano erupts! Nearby, a roof collapses.":"火山爆发了！附近一处洞顶随之坍塌。","The ground shudders ominously.":"地面不祥地震颤起来。","In the distance, the volcano explodes with a roar! Lava spreads onto the path.":"远处的火山轰然爆发！熔岩漫上了道路。","The air is thick with the scent of sulphur.":"空气中弥漫着浓重的硫磺味。","There is another distant roar. More lava overflows!":"远处又传来一声轰鸣。更多熔岩溢了出来！","The ground moves violently!":"地面剧烈震动！","The volcano erupts again! A thin layer of lava overflows to fill the cavern.":"火山再次爆发！一层薄薄的熔岩溢出，灌满了洞穴。","The ground shudders. Some of the lava has hardened enough to walk over!":"地面一阵震颤。部分熔岩已经凝固，足以供人通行了！","portal closes forever!":"传送门永久关闭！","crackle":"噼啪作响","The walls briefly shake.":"墙壁短暂地震动了一下。","The walls violently shake.":"墙壁剧烈震动。","The walls fall away. The entombed are set free!":"墙壁轰然倒塌。被封葬者重获自由！","A door appears!":"一扇门出现了！","The walls vibrate.":"墙壁震动起来。","Strange, shadowy figures dance through the air in front of you.":"奇异的暗影人形在你面前的空中舞动。","This room is filled with shadowy figures, quietly meditating.":"房间里满是静静冥想的暗影人形。","Here, spectral monks perform complicated, martial routines; they fade quickly.":"幽魂僧侣在这里演练复杂的武术套路；他们很快便消散了。","Faint laughter comes from somewhere. Too faint to be real.":"不知何处传来微弱的笑声，微弱得不像真实存在。","There is a faint scream of pain from a crouched figure. This too fades quickly.":"一个蜷伏的人影发出微弱的痛苦尖叫，声音也很快消散了。","One of the shadowy figures appears more solid!":"其中一个暗影人形变得更加凝实了！","Shadows coalesce into solid form.":"暗影凝聚成了实体。","The shadows inhabiting this place fade forever.":"盘踞此地的暗影永远消散了。","A lost soul coalesces out of thin air!":"一个迷失的灵魂凭空凝聚成形！","Zonguldrok's gravestone":"宗古德洛克的墓碑","Ashenzari says: See what I see, mortal...":"艾申扎利说道：“凡人，看看我所看到的……”","Miasma emanates from the human's flesh.":"瘴气从人类的血肉中散发出来。","The human rises from the dead!":"那个人类死而复生了！","An item emerges from the Abyss! Perhaps it is an incitement to worship... or even an insult?":"一件物品从深渊中浮现！这或许是在诱你皈依……甚至可能是在侮辱你？","\"Beware! This is a limited time offer!\"":"“小心！这是限时优惠！”","A transporter appears.":"一个传送器出现了。","<white>The transporter glows with a rainbow of weird colours and disappears.</white>":"<white>传送器泛起诡异的虹彩光芒，随后消失了。</white>","Nemelex Xobeh says: You win!":"尼姆雷斯·索布说道：“你赢了！”","Nemelex Xobeh says: You lose!":"尼姆雷斯·索布说道：“你输了！”","The portcullises are lifted away, releasing the combatants.":"吊闸升起，参战者被放了出来。","The doors seal shut behind you!":"你身后的门封死了！","Okawaru booms: Excellent! You may choose a reward.":"奥卡瓦鲁轰声说道：“很好！你可以选择一份奖励。”","The gates behind the altar rise, and the entry reopens.":"祭坛后方的闸门升起，入口重新开启。","As you approach the altar, the fountains begin to flow with blood!":"当你靠近祭坛时，喷泉开始涌出鲜血！","Let the past return from memory!":"让往昔从记忆中归来！","\"WORSHIP ME, MORTAL,\" Xom booms, \"AND I SHALL GRANT YOU THE GREATEST GIFT OF ALL.\"":"“崇拜我吧，凡人，”佐姆轰声说道，“我将赐予你世间最珍贵的礼物。”","A goblin pops into existence! It looks at you with admiration.":"一只地精凭空冒了出来！它满怀敬仰地看着你。","\"Friendship. The greatest gift is friendship!\"":"“友谊。最珍贵的礼物就是友谊！”","For a moment, you catch a glimpse of warriors who walked this path long ago.":"刹那间，你瞥见了很久以前走过这条道路的战士。","\"I found one of your ancestors!\"":"“我找到了你的一位祖先！”","The spellbook bursts into flames! Trog roars with delight!":"法术书猛然燃烧起来！特洛格欣喜地咆哮！","Flames erupt from the bowels of the wizard! Trog roars with satisfaction!":"烈焰从法师体内喷涌而出！特洛格满意地咆哮！","Vehumet offers to free you in exchange for your devotion to destruction.":"维胡梅特愿意释放你，以换取你献身于毁灭之道。","Suddenly, the trees start to burn!":"树木突然燃烧起来！","You feel as though Xom is toying with you.":"你感觉佐姆似乎在戏弄你。","Suddenly, the walls become transparent!":"墙壁突然变得透明！","The walls suddenly crumble!":"墙壁突然崩塌了！","A dream sheep catches fire!":"一只梦境绵羊着火了！","You hear mad divine giggling.":"你听到神祇疯狂的窃笑。","You sense Yredelemnul urging you to kill the trapped human.":"你感觉伊莱德莱姆努尔正在催促你杀死受困的人类。","Yredelemnul welcomes your deed!":"伊莱德莱姆努尔赞许你的所作所为！","You feel a numb sensation.":"你感到一阵麻木。","You hear a strange fizzling.":"你听到奇怪的嘶嘶消散声。","There is a click. Suddenly, the grates are dropped!":"咔哒一声。铁栅突然落下！","There is a click. Nothing appears to happen.":"咔哒一声。似乎什么也没发生。","Something awakens from inside the sarcophagi!":"有什么东西从石棺中苏醒了！","The ground shakes!":"地面震动起来！","You hear grinding stone!":"你听到石块摩擦的声音！","You hear the creaking of ancient metal!":"你听到古老金属的吱嘎声！","The tension of great conflict fills the air!":"大战将临的紧张气息弥漫在空气中！","The demonic rune of Zot may be found here.":"这里或许能找到佐特恶魔符文。","A powerful Pandemonium lord resides here.":"一位强大的万魔殿领主盘踞于此。","It guards the demonic rune of Zot.":"它守护着佐特恶魔符文。","<yellow>A demonic rune of Zot can be found here... for a price.</yellow>":"<yellow>这里能找到佐特恶魔符文……只要你付得起代价。</yellow>","The grate goes up!":"铁栅升起来了！","You hear a sound of rusty metal sliding.":"你听到锈蚀金属滑动的声音。","The surface of the water froths suddenly, and then rushes away.":"水面突然泛起泡沫，随后水流奔涌而去。","You feel a strange vibration for a moment.":"你短暂地感觉到一阵奇怪的震动。","You hear the sound of toppling stones.":"你听到石块倾倒的声音。","The stone walls suddenly crumble and collapse.":"石墙突然碎裂坍塌。","A basket of spiders falls from above!":"一篮蜘蛛从上方落下！","You notice webbing strewn about the room and hear a chittering noise in the background.":"你注意到房间里到处散布着蛛网，还听到背景中传来吱吱声。","A figure emerges from the depths of the water!":"一个身影从水底深处浮现！","The water ripples visibly.":"水面明显泛起涟漪。","You hear an unearthly scream, and the grinding of stone!":"你听到一声非尘世的尖叫，以及石块摩擦的声音！","The path is suddenly blocked!":"道路突然被堵住了！","The air is stale and forgotten.":"空气陈腐，仿佛被遗忘已久。","A rune of Zot has appeared.":"一枚佐特符文出现了。","The exit has re-opened... for now.":"出口重新开启了……暂时如此。","The exit has re-opened.":"出口重新开启了。","The Orb of Zot has appeared in the centre of the arena!":"佐特宝珠出现在竞技场中央！","<yellow>You have won a prize for killing the boss!</yellow>":"<yellow>你因杀死首领而赢得了奖品！</yellow>","<yellow>Victory!</yellow>":"<yellow>胜利！</yellow>","Score multiplier reset to 27x":"分数倍率重置为 27 倍。","You lost your score multiplier.":"你的分数倍率消失了。","You now have 1 arena point.":"你现在有 1 点竞技场点数。","<white>The arena falls silent. Everyone but you is dead.</white>":"<white>竞技场归于寂静。除你之外，所有人都死了。</white>","<white>There is nothing to do now but take the Orb and leave.</white>":"<white>现在只需拿起宝珠离开。</white>","<white>Congratulations, champion.</white>":"<white>恭喜你，冠军。</white>","Time's up!":"时间到！","The arena falls silent.":"竞技场归于寂静。","<yellow>Get ready!</yellow>":"<yellow>准备好！</yellow>","FINAL BOSS!":"最终首领！","BOSS ROUND!":"首领回合！","ZOT ROUND!":"佐特回合！","FIGHT!":"开战！","LIGHTNING ROUND!":"闪电回合！","The exit has been sealed! It will re-open when you get the next rune.":"出口已被封死！取得下一枚符文后才会重新开启。","<cyan>You have entered the arena!\\nYou will win if you kill everything that spawns (including allies).\\nIf it is a boss round, you only need to kill the boss in order to win.\\nIf it is a lightning round, you only need to survive!</cyan>":"<cyan>你进入了竞