+export const MANUAL_PROSE: Record<string, string> = {
+  "A living weapon whose forcipules are dagger-sharp and reach is long. Its sting can deliver crippling toxins to those it strikes and at higher levels of enchantment, can even briefly slow or paralyse foes. After performing a moderate number of attacks with this, it will separate itself from your body to attack foes independently for a short while before dying.": "一种活体武器，毒爪如匕首般锋利，攻击距离很长；它的蜇刺能注入致残毒素。",
+  "A tiny figurine of a centipede coiled around a stone. Gripping it tightly will transform it into a living weapon that merges with one's own body. This weapon functions as a reaching short blade whose attacks can poison targets. After performing a moderate number of attacks with this weapon, it will separate itself from its wielder's body and fight alongside you as an independent ally for a short time before dying. Shapeshifting skill increases the power of this centipede in both weapon and insect form, as well the potency of its toxins - eventually allowing it to sometimes slow or even paralyse foes.": "一尊小蜈蚣雕像，盘绕在石头上。紧紧握住它，它就会变成活体武器。",
+  "The dried remains of a tail shed under duress. Partially transforms the user into a hypnogecko, a reptile with a remarkable degree of metachrosis. Their skin naturally changes colour to blend in with their surroundings, making them stealthy, and when badly injured, they reflexively shed their own tail and make it scintillate with bright colours as a decoy - allowing them to either flee or even strike at their distracted predators from a blind spot.": "一条在危急时脱落的尾巴干尸。能让使用者部分变成催眠壁虎，这种爬行动物擅于潜行。",
+  "A small statuette carved out of multi-hued jade which thrums with quiet power. Causes a great mantle of elementally-attuned crystal to grow out of the wearer's head and upper body, increasing their proficiency with fire, ice, earth, and air magic, but impairing all other schools. Each time the wearer casts a spell from one of those four schools, it will empower the corresponding crystal and unleash a burst of damaging magic. If all four crystals become charged at once, the wearer's resistances and fortitude will be temporarily enhanced.": "一尊用多彩玉石雕成的小雕像，散发着沉静的力量。能形成强大的元素护体。",
+  "A small censer from which pours an endless smoky haze. Transforms the wearer's head into a billowing shroud of mist. Any potions they drink in this form will be rapidly decomposed into gases which they can expel via melee attacks as blasts of harmful clouds. They can also slowly condense the dungeon's air into potions of mist, allowing them to become intangible and blind monsters. However, the lack of typical mouth parts makes it difficult to pronounce incantations, greatly slowing the speed at which they cast spells.": "一座不断冒出烟霾的小香炉。把穿戴者的头部变成翻涌的雾罩。",
+  "While purporting itself to be the personal account of a famous naturalist, it becomes clear upon reading that this book was compiled from multiple unrelated sources, including notes from a stagehand of a travelling magical circus. The travelogue may be fictitious, but some of the spell diagrams carefully transcribed in the margins seem quite real.": "自称某位著名博物学家的私人游记，读下去却会发现并非如此。",
+  "While invisible, most monsters have greatly reduced accuracy against you, cannot make attacks of opportunity, and the spells they cast may sometimes be aimed at the wrong location. They may also stumble around and eventually lose track of you, especially if their intelligence is low. In addition, melee attacks you make against such creatures have a chance (proportional to your stealth and weapon skill) of catching them off-guard and dealing increased damage, especially if performed with a short blade. Certain creatures can see through this invisibility and it will always be completely ineffective while standing in water.": "隐形时，大多数怪物对你的命中大幅下降，无法借机攻击。",
+  "A vial of mist which temporarily turns the imbiber's body insubstantial, protecting them from constriction, petrification, barbs, sticky flame, webs, nets, and being caught by bolas. It will also end most of those effects if they are already afflicted.": "一瓶雾气，暂时让饮用者的身体变得虚体，免受缠绕等效果。",
+  "A small charm bearing the likeness of an eye. It gives the wearer supernatural sight, allowing them to perceive the clouds of magical residue left behind whenever beings cast spells. Touching those clouds allows them to convert that leftover magic into unnerring projectiles against nearby foes. This third eye even allows one to see from further distances than would otherwise be possible{{ if you.get_base_mutation_level(\"+LOS\") > 0 then return \" (but your own vision is already as long as possible).\" else return \", but be warned - creatures perceived this way will perceive you back.\" end }}": "一枚眼睛形状的小护符，赋予穿戴者超自然视力。",
+  "You have detected an object here, but you do not know what it is.": "你在这里探测到一个物体，但不知道它是什么。",
+  "A lump of sickly pustulent flesh, dripping with lethal acid.": "一团病态化脓的肉块，滴着致命酸液。",
+  "A floating shard of crystaline jade which resonates with your air magic.": "一块漂浮的水晶玉片，与你的气系魔法共鸣。",
+  "A floating shard of crystaline jade which resonates with your earth magic.": "一块漂浮的水晶玉片，与你的土系魔法共鸣。",
+  "A floating shard of crystaline jade which resonates with your fire magic.": "一块漂浮的水晶玉片，与你的火系魔法共鸣。",
+  "A floating shard of crystaline jade which resonates with your ice magic.": "一块漂浮的水晶玉片，与你的冰系魔法共鸣。",
+  "A mutated devotee of Lugonu, warped by years of living in the Abyss. It has ascended into an exalted representative of Lugonu's spite against the rest of all existence and solemnly tears apart reality in Lugonu's name.": "一名被深渊岁月扭曲的鲁古努信徒，已升华为被尊崇的代表。",
+  "The shed tail of a hypnogecko, still pulsing with mesmerising colours and compelling any nearby predators to focus their attention on it instead of the unfortunate lizard it once belonged to.": "催眠壁虎脱落的尾巴，仍脉动着迷幻色彩，迫使附近的掠食者失神。",
+  "Once a gangly and bedraggled vampire with a strange obsession with colour, Blorkula was offered succour by a missionary of Beogh and became a portly and vigorous orc with a strange obsession with colour instead. He wields magic tinged with every hue of the rainbow, and has mastered the art of dividing his own form among its many colours to avoid killing blows - though even he must rest a while before doing so a second time.": "曾是一名瘦长憔悴、痴迷色彩的吸血鬼，后来从某种力量那里获得了庇护。",
+  "An intrepid goblin who has somehow managed to tame a ghost moth as his mount. While the elaborate snarl of ropes he is using to remain upright on it surely undermines the moth's own mobility, even a hobbled ghost moth can be a deadly adversary. And Goji? Well. He's also here.": "一只勇敢的地精，不知怎么驯服了一只鬼蛾当坐骑。",
+  "Fires a penetrating bolt of ontologically-paradoxical antimagic, draining its victims' reserves of magic.": "发射一道穿透性的反魔法闪电，抽干受害者的法力。",
+  "Enhances the caster's physical form, greatly increasing the damage they deal in melee as well as their resistance to all elements.": "强化施法者的肉体，大幅提高近战伤害与抗性。",
+  "Causes walls of thorny brambles to grow rapidly in a ring around all nearby enemies. The caster's allies may fire projectiles through these briars without hinderance, but anyone else may find removing them rather painful.": "在附近所有敌人周围迅速长出荆棘墙；施法者的盟友可以穿过。",
+  "Allows the caster to tap into ley lines of elemental energy which pervade the dungeon and channel their destructive power against enemies. Casting it exposes up to four dragon veins on adjacent floor tiles - one corresponding to each of fire, ice, air, and earth magic. Stepping onto any of them will trigger an immediate destructive spellcast at the cost of 1 MP, targeting up to 3 random enemies with an additional property that depends on the element tapped into: Fire (West): Prioritises enemies with the least health. Leaves behind brief fire clouds when it kills something. Ice (East): Prioritises enemies with the most health. Briefly freezes them, slowing their movement. Air (North): Prioritises the most distant enemies. Unlike the other 3 elements, does full damage even to distant targets. Earth (South): Prioritises the closest enemies. Strikes one fewer target and does greatly reduced damage to flying creatures, but enemies hit at close range may be staggered. You may channel from up to two of these dragon veins before the spell expires.": "让施法者接入遍布地牢的元素地脉，引导其毁灭力量。",
+  "Causes a ring of sharp icy thorns to sprout from the ground around a targeted enemy. These thorns deal damage to any non-flying creature which steps on them and then crumble away. The caster can step onto their own thorns without harm (but they will still crumble when doing so).": "在目标敌人周围的地面长出尖锐冰棘，造成伤害。",
+  "Summons some glowmurk ghasts, which spread both magical contamination and shallow water in a single attack before disappearing.": "召唤一些幽暗食尸鬼，它们的一次攻击会同时散播魔法污染与浅水。",
+  "Shifts the caster's body slighty out of phase with normal space, causing their exact position to become blurry and indistinct. Any attackers without supernaturally acute vision will have a much harder time hitting them and also be unable to assess the degree of their injuries.": "让施法者的身体略微偏离正常空间，使其确切位置变得模糊。",
+  "Unleashes a gust of searingly hot wind, burning up to 3 adjacent creatures and blowing them backwards. Alas, the capricious winds left swirling around those creatures will also speed their movements for several turns afterward. This spell cannot be recast for several turns and moving will delay its recharge.": "释放灼热狂风，烧灼至多 3 个相邻生物并将它们吹退。",
+  "Charges rapidly in a straight line towards a foe. The user will move at double speed in that direction each turn afterward, attacking any enemies in their path with increased damage and accuracy and pushing them backward, until they either become unable to move or have overshot their target. Can only be used while their target is standing in a compass direction from the user.": "沿直线向敌人猛冲，每回合以双倍速度朝该方向移动。",
+  "Summons a group of berserk ufetubi; irksome minor demons who will rapidly swarm and surround the caster's enemies.": "召唤一群狂暴的乌费图比——烦人的小恶魔，会迅速包围施法者的敌人。",
+  "Unmoors a random nearby ally from space, granting it Manifold Assault as a natural ability (which permits it to strike many distant foes with a single melee attack that can't miss), and also giving it a chance to blink when it uses such.": "将一名附近盟友从空间中解缚，赋予其“多重突击”作为天生能力。",
+  "A dense carpet of colourful mould, rustling with fecundity. The towering fungi which sprout from it can grow back in the blink of an eye, no matter how many times they are cut down.": "一层浓密多彩的霉菌，生机勃勃地沙沙作响；从中长出的高耸真菌会攻击靠近者。",
+  "An experimental arcane still, brewing some incomplete- if refined- mutagenic serum. Breaking this open will bathe you in mystic mists, imparting upon you one beneficial mutation (excluding those that could restrict equipment slots).": "一座实验性的奥术蒸馏器，正在酿造某种不完整（或许已精炼）的变异血清。打碎它会释放其中的力量。",
+  "A complex arcane still, cracked open and fully emptied of its contents.": "一座复杂的奥术蒸馏器，已被打碎并倒空。",
+  "An exposed ley line of earth magic. It can be tapped into by stepping on it, causing shockwaves that damage the 2 closest enemies. This does greatly reduced damage to distant and flying enemies.": "一条裸露的土系地脉。踩上去可引导它，释放震波伤害周围的敌人。",
+  "An exposed ley line of fire magic. It can be tapped into by stepping on it, blasting the 3 enemies with the least health with fire. Any enemies killed by this will briefly leave behind a cloud of fire.": "一条裸露的火系地脉。踩上去可引导它，轰击 3 个敌人。",
+  "An exposed ley line of ice magic. It can be tapped into by stepping on it, inflicting cold damage on the 3 enemies with the most health and slowing their movement for a short time.": "一条裸露的冰系地脉。踩上去可引导它，对 3 个敌人造成寒冷伤害。",
+  "An exposed ley line of air magic. It can be tapped into by stepping on it, blasting the 4 most distant enemies with cutting wind.": "一条裸露的气系地脉。踩上去可引导它，轰击最远的 4 个敌人。",
+  "A patch of ground covered in sharp frozen spines. It deals a small amount of damage to any non-flying creature that steps onto it (other than its creator) and then crumbles away. Its damage is partially reduced by rC.": "一片覆盖尖锐冰刺的地面，对任何非飞行生物造成少量伤害。",
+  "A passage leading to a gutter gulch, gradually rusting away. Entering it will inflict three temporary mutations upon you, or decompose you if you're undead.": "一条通往锈蚀沟壑的通道。进入会施加三种临时变异。",
+  "It seems to be oozing quietly. Best not to touch it.": "它似乎在静静渗液。最好别碰。",
+  "A scattered mess of fragmented, crumbling garbage, caked in ashes and dirt.": "一堆破碎腐朽的垃圾，覆满灰烬与泥土。",
+  "The partisan of Prune carries a terrible and insidious curse. Unless its wielder maintains firm self-control, they are doomed to undergo a horrifying (albeit temporary) transformation. This is normally trivial to resist, but incapacitated wielders are certain to succumb, finding themselves nightmarishly purple, squishy, and delicious. They can take comfort in learning that it's surprisingly hard to injure a giant prune.": "普卢恩之戟带着可怕而阴险的诅咒。除非持用者保持坚定的自控，否则它可能反噬。",
+  "Soon after falling, Yredelemnul attempted to twist holy energy into a dark mockery of itself, turning it against its progenitors and weakening it against undead and demons. It was discovered too late that such a complete perversion was uncontrollable; the foul flame destabilised or destroyed everything it was infused into, except for several demonic test subjects and one stolen holy weapon. A lesser, and more stable, version of the dark energy proved more workable, and became Yredelemnul's umbra. This is that weapon: an eveningstar with its light long fled, despite its name, and a shadow that repulses those its light used to comfort...": "堕落后不久，伊莱德莱姆努尔试图把神圣能量扭曲成自己的黑暗仿制品。",
+  "An adamantine great sword. Its first wielder was a worshipper of Yredelemnul who eschewed the use of magic in combat, preferring to destroy her enemies with brute force. Unfortunately for her, not all of her opponents shared her limitations. It has felled countless great warriors under her grip, and the souls of those who had their lives taken beckon it to take even more under its new owner.": "一把精金巨剑。它的第一位持用者是一位拒绝魔法的伊莱德莱姆努尔信徒。",
+  "A pendant made of purest jade. It grants its wearer immense willpower and mental fortitude.": "一枚纯净玉石制成的吊坠，赋予穿戴者强大的意志与精神韧性。",
+  "A large pair of ghostly claws fashioned into gloves by a fenstrider coven for use in necromantic rites. The magically inclined and pugilistically favoured alike may grasp their connection with the spirits of the dead, but these pincers make grasping anything else an exercise in frustration. (This item prohibits the use of a weapon or shield while equipped.)": "一双巨大的幽灵蟹钳，被沼泽行者 coven 制成手套用于死灵仪式。",
+  "Even the trolls have their share of nature poets, glassy-eyed dreamers, and starving artists. This is the masterwork of one such restless soul, a paean to the heavens far above.": "就连巨魔也有自己的自然诗人、眼神迷离的梦想家和饥饿的艺术家。",
+  "A massive polearm hewn in one piece from a coolibah tree. Its blade is no less sharp for being made of wood, and those caught in its enchanted branches will soon find themselves at home in the bog from which this deadly weapon sprouted.": "一把用整棵酷栗树砍削而成的巨型长柄斧，木制刃口同样锋利。",
+  "The staff of a venerable master monk who drove away her foes as easily as her attachments and (so the legend says) eventually transcended life and death altogether. A worthy wielder may unlock the staff's great potential, provided they follow its former owner's peculiar ideas of balance and comportment.": "一位可敬武僧大师的法杖；她驱散敌人如同驱散执念。",
+  "An unassuming sword resembling a prop weapon for theatrical use. But behold! A twist here, a press there, and the real blade springs forth; glittering, wicked, murderous. Has it killed before? If so, it left no witnesses. Shall it kill for you? If you're sly enough, it will do just as you like.": "一把看似舞台道具的普通长剑。但这里一拧、那里一按，就会露出真容。",
+  "The favored sword of one of the battlemage Yara's most illustrious pupils, an alleged demigoddess who often boasted that one spell and one slash were enough to settle any battle. Indeed, all of her duels ended in just such a fashion, including her last.": "战法师亚拉最杰出弟子之一——据传是半神——最钟爱的弯刀。",
+  "A truly ancient set of armour designed for maximum protection and flexibility. Evidently intended for use by mounted hexslingers, its magic wards and sigils are in a hopeless state of disrepair. Nevertheless, some traces of their power still remain.": "一套真正古老的护甲，为最大防护与灵活性而设计，显然供施法者使用。",
+  "The half-stitched, or half-unstitched, torso of a bone dragon, fashioned (if one may call it that) into a truly wretched piece of armour. Its jagged bones seem to pulse with unlife, awaiting the command of some unholy master.": "骨龙半缝合（或半拆开）的躯干，被制成一件真正可穿的护甲。",
+  "A bronze chestpiece of masterful make. It is etched all over with religious imagery, but the focus of the scene is obscured by a great dark stain {{ if you.can_smell() then return \"that smells strongly \" end }}of ashes and salt. It seems somehow blasphemous to wear.": "一件工艺精湛的青铜胸甲，通体刻满宗教图像。",
+  "Attempts to soothe a hostile creature and convince them to give up their violent ways. If successful, the creature will turn neutral and attempt to leave the floor as quickly as possible. You will be granted its full experience value. This works best on holy and living creatures, with the undead and demons being progressively harder to pacify - particularly if they are intelligent. Neither mindless nor nonliving creatures can be pacified and no monster can be pacified while it is asleep. Invocations skill increases your chance of success and allows you to pacify more powerful creatures.": "尝试安抚一个敌对生物，说服它放弃暴力。若成功，该生物会平静下来。",
+  "Comforts a friendly creature who is suffering, healing some of its wounds (based on your Invocations skill) and also curing poison, confusion, slowing, sickness, weakness, draining, and petrification. Any summoned creature who is healed by this ability may also be granted a small amount of additional time in this world.": "安抚一个受伤的友方生物，治疗其部分伤势（取决于你的祈神技能）。",
+  "Greatly increases your maximum health and magic points, depending on Invocations skill. Your current health and magic points will also be increased proportionally. Any friendly creatures near you will also have their health doubled for as long as the effect lasts.": "大幅提高你的最大生命与法力（取决于祈神技能）。",
+  "Remembers your ancestor as a elementalist, a powerful but fragile mage capable of unleashing destructive spells from a safe distance. This choice is permanent and cannot be undone.": "将你的先祖记忆为元素师——强大但脆弱、能释放毁灭法术的法师。",
+  "You are stampeding forward. Any movement you take into an enemy will trample them backwards, but your stampede will end as soon as you perform any action {{ if you.mutation(\"East Wind's embodiment\") > 0 then return \"besides rampaging, stampeding, or casting spells.\" else return \"besides rampaging or stampeding.\" end }}": "你正在奔踏冲锋。任何朝敌人的移动都会将其踩退，但冲锋结束后你会疲惫。",
+  "You are rapidly regenerating health (at a rate dependent on your max HP) until you have healed the specified amount.": "你正在快速恢复生命（速率取决于最大生命），直到恢复指定数值。",
+  "Your next several ranged attacks will cause you to fire a flurry of additional shots at other targets in sight.": "你接下来的数次远程攻击会向视野内其他目标额外齐射。",
+  "Your next Rampage movement will be instant.": "你的下一次“暴走”移动将是瞬间的。",
+  "You have recently used Divine Exegesis and may repeat the same spell you can this way at a greatly reduced piety cost.": "你刚使用过神谕阐释，可大幅降低虔诚消耗重复同一法术。",
+  "You have recently discharged a full-power jolt of electricity and cannot do this again until you fully heal.": "你刚释放过满功率电击，在完全恢复前无法再次使用。",
+  "You have recently cast Sirocco and cannot cast it again until you spend several turns without moving.": "你刚施放过热风，在连续数回合不移动前无法再次施放。",
+  "Your third eye is open, allowing you to see the magical energy left over from spellcasting and convert it into damaging projectiles.": "你的第三只眼睁开，能看见施法残留的魔力并转化为力量。",
+  "A mass of elemental crystal shrouds your upper body, granting you increased skill with elemental magic and the ability to unleash it in a powerful burst.": "元素水晶覆盖你的上半身，提升元素魔法技能与防护。",
+  "{{ return you.jademantle_crystals_desc()}}": "你身上的玉甲水晶数量。",
+  "You are a hypnogecko, a stealthy lizard who can shed their own tail as a decoy when badly injured.": "你是催眠壁虎，一种能在大伤时断尾作为诱饵的隐秘蜥蜴。",
+  "You have recently shed your tail and need to explore more of the dungeon before it can grow back again.": "你刚断尾，需要探索更多地牢才能重新长出。",
+  "Your body is insubstantial, granting you immunity to constriction, petrification, barbs, sticky flame, webs, nets, and being caught by bolas.": "你的身体虚体化，免疫缠绕、石化、倒刺、黏性火焰、蛛网等。",
+  "A gaseous mixture from a recently-consumed potion swirls within you. Your next melee attack will spew clouds based on the type of potion that was quaffed.": "刚喝下的药水化作气体在你体内翻涌；下一次近战会喷出云雾。",
+  "Your head is a cloud of swirling mist. Any potions you drink will be metabolised into clouds of baleful gas which you can expel with your melee attack.": "你的头是一团翻涌的雾；喝下的药水会代谢成有害气体。",
+  "Powerful equine hybrids who trace their ancestry to the four winds themselves, Gale Centaurs are at their strongest while galloping swiftly towards foes.": "强壮的半人马混血种，自称血脉可追溯至四方之风；疾风半人马在向敌人疾驰冲锋时最为强大。",
+  "Mystics transform their bodies with talismans to be more attuned with magic. Their spells require mobility in combat, but can tap into all four elements.": "秘法师用护符改造身体，以更契合魔法；其法术需要机动性。",
+  "Stalkers transform their bodies with talismans to better deceive and debilitate their enemies. Eventually they can even transform potions into sprays of harmful clouds.": "潜猎者用护符改造身体，以更好地欺骗和削弱敌人；最终能隐匿于暗影。"
